<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:01.066" end="00:00:04.616" style="s2">Cousin, I&#39;m begging you, don&#39;t read my diary.</p>
<p begin="00:00:05.733" end="00:00:08.466" style="s2">Luo Ying, you know I like Duanmu Chen.</p>
<p begin="00:00:08.633" end="00:00:10.483" style="s2">And you still wrote such disgusting diary entries.</p>
<p begin="00:00:10.666" end="00:00:14.383" style="s2">Since you dared to write it, why not let everyone hear it?</p>
<p begin="00:00:14.799" end="00:00:15.416" style="s2">No</p>
<p begin="00:00:15.466" end="00:00:17.850" style="s2">March 1st, sunny</p>
<p begin="00:00:17.866" end="00:00:21.016" style="s2">Today my crush finally talked to me</p>
<p begin="00:00:21.066" end="00:00:22.216" style="s2">I&#39;m so happy</p>
<p begin="00:00:22.533" end="00:00:23.416" style="s2">Let go</p>
<p begin="00:00:23.600" end="00:00:25.583" style="s2">April 5th, cloudy</p>
<p begin="00:00:25.866" end="00:00:28.616" style="s2">I agreed to sweep the floor for my crush</p>
<p begin="00:00:28.666" end="00:00:31.550" style="s2">But the teacher kept me to recite the text</p>
<p begin="00:00:31.600" end="00:00:34.250" style="s2">Will my crush be mad at me</p>
<p begin="00:00:34.799" end="00:00:35.583" style="s2">Stop reading</p>
<p begin="00:00:39.466" end="00:00:41.049" style="s2">Give it to me</p>
<p begin="00:01:07.866" end="00:01:08.516" style="s2">I</p>
<p begin="00:01:09.200" end="00:01:10.250" style="s2">I&#39;m actually not dead</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.333" end="00:01:17.949" style="s2">Where is this</p>
<p begin="00:01:21.599" end="00:01:25.050" style="s2">It was the blood jade that brought my soul</p>
<p begin="00:01:25.066" end="00:01:27.316" style="s2">into this girl&#39;s body that looks just like me</p>
<p begin="00:01:28.000" end="00:01:29.150" style="s2">That&#39;s how I survived</p>
<p begin="00:01:50.800" end="00:01:51.949" style="s2">You&#39;re injured</p>
<p begin="00:01:52.533" end="00:01:53.283" style="s2">Don&#39;t move around</p>
<p begin="00:01:54.533" end="00:01:57.550" style="s2">When I was five I was taken to an assassin training camp</p>
<p begin="00:01:57.866" end="00:02:00.616" style="s2">I fought my way up from the bottom and became the top assassin Rakshasa</p>
<p begin="00:02:00.800" end="00:02:02.216" style="s2">I always wanted to ask them</p>
<p begin="00:02:02.933" end="00:02:04.350" style="s2">Why were they so cruel</p>
<p begin="00:02:04.933" end="00:02:07.716" style="s2">I never expected that in this girl</p>
<p begin="00:02:08.399" end="00:02:09.716" style="s2">I&#39;d feel the warmth of family</p>
<p begin="00:02:10.266" end="00:02:11.183" style="s2">Mom</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.333" end="00:02:14.783" style="s2">You&#39;re the child I risked my life to give birth to</p>
<p begin="00:02:16.399" end="00:02:20.083" style="s2">How could you try to kill yourself over a man</p>
<p begin="00:02:21.466" end="00:02:24.250" style="s2">The doctor said you almost died</p>
<p begin="00:02:25.200" end="00:02:26.350" style="s2">Surviving</p>
<p begin="00:02:26.933" end="00:02:28.216" style="s2">is a miracle</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.599" end="00:02:30.916" style="s2">If you had died</p>
<p begin="00:02:32.666" end="00:02:35.016" style="s2">how could I go on living</p>
<p begin="00:02:40.133" end="00:02:40.516" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry</p>
<p begin="00:02:41.599" end="00:02:42.250" style="s2">I&#39;ve figured it out</p>
<p begin="00:02:43.066" end="00:02:44.616" style="s2">I won&#39;t like Duanmu Chen anymore</p>
<p begin="00:02:45.066" end="00:02:45.949" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry, Mom</p>
<p begin="00:02:51.333" end="00:02:52.250" style="s2">Luo Ying&#39;s family</p>
<p begin="00:02:52.933" end="00:02:53.933" style="s2">Your hospital fees</p>
<p begin="00:02:54.100" end="00:02:56.216" style="s2">and today&#39;s medical bills, when will you pay</p>
<p begin="00:02:56.666" end="00:02:57.450" style="s2">Miss nurse</p>
<p begin="00:02:58.133" end="00:03:02.250" style="s2">Sorry, we&#39;ll figure something out</p>
<p begin="00:03:02.533" end="00:03:05.450" style="s2">Just thinking about it, can money fall from the sky</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.733" end="00:03:07.183" style="s2">You still won&#39;t admit it when I call you out</p>
<p begin="00:03:07.333" end="00:03:09.050" style="s2">Look at how poor you are</p>
<p begin="00:03:09.866" end="00:03:11.450" style="s2">That jacket your mom&#39;s wearing</p>
<p begin="00:03:11.733" end="00:03:13.816" style="s2">Which garbage dump did you pick it from</p>
<p begin="00:03:14.266" end="00:03:16.916" style="s2">It&#39;s so faded you can&#39;t even tell what it looked like</p>
<p begin="00:03:17.866" end="00:03:18.783" style="s2">You&#39;re asking for it</p>
<p begin="00:03:19.599" end="00:03:23.150" style="s2">She&#39;s just a little brat, why should I be afraid of her</p>
<p begin="00:03:25.733" end="00:03:28.250" style="s2">I&#39;ll show you a way out of pity.</p>
<p begin="00:03:28.800" end="00:03:33.050" style="s2">Turn right out of the hospital. The coins in the beggars&#39; bowls there</p>
<p begin="00:03:33.200" end="00:03:35.050" style="s2">are more than what&#39;s in your pockets.</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.733" end="00:03:40.649" style="s2">What, you want to hit me?</p>
<p begin="00:03:40.800" end="00:03:43.316" style="s2">Look at your skinny arms and legs.</p>
<p begin="00:03:48.800" end="00:03:50.483" style="s2">Sister, brother scraped together money for medical</p>
<p begin="00:03:53.066" end="00:03:53.416" style="s2">expenses</p>
<p begin="00:03:54.000" end="00:03:54.883" style="s2">for treatment.</p>
<p begin="00:03:55.066" end="00:03:58.733" style="s2">Big brother Luofeng gave up college so his sister could attend a top school.</p>
<p begin="00:03:58.900" end="00:04:00.483" style="s2">He gave up his chance to go to university.</p>
<p begin="00:04:06.266" end="00:04:06.883" style="s2">Good girl.</p>
<p begin="00:04:07.733" end="00:04:09.050" style="s2">Let go.</p>
<p begin="00:04:09.733" end="00:04:11.016" style="s2">Everyone calls me Rakshasa.</p>
<p begin="00:04:11.200" end="00:04:13.983" style="s2">First time someone called me good girl.</p>
<p begin="00:04:15.866" end="00:04:18.216" style="s2">Nurse, are you okay, nurse?</p>
<p begin="00:04:20.666" end="00:04:23.933" style="s2">Sorry, my daughter is in a bad mood.</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.933" end="00:04:27.183" style="s2">Can you just hit people because you&#39;re in a bad mood?</p>
<p begin="00:04:28.933" end="00:04:29.550" style="s2">Nurse!</p>
<p begin="00:04:30.666" end="00:04:34.250" style="s2">Feng&#39;er, has your dad&#39;s unpaid wages from the construction site</p>
<p begin="00:04:34.399" end="00:04:35.150" style="s2">been paid?</p>
<p begin="00:04:37.200" end="00:04:37.816" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="00:04:38.133" end="00:04:39.316" style="s2">Where did the money come from?</p>
<p begin="00:04:40.933" end="00:04:43.816" style="s2">Luochen heard his sister fell from the building and needed surgery.</p>
<p begin="00:04:44.000" end="00:04:46.483" style="s2">In desperation, he joined an underground car race.</p>
<p begin="00:04:47.333" end="00:04:48.749" style="s2">He got a 5,000 yuan advance from the boss.</p>
<p begin="00:04:50.000" end="00:04:50.883" style="s2">What was the bet?</p>
<p begin="00:04:51.333" end="00:04:53.816" style="s2">How did sister know the rules of underground racing?</p>
<p begin="00:04:54.800" end="00:04:56.916" style="s2">Win and get the prize money.</p>
<p begin="00:04:57.333" end="00:04:58.483" style="s2">Lose...</p>
<p begin="00:05:00.400" end="00:05:01.716" style="s2">Lose...</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.066" end="00:05:04.216" style="s2">Leave a hand behind.</p>
<p begin="00:05:05.066" end="00:05:05.983" style="s2">What?</p>
<p begin="00:05:09.200" end="00:05:09.816" style="s2">Mom.</p>
<p begin="00:05:11.200" end="00:05:11.550" style="s2">Come.</p>
<p begin="00:05:13.333" end="00:05:13.949" style="s2">Take care of Mom.</p>
<p begin="00:05:14.533" end="00:05:15.150" style="s2">Where are you going?</p>
<p begin="00:05:17.866" end="00:05:18.750" style="s2">To save second brother.</p>
<p begin="00:05:20.133" end="00:05:20.483" style="s2">You...</p>
<p begin="00:05:25.066" end="00:05:28.600" style="s2">Young Master Chen.</p>
<p begin="00:05:30.933" end="00:05:32.516" style="s2">Luochen, accept your loss.</p>
<p begin="00:05:32.666" end="00:05:35.416" style="s2">You bet your right hand, so I have to cripple it.</p>
<p begin="00:05:36.400" end="00:05:38.116" style="s2">You tampered with the tires.</p>
<p begin="00:05:38.933" end="00:05:40.083" style="s2">On the last curve,</p>
<p begin="00:05:40.533" end="00:05:42.650" style="s2">I saw gripping spikes shoot out of your car.</p>
<p begin="00:05:43.200" end="00:05:43.716" style="s2">Otherwise,</p>
<p begin="00:05:44.233" end="00:05:45.233" style="s2">you think you could win?</p>
<p begin="00:05:45.566" end="00:05:47.450" style="s2">Duanmu Chen, you&#39;re really something else.</p>
<p begin="00:05:48.266" end="00:05:48.916" style="s2">Playing dirty.</p>
<p begin="00:05:49.599" end="00:05:50.483" style="s2">Despicable and shameless.</p>
<p begin="00:05:53.333" end="00:05:53.983" style="s2">Evidence.</p>
<p begin="00:06:01.799" end="00:06:03.000" style="s2">Losing and not admitting it</p>
<p begin="00:06:03.599" end="00:06:05.016" style="s2">Then blaming the winner</p>
<p begin="00:06:06.133" end="00:06:08.466" style="s2">That breaks the rules of the street</p>
<p begin="00:06:30.800" end="00:06:31.316" style="s2">Stop</p>
<p begin="00:06:52.400" end="00:06:55.683" style="s2">Luo Ying, weren&#39;t you in the hospital after jumping for love?</p>
<p begin="00:06:55.733" end="00:06:59.550" style="s2">What, heard Young Master Chen is here, so you stopped treatment?</p>
<p begin="00:06:59.733" end="00:07:02.349" style="s2">Rushed over to suck up to him</p>
<p begin="00:07:02.533" end="00:07:03.416" style="s2">Let my brother go</p>
<p begin="00:07:03.599" end="00:07:04.750" style="s2">A bet is a bet</p>
<p begin="00:07:04.933" end="00:07:05.716" style="s2">Your brother lost</p>
<p begin="00:07:05.999" end="00:07:07.183" style="s2">This hand</p>
<p begin="00:07:08.133" end="00:07:08.750" style="s2">Is mine</p>
<p begin="00:07:10.400" end="00:07:11.283" style="s2">Then I&#39;ll race you</p>
<p begin="00:07:14.233" end="00:07:18.216" style="s2">You&#39;re a little girl without even a driver&#39;s license</p>
<p begin="00:07:18.266" end="00:07:20.116" style="s2">You think you&#39;re worthy to race Young Master Duanmu</p>
<p begin="00:07:20.400" end="00:07:21.450" style="s2">That&#39;s hilarious</p>
<p begin="00:07:23.333" end="00:07:23.983" style="s2">I won</p>
<p begin="00:07:24.666" end="00:07:25.416" style="s2">Let him go</p>
<p begin="00:07:26.666" end="00:07:28.516" style="s2">Chenzi, your sister must have hit her head</p>
<p begin="00:07:28.533" end="00:07:29.683" style="s2">Worse than before</p>
<p begin="00:07:33.066" end="00:07:33.416" style="s2">Go home</p>
<p begin="00:07:39.999" end="00:07:41.416" style="s2">Girl, do you even know</p>
<p begin="00:07:41.599" end="00:07:43.849" style="s2">Duanmu Chen has been champion of our Heilin City</p>
<p begin="00:07:43.999" end="00:07:47.316" style="s2">For three years straight in racing. Challenging him on Panlong Mountain</p>
<p begin="00:07:48.133" end="00:07:48.916" style="s2">Only your brother has</p>
<p begin="00:07:51.200" end="00:07:52.083" style="s2">So what</p>
<p begin="00:07:52.666" end="00:07:54.883" style="s2">Nobody knows who&#39;ll win yet</p>
<p begin="00:07:55.566" end="00:07:57.416" style="s2">Young Master Chen, look at her</p>
<p begin="00:07:57.466" end="00:08:00.249" style="s2">She&#39;d risk her life just to get your attention</p>
<p begin="00:08:00.600" end="00:08:02.066" style="s2">Did you just escape from the mental hospital</p>
<p begin="00:08:02.233" end="00:08:05.416" style="s2">I started racing Panlong Mountain at fifteen</p>
<p begin="00:08:05.599" end="00:08:08.750" style="s2">Won ninety-seven races here</p>
<p begin="00:08:08.800" end="00:08:10.483" style="s2">Nobody&#39;s broken my record</p>
<p begin="00:08:11.866" end="00:08:13.283" style="s2">What do you have to compete with</p>
<p begin="00:08:13.733" end="00:08:16.483" style="s2">But since you came to me yourself</p>
<p begin="00:08:16.666" end="00:08:17.716" style="s2">Then</p>
<p begin="00:08:20.366" end="00:08:21.683" style="s2">Let&#39;s bet your legs</p>
<p begin="00:08:22.533" end="00:08:23.050" style="s2">If you lose</p>
<p begin="00:08:25.066" end="00:08:26.216" style="s2">I want one of your legs</p>
<p begin="00:08:27.466" end="00:08:31.283" style="s2">Stay by my side, serve me tea and water</p>
<p begin="00:08:31.866" end="00:08:32.216" style="s2">Little</p>
<p begin="00:08:32.933" end="00:08:33.283" style="s2">Limp</p>
<p begin="00:08:33.999" end="00:08:34.349" style="s2">Girl</p>
<p begin="00:08:37.466" end="00:08:38.349" style="s2">Deal</p>
<p begin="00:08:39.466" end="00:08:40.783" style="s2">I&#39;ll take you to change into a professional racing suit</p>
<p begin="00:08:41.999" end="00:08:44.216" style="s2">No need for all that to deal with him</p>
<p begin="00:08:44.266" end="00:08:46.483" style="s2">You really must have hit your head</p>
<p begin="00:08:46.800" end="00:08:48.750" style="s2">Is there something wrong with the Luo family&#39;s ancestral grave feng shui</p>
<p begin="00:08:49.066" end="00:08:51.016" style="s2">Why does everyone keep getting into trouble</p>
<p begin="00:09:23.866" end="00:09:27.000" style="s2">Luo Ying&#39;s car is worth about a hundred thousand. Its appearance and performance</p>
<p begin="00:09:27.166" end="00:09:28.866" style="s2">All pretty average, Young Master Chen&#39;s car</p>
<p begin="00:09:29.033" end="00:09:32.083" style="s2">priced between 1.9 and 2.3 million</p>
<p begin="00:09:32.666" end="00:09:34.083" style="s2">How can you even compare?</p>
<p begin="00:09:35.033" end="00:09:38.216" style="s2">Young Master Chen is already ten meters ahead, Luo Ying just started</p>
<p begin="00:09:38.400" end="00:09:42.483" style="s2">The price gap is huge, the sports car specs gap is huge</p>
<p begin="00:09:43.733" end="00:09:44.916" style="s2">Luo Ying wants to beat Duanmu Chen</p>
<p begin="00:09:45.999" end="00:09:47.550" style="s2">She has to consider her car</p>
<p begin="00:09:47.733" end="00:09:49.949" style="s2">It&#39;s four or five times worse than Duanmu Chen&#39;s car</p>
<p begin="00:09:50.666" end="00:09:51.983" style="s2">She can only win purely on driving skill</p>
<p begin="00:09:52.933" end="00:09:53.450" style="s2">But this</p>
<p begin="00:09:54.533" end="00:09:55.716" style="s2">is absolutely impossible</p>
<p begin="00:10:03.966" end="00:10:07.150" style="s2">Young Master Chen is too good, he&#39;s left Luo Ying far behind</p>
<p begin="00:10:14.633" end="00:10:16.116" style="s2">I&#39;m about to reach the finish line</p>
<p begin="00:10:17.200" end="00:10:18.783" style="s2">Boring children&#39;s game</p>
<p begin="00:10:20.233" end="00:10:20.750" style="s2">It&#39;s time to end this</p>
<p begin="00:10:28.666" end="00:10:30.750" style="s2">What, Luo Ying caught up?</p>
<p begin="00:10:30.933" end="00:10:33.450" style="s2">How is that possible, only world-class racers</p>
<p begin="00:10:34.233" end="00:10:36.216" style="s2">could catch up with such a huge gap</p>
<p begin="00:10:36.933" end="00:10:37.816" style="s2">This little cutie</p>
<p begin="00:10:38.533" end="00:10:40.516" style="s2">How can she have such terrifying driving skills</p>
<p begin="00:10:44.666" end="00:10:46.916" style="s2">If this continues, I&#39;ll lose</p>
<p begin="00:10:50.400" end="00:10:51.550" style="s2">I am Duanmu Chen</p>
<p begin="00:10:52.933" end="00:10:56.750" style="s2">Duanmu Chen, who won the Black Forest City racing championship three times in a row</p>
<p begin="00:10:56.800" end="00:10:57.416" style="s2">How could I</p>
<p begin="00:10:58.666" end="00:11:01.416" style="s2">just lose to this little cutie like this</p>
<p begin="00:11:10.133" end="00:11:13.050" style="s2">What a waste, can&#39;t even match one of my hands</p>
<p begin="00:11:18.800" end="00:11:22.883" style="s2">Luo Ying, let me give you one last lesson</p>
<p begin="00:11:23.200" end="00:11:27.150" style="s2">Racing isn&#39;t just about driving skill</p>
<p begin="00:11:32.133" end="00:11:33.016" style="s2">Playing dirty</p>
<p begin="00:11:40.666" end="00:11:42.916" style="s2">Trying to wreck my car so I can&#39;t race</p>
<p begin="00:11:44.800" end="00:11:45.949" style="s2">I give up</p>
<p begin="00:11:51.466" end="00:11:55.150" style="s2">No, don&#39;t, Luo Ying</p>
<p begin="00:11:55.200" end="00:11:56.349" style="s2">You&#39;re not human</p>
<p begin="00:12:03.333" end="00:12:06.083" style="s2">Idiot, never finish things off</p>
<p begin="00:12:12.400" end="00:12:16.883" style="s2">When the two sports cars entered the final blind spot of the surveillance</p>
<p begin="00:12:16.933" end="00:12:21.150" style="s2">Young Master Chen left Luo Ying far behind</p>
<p begin="00:12:21.200" end="00:12:21.983" style="s2">It&#39;s a sure loss</p>
<p begin="00:12:22.533" end="00:12:25.183" style="s2">I only came to watch because I heard Mr. Duanmu was racing</p>
<p begin="00:12:25.599" end="00:12:28.216" style="s2">I didn&#39;t expect today&#39;s race to be so boring</p>
<p begin="00:12:28.633" end="00:12:30.600" style="s2">Haven&#39;t seen such a boring race in a long time</p>
<p begin="00:12:30.766" end="00:12:33.450" style="s2">Not watching anymore, rather go home and watch a ball game</p>
<p begin="00:12:43.966" end="00:12:45.150" style="s2">Yingying</p>
<p begin="00:12:45.466" end="00:12:46.650" style="s2">is racing against Duanmu Chen</p>
<p begin="00:12:47.566" end="00:12:49.000" style="s2">Duanmu Chen is far ahead</p>
<p begin="00:12:49.166" end="00:12:51.183" style="s2">Your sister&#39;s legs and your hands are both going to be gone</p>
<p begin="00:12:52.666" end="00:12:54.249" style="s2">I&#39;ve thought it through, even if I have to take a loan</p>
<p begin="00:12:54.533" end="00:12:55.983" style="s2">I&#39;ll gather the surgery fees for you</p>
<p begin="00:12:59.999" end="00:13:03.683" style="s2">Luo Ying isn&#39;t good enough, she can&#39;t beat Young Master Chen</p>
<p begin="00:13:04.400" end="00:13:05.816" style="s2">With this time</p>
<p begin="00:13:07.333" end="00:13:08.750" style="s2">better call an ambulance first</p>
<p begin="00:13:14.800" end="00:13:15.583" style="s2">Look, everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:13:16.133" end="00:13:17.450" style="s2">Young Master Chen&#39;s car.</p>
<p begin="00:13:18.133" end="00:13:18.750" style="s2">It&#39;s here.</p>
<p begin="00:13:22.666" end="00:13:23.016" style="s2">No way.</p>
<p begin="00:13:23.733" end="00:13:24.750" style="s2">That&#39;s Luo Ying&#39;s car.</p>
<p begin="00:13:26.800" end="00:13:27.683" style="s2">How is that possible?</p>
<p begin="00:13:34.400" end="00:13:35.316" style="s2">It really is Luo Ying&#39;s car.</p>
<p begin="00:13:37.866" end="00:13:39.683" style="s2">Luo Chen, that&#39;s my car.</p>
<p begin="00:13:39.733" end="00:13:40.916" style="s2">The car I lent to your sister.</p>
<p begin="00:13:41.066" end="00:13:43.266" style="s2">She drove my car and beat Duanmu Chen.</p>
<p begin="00:13:44.266" end="00:13:44.466" style="s2">She won.</p>
<p begin="00:13:44.633" end="00:13:46.750" style="s2">She won, did you see that?</p>
<p begin="00:13:48.133" end="00:13:49.950" style="s2">I&#39;m so happy.</p>
<p begin="00:13:52.266" end="00:13:53.016" style="s2">Luo Ying.</p>
<p begin="00:13:53.600" end="00:13:58.483" style="s2">She actually beat Young Master Chen, the Black Forest racing champion.</p>
<p begin="00:14:00.266" end="00:14:02.616" style="s2">Weren&#39;t you just mocking Luo Ying?</p>
<p begin="00:14:03.999" end="00:14:06.383" style="s2">Why aren&#39;t you laughing now? Don&#39;t you like to laugh?</p>
<p begin="00:14:08.933" end="00:14:10.650" style="s2">Stop joking, go find my sister.</p>
<p begin="00:14:11.066" end="00:14:11.416" style="s2">Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:14:14.933" end="00:14:16.600" style="s2">Sister, you don&#39;t even have a driver&#39;s license.</p>
<p begin="00:14:16.766" end="00:14:18.083" style="s2">When did you learn to race?</p>
<p begin="00:14:18.666" end="00:14:19.850" style="s2">Amazing, just amazing.</p>
<p begin="00:14:20.300" end="00:14:20.783" style="s2">Luo Ying.</p>
<p begin="00:14:20.799" end="00:14:22.216" style="s2">You&#39;re really amazing.</p>
<p begin="00:14:22.799" end="00:14:24.616" style="s2">You guys go down the mountain first, I have something to do.</p>
<p begin="00:14:24.799" end="00:14:25.416" style="s2">See you in a bit.</p>
<p begin="00:14:38.133" end="00:14:38.750" style="s2">Not dead.</p>
<p begin="00:14:40.933" end="00:14:43.416" style="s2">Good that you&#39;re not dead, saves the Luo family trouble.</p>
<p begin="00:14:50.266" end="00:14:53.016" style="s2">I don&#39;t know why, but tonight</p>
<p begin="00:14:53.600" end="00:14:55.149" style="s2">makes me feel uneasy.</p>
<p begin="00:15:05.066" end="00:15:07.183" style="s2">Leader, the EMF detector</p>
<p begin="00:15:07.200" end="00:15:08.916" style="s2">only showed Rakshasa&#39;s vague location.</p>
<p begin="00:15:09.600" end="00:15:11.583" style="s2">It disappeared here.</p>
<p begin="00:15:11.600" end="00:15:14.750" style="s2">No way, he can find us even after switching bodies.</p>
<p begin="00:15:15.333" end="00:15:16.600" style="s2">How did I not know before</p>
<p begin="00:15:16.766" end="00:15:18.750" style="s2">that the Crimson Flame Legion leader was this hard to deal with?</p>
<p begin="00:15:31.466" end="00:15:32.349" style="s2">We&#39;ve been discovered.</p>
<p begin="00:15:33.733" end="00:15:35.950" style="s2">This body is too weak.</p>
<p begin="00:15:35.999" end="00:15:38.349" style="s2">If it were my past life, I might still be able to fight head-on.</p>
<p begin="00:15:38.799" end="00:15:39.683" style="s2">But now...</p>
<p begin="00:15:40.666" end="00:15:41.583" style="s2">Who are you?</p>
<p begin="00:15:43.999" end="00:15:45.950" style="s2">You don&#39;t move, I won&#39;t speak.</p>
<p begin="00:15:47.600" end="00:15:48.116" style="s2">Leader.</p>
<p begin="00:15:49.066" end="00:15:51.950" style="s2">You two have been holding that pose for three minutes.</p>
<p begin="00:15:52.133" end="00:15:53.983" style="s2">Tell me, who are you?</p>
<p begin="00:15:54.799" end="00:15:57.316" style="s2">To successfully retreat after killing someone,</p>
<p begin="00:15:57.333" end="00:15:59.049" style="s2">I can play the part of a socialite.</p>
<p begin="00:15:59.600" end="00:16:01.316" style="s2">I can also play the part of an ordinary student.</p>
<p begin="00:16:03.999" end="00:16:07.316" style="s2">Big brother, I came up the mountain to find my brother.</p>
<p begin="00:16:07.733" end="00:16:09.316" style="s2">I just happened to pass by here.</p>
<p begin="00:16:09.600" end="00:16:11.016" style="s2">I didn&#39;t see anything</p>
<p begin="00:16:11.600" end="00:16:13.149" style="s2">Can you let me go?</p>
<p begin="00:16:14.933" end="00:16:15.850" style="s2">Her voice is so soft</p>
<p begin="00:16:16.533" end="00:16:19.850" style="s2">As soft as her face. What about other places?</p>
<p begin="00:16:20.533" end="00:16:21.850" style="s2">Are they that soft too?</p>
<p begin="00:16:22.799" end="00:16:25.316" style="s2">This woman is something else. First time meeting her</p>
<p begin="00:16:25.733" end="00:16:27.049" style="s2">And she already makes me think this way</p>
<p begin="00:16:28.266" end="00:16:32.116" style="s2">What&#39;s going on? Why does his face look worse and worse?</p>
<p begin="00:16:33.999" end="00:16:35.950" style="s2">Thank you, big brother. You&#39;re such a good person</p>
<p begin="00:16:38.300" end="00:16:40.083" style="s2">Lu Heng, you want to catch me?</p>
<p begin="00:16:40.266" end="00:16:41.416" style="s2">In your next life</p>
<p begin="00:16:43.333" end="00:16:43.983" style="s2">Boss</p>
<p begin="00:16:45.066" end="00:16:46.516" style="s2">You actually made a move yourself</p>
<p begin="00:16:47.200" end="00:16:49.716" style="s2">You ran into a woman, didn&#39;t kill her</p>
<p begin="00:16:49.733" end="00:16:50.650" style="s2">And you even let her go</p>
<p begin="00:16:51.733" end="00:16:53.716" style="s2">This is a sign of red rain falling from the sky</p>
<p begin="00:16:53.999" end="00:16:54.783" style="s2">You got a problem with that?</p>
<p begin="00:16:57.200" end="00:16:58.249" style="s2">Look into her identity</p>
<p begin="00:16:59.200" end="00:16:59.716" style="s2">Yes</p>
<p begin="00:17:01.733" end="00:17:02.616" style="s2">Let&#39;s go home</p>
<p begin="00:17:05.766" end="00:17:08.733" style="s2">You scared me to death</p>
<p begin="00:17:15.466" end="00:17:18.349" style="s2">Why didn&#39;t you say earlier that Duanmu Chen&#39;s car rolled down?</p>
<p begin="00:17:18.966" end="00:17:20.333" style="s2">Luo Mengdie just pulled him up</p>
<p begin="00:17:20.666" end="00:17:21.666" style="s2">He&#39;s all bruised and swollen</p>
<p begin="00:17:21.833" end="00:17:23.416" style="s2">It&#39;s hilarious</p>
<p begin="00:17:26.266" end="00:17:28.866" style="s2">But don&#39;t do anything that dangerous again</p>
<p begin="00:17:29.333" end="00:17:30.216" style="s2">I can beat him</p>
<p begin="00:17:30.266" end="00:17:30.999" style="s2">Even if you can, no</p>
<p begin="00:17:31.600" end="00:17:34.333" style="s2">There are always exceptions. You got lucky today</p>
<p begin="00:17:34.500" end="00:17:35.133" style="s2">He flipped it himself</p>
<p begin="00:17:35.800" end="00:17:40.483" style="s2">Even with full confidence, Second Brother doesn&#39;t want you risking your life</p>
<p begin="00:17:41.733" end="00:17:44.883" style="s2">Having lived two lives, the phrase I&#39;ve heard most</p>
<p begin="00:17:45.066" end="00:17:46.216" style="s2">Is that you must survive</p>
<p begin="00:17:47.066" end="00:17:49.416" style="s2">And become the ruler of the world</p>
<p begin="00:17:50.133" end="00:17:53.683" style="s2">This is the first time I&#39;ve heard that even with full confidence</p>
<p begin="00:17:53.999" end="00:17:55.683" style="s2">I don&#39;t need to risk my life</p>
<p begin="00:17:56.133" end="00:17:57.933" style="s2">Alright, let&#39;s go</p>
<p begin="00:17:59.466" end="00:17:59.816" style="s2">Okay</p>
<p begin="00:18:04.133" end="00:18:04.916" style="s2">Guodong</p>
<p begin="00:18:05.466" end="00:18:07.850" style="s2">It&#39;s not that I, as your big brother, won&#39;t help you</p>
<p begin="00:18:08.133" end="00:18:12.383" style="s2">But your Luo Ying and Luo Chen caused too much trouble</p>
<p begin="00:18:15.200" end="00:18:16.249" style="s2">The Duanmu family has spoken</p>
<p begin="00:18:16.533" end="00:18:18.916" style="s2">Either hand over Luo Ying&#39;s two hands</p>
<p begin="00:18:19.466" end="00:18:23.983" style="s2">That can race cars, or terminate all our Luo Group&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:18:23.999" end="00:18:25.983" style="s2">hundred-million partnerships</p>
<p begin="00:18:28.400" end="00:18:31.149" style="s2">Trade her hands for the Luo family&#39;s peace</p>
<p begin="00:18:31.333" end="00:18:33.583" style="s2">This is already the best deal</p>
<p begin="00:18:34.533" end="00:18:35.183" style="s2">Big brother</p>
<p begin="00:18:35.733" end="00:18:39.183" style="s2">The kids came back and said it was an accident during the race</p>
<p begin="00:18:39.466" end="00:18:41.049" style="s2">Young Master Chen injured himself</p>
<p begin="00:18:41.066" end="00:18:43.950" style="s2">You can&#39;t blame this all on Yingying alone.</p>
<p begin="00:18:44.400" end="00:18:45.450" style="s2">Second Uncle.</p>
<p begin="00:18:45.866" end="00:18:49.450" style="s2">Get this straight—it was your business that failed.</p>
<p begin="00:18:49.733" end="00:18:51.850" style="s2">If my dad hadn&#39;t been helping you all along,</p>
<p begin="00:18:51.866" end="00:18:54.999" style="s2">paying the loan shark interest, your whole family</p>
<p begin="00:18:55.166" end="00:18:58.383" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t be sitting here talking so comfortably now.</p>
<p begin="00:19:00.933" end="00:19:03.049" style="s2">If the group goes under because of this,</p>
<p begin="00:19:03.999" end="00:19:07.316" style="s2">who&#39;s going to care about you then?</p>
<p begin="00:19:10.533" end="00:19:11.950" style="s2">Dad, what are you—</p>
<p begin="00:19:14.133" end="00:19:14.750" style="s2">Dad.</p>
<p begin="00:19:16.933" end="00:19:17.550" style="s2">Don&#39;t talk.</p>
<p begin="00:19:20.133" end="00:19:20.750" style="s2">Big Brother.</p>
<p begin="00:19:21.466" end="00:19:22.483" style="s2">I&#39;m begging you.</p>
<p begin="00:19:24.533" end="00:19:26.483" style="s2">She can&#39;t just end like this.</p>
<p begin="00:19:27.200" end="00:19:28.383" style="s2">Mengdie has connections.</p>
<p begin="00:19:28.933" end="00:19:31.183" style="s2">She knows people—have her beg Young Master Chen again.</p>
<p begin="00:19:32.666" end="00:19:33.049" style="s2">Beg him</p>
<p begin="00:19:34.266" end="00:19:35.450" style="s2">to give your niece a way out.</p>
<p begin="00:19:36.133" end="00:19:36.750" style="s2">Please?</p>
<p begin="00:19:38.666" end="00:19:41.950" style="s2">Luo Ying offended Young Master Chen completely.</p>
<p begin="00:19:42.666" end="00:19:43.583" style="s2">I can&#39;t save her.</p>
<p begin="00:19:44.400" end="00:19:45.450" style="s2">Dad, don&#39;t beg him.</p>
<p begin="00:19:47.999" end="00:19:50.349" style="s2">What a bunch of ungrateful wolves.</p>
<p begin="00:19:50.933" end="00:19:52.083" style="s2">Our family&#39;s money—</p>
<p begin="00:19:52.133" end="00:19:55.416" style="s2">did it blow in with the wind? We raised you for nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:19:56.400" end="00:19:57.450" style="s2">We offer kindness and you refuse it.</p>
<p begin="00:19:58.533" end="00:19:59.049" style="s2">Dad.</p>
<p begin="00:19:59.733" end="00:20:01.183" style="s2">Why are you still being polite to them?</p>
<p begin="00:20:01.999" end="00:20:02.650" style="s2">Guodong.</p>
<p begin="00:20:03.466" end="00:20:05.450" style="s2">Are you sure that to protect Luo Ying</p>
<p begin="00:20:05.999" end="00:20:08.516" style="s2">you&#39;ll drag your whole family down? Think again.</p>
<p begin="00:20:12.533" end="00:20:14.650" style="s2">Big Brother, I&#39;ve made up my mind.</p>
<p begin="00:20:15.066" end="00:20:16.483" style="s2">My daughter is my life.</p>
<p begin="00:20:17.200" end="00:20:18.116" style="s2">She&#39;s still young.</p>
<p begin="00:20:19.200" end="00:20:20.999" style="s2">Just cut off my hand and let her go.</p>
<p begin="00:20:21.166" end="00:20:21.716" style="s2">Will that work?</p>
<p begin="00:20:22.666" end="00:20:23.366" style="s2">Dad.</p>
<p begin="00:20:23.666" end="00:20:24.616" style="s2">Dad, you&#39;re old.</p>
<p begin="00:20:25.466" end="00:20:26.349" style="s2">Cut off mine instead.</p>
<p begin="00:20:27.866" end="00:20:28.483" style="s2">I can take it.</p>
<p begin="00:20:29.466" end="00:20:31.416" style="s2">I&#39;m not as smart as Big Brother and Little Sister.</p>
<p begin="00:20:31.866" end="00:20:32.483" style="s2">Cut off mine.</p>
<p begin="00:20:32.533" end="00:20:33.683" style="s2">This is none of your business.</p>
<p begin="00:20:36.400" end="00:20:37.016" style="s2">You two—</p>
<p begin="00:20:37.333" end="00:20:38.516" style="s2">Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:20:40.133" end="00:20:41.850" style="s2">Since you&#39;ve chosen this path,</p>
<p begin="00:20:42.400" end="00:20:44.516" style="s2">don&#39;t blame me for being ruthless as your big brother.</p>
<p begin="00:20:48.666" end="00:20:52.650" style="s2">Earlier I let you have a few days&#39; grace for my sake.</p>
<p begin="00:20:52.933" end="00:20:53.716" style="s2">Now</p>
<p begin="00:20:54.533" end="00:20:55.716" style="s2">no more grace.</p>
<p begin="00:20:57.066" end="00:21:00.383" style="s2">You little bitch, even with all these people protecting you</p>
<p begin="00:21:00.533" end="00:21:01.583" style="s2">what good will it do?</p>
<p begin="00:21:01.866" end="00:21:02.650" style="s2">Today</p>
<p begin="00:21:03.200" end="00:21:04.383" style="s2">no one can save you</p>
<p begin="00:21:05.866" end="00:21:09.016" style="s2">You... you all need to leave, hurry!</p>
<p begin="00:21:09.066" end="00:21:09.683" style="s2">Don&#39;t be afraid</p>
<p begin="00:21:10.533" end="00:21:11.149" style="s2">I&#39;m here</p>
<p begin="00:21:11.733" end="00:21:13.149" style="s2">They won&#39;t hurt you</p>
<p begin="00:21:13.600" end="00:21:16.083" style="s2">Sis, these debt collectors are ruthless</p>
<p begin="00:21:16.533" end="00:21:17.583" style="s2">They&#39;ll chop off your hands and feet without a second thought</p>
<p begin="00:21:18.400" end="00:21:20.083" style="s2">You need to go, I&#39;ll deal with them</p>
<p begin="00:21:28.133" end="00:21:29.016" style="s2">They got here so fast</p>
<p begin="00:21:41.200" end="00:21:44.083" style="s2">None of you are getting away today</p>
<p begin="00:21:46.400" end="00:21:48.750" style="s2">Boss, just give us a few more days</p>
<p begin="00:21:49.066" end="00:21:51.533" style="s2">Once I get some money and get the company running again</p>
<p begin="00:21:51.700" end="00:21:52.750" style="s2">I&#39;ll pay you back</p>
<p begin="00:21:54.133" end="00:21:55.416" style="s2">You old bastard</p>
<p begin="00:21:55.999" end="00:22:00.483" style="s2">Company running again? You&#39;re about to declare bankruptcy</p>
<p begin="00:22:01.200" end="00:22:04.750" style="s2">You&#39;re just an empty shell company, running my ass</p>
<p begin="00:22:04.799" end="00:22:06.383" style="s2">You pay up today</p>
<p begin="00:22:06.933" end="00:22:11.416" style="s2">Or I&#39;ll take your son and daughter and sell their kidneys</p>
<p begin="00:22:14.133" end="00:22:15.049" style="s2">Mom</p>
<p begin="00:22:15.866" end="00:22:17.816" style="s2">Leave the kids out of this</p>
<p begin="00:22:18.533" end="00:22:20.483" style="s2">We&#39;ll mortgage the company to you</p>
<p begin="00:22:21.333" end="00:22:22.750" style="s2">Don&#39;t touch the kids</p>
<p begin="00:22:27.066" end="00:22:28.516" style="s2">Say another word and I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:22:28.533" end="00:22:31.950" style="s2">sell you to a brothel to earn money for us</p>
<p begin="00:22:32.533" end="00:22:33.816" style="s2">Yingying, you all need to run!</p>
<p begin="00:22:34.400" end="00:22:35.283" style="s2">Get lost</p>
<p begin="00:22:36.666" end="00:22:38.349" style="s2">Don&#39;t test me or I&#39;ll chop off your hand</p>
<p begin="00:22:41.300" end="00:22:42.349" style="s2">Just chopping off a hand</p>
<p begin="00:22:42.933" end="00:22:43.950" style="s2">is too boring</p>
<p begin="00:22:45.333" end="00:22:46.216" style="s2">Just chopping off a hand</p>
<p begin="00:22:47.200" end="00:22:47.816" style="s2">is too boring</p>
<p begin="00:22:48.799" end="00:22:50.750" style="s2">Is this really the Luo family&#39;s cowardly daughter?</p>
<p begin="00:22:51.333" end="00:22:53.283" style="s2">Her eyes look like she wants to kill someone</p>
<p begin="00:22:54.533" end="00:22:55.283" style="s2">Girl</p>
<p begin="00:22:55.999" end="00:23:00.083" style="s2">Then tell me, what would be interesting?</p>
<p begin="00:23:00.400" end="00:23:03.149" style="s2">Of course, it&#39;s like this</p>
<p begin="00:23:06.533" end="00:23:07.149" style="s2">Yingying</p>
<p begin="00:23:08.266" end="00:23:09.183" style="s2">Chopping off a hand</p>
<p begin="00:23:09.733" end="00:23:12.249" style="s2">Of course it&#39;s only interesting if you do it piece by piece</p>
<p begin="00:23:14.266" end="00:23:15.416" style="s2">Or maybe</p>
<p begin="00:23:18.533" end="00:23:19.716" style="s2">you prefer something more direct</p>
<p begin="00:23:20.933" end="00:23:23.450" style="s2">Dad, has Luo Ying gone crazy?</p>
<p begin="00:23:25.200" end="00:23:28.116" style="s2">Guodong, look at what your daughter has done</p>
<p begin="00:23:28.533" end="00:23:31.183" style="s2">She&#39;s going to get our Luo family charged with murder</p>
<p begin="00:23:31.333" end="00:23:32.883" style="s2">Make her stop right now</p>
<p begin="00:23:32.933" end="00:23:34.650" style="s2">Boss, this girl&#39;s not right</p>
<p begin="00:23:35.066" end="00:23:36.650" style="s2">She acts more like a gangster than we do</p>
<p begin="00:23:38.133" end="00:23:39.450" style="s2">Stop it!</p>
<p begin="00:23:40.400" end="00:23:42.083" style="s2">What&#39;s wrong with you?</p>
<p begin="00:23:42.533" end="00:23:43.983" style="s2">Mom wants me to let them go.</p>
<p begin="00:23:44.933" end="00:23:46.616" style="s2">Don&#39;t let anyone die.</p>
<p begin="00:23:47.333" end="00:23:49.816" style="s2">It&#39;ll affect your schooling.</p>
<p begin="00:23:59.600" end="00:24:01.016" style="s2">How much does my family owe you?</p>
<p begin="00:24:01.466" end="00:24:03.816" style="s2">Fifty million.</p>
<p begin="00:24:04.133" end="00:24:04.483" style="s2">Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:24:05.733" end="00:24:06.349" style="s2">I&#39;ve paid it back.</p>
<p begin="00:24:10.666" end="00:24:13.016" style="s2">Luo Ying, stop pretending.</p>
<p begin="00:24:13.466" end="00:24:15.016" style="s2">You don&#39;t have any money at all.</p>
<p begin="00:24:16.133" end="00:24:19.583" style="s2">Like father, like daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:24:20.533" end="00:24:22.750" style="s2">The father&#39;s no good,</p>
<p begin="00:24:22.799" end="00:24:24.650" style="s2">and the daughter he raised</p>
<p begin="00:24:25.600" end="00:24:28.249" style="s2">has learned to talk big.</p>
<p begin="00:24:29.066" end="00:24:31.950" style="s2">I said I can pay, so I can.</p>
<p begin="00:24:32.533" end="00:24:34.216" style="s2">That&#39;s fifty million.</p>
<p begin="00:24:34.799" end="00:24:37.716" style="s2">Even chopping up your whole family wouldn&#39;t be enough.</p>
<p begin="00:24:38.266" end="00:24:39.183" style="s2">How are you going to pay?</p>
<p begin="00:24:44.533" end="00:24:45.149" style="s2">Mom.</p>
<p begin="00:24:47.466" end="00:24:49.950" style="s2">Girl, are you messing with me?</p>
<p begin="00:24:51.333" end="00:24:53.283" style="s2">I&#39;ll take your mother&#39;s life.</p>
<p begin="00:24:54.133" end="00:24:57.416" style="s2">We can&#39;t repay this money.</p>
<p begin="00:25:00.133" end="00:25:02.900" style="s2">Run, don&#39;t worry about me.</p>
<p begin="00:25:03.600" end="00:25:05.149" style="s2">Mom, Bi Shu.</p>
<p begin="00:25:06.133" end="00:25:09.016" style="s2">That hand of yours is unnecessary.</p>
<p begin="00:25:12.533" end="00:25:13.049" style="s2">Mom!</p>
<p begin="00:25:18.266" end="00:25:19.683" style="s2">Now can we talk properly</p>
<p begin="00:25:20.400" end="00:25:21.283" style="s2">about how to repay the money?</p>
<p begin="00:25:21.466" end="00:25:22.349" style="s2">Yes, yes, yes.</p>
<p begin="00:25:23.066" end="00:25:23.950" style="s2">Whatever you say.</p>
<p begin="00:25:30.400" end="00:25:32.249" style="s2">Sis, what website is this?</p>
<p begin="00:25:32.933" end="00:25:33.450" style="s2">The foreign internet.</p>
<p begin="00:25:33.999" end="00:25:35.583" style="s2">A site where you can chat with foreign netizens.</p>
<p begin="00:25:36.266" end="00:25:39.183" style="s2">Last time I only got 27 on my English test.</p>
<p begin="00:25:39.600" end="00:25:40.616" style="s2">Stop faking.</p>
<p begin="00:25:40.933" end="00:25:43.283" style="s2">Yingying&#39;s so skilled at this, how could she not know?</p>
<p begin="00:25:44.266" end="00:25:45.950" style="s2">I&#39;m Rakshasa. Transfer fifty million to me.</p>
<p begin="00:25:46.799" end="00:25:48.383" style="s2">Pavilion Master, the money&#39;s been transferred.</p>
<p begin="00:25:48.400" end="00:25:51.183" style="s2">The account balance still has eight billion USD left.</p>
<p begin="00:25:51.733" end="00:25:55.149" style="s2">Good thing the assassin circle only recognizes accounts. Even in a new body,</p>
<p begin="00:25:55.200" end="00:25:57.149" style="s2">I can still use the assets under my name.</p>
<p begin="00:25:58.400" end="00:26:00.750" style="s2">Alipay received, fifty million yuan.</p>
<p begin="00:26:01.200" end="00:26:02.616" style="s2">Fifty million has arrived.</p>
<p begin="00:26:03.866" end="00:26:05.683" style="s2">Great, great.</p>
<p begin="00:26:06.266" end="00:26:07.016" style="s2">Luo Ying.</p>
<p begin="00:26:07.866" end="00:26:12.083" style="s2">You didn&#39;t do something shameful, did you?</p>
<p begin="00:26:16.400" end="00:26:18.349" style="s2">You dare hit me?</p>
<p begin="00:26:18.799" end="00:26:20.783" style="s2">This money is prize money I won from racing.</p>
<p begin="00:26:21.333" end="00:26:23.283" style="s2">If you don&#39;t keep that mouth clean,</p>
<p begin="00:26:23.466" end="00:26:26.916" style="s2">I don&#39;t mind slapping you a few more times.</p>
<p begin="00:26:27.466" end="00:26:30.466" style="s2">Top international underground racing, the champion takes it all.</p>
<p begin="00:26:30.633" end="00:26:32.216" style="s2">Tens of millions of dollars is not uncommon.</p>
<p begin="00:26:32.666" end="00:26:33.716" style="s2">Sis is so skilled at racing.</p>
<p begin="00:26:34.266" end="00:26:36.616" style="s2">She must have won some amazing big race.</p>
<p begin="00:26:37.866" end="00:26:41.283" style="s2">Race organizers usually have legitimate funds and sponsors.</p>
<p begin="00:26:41.466" end="00:26:44.116" style="s2">Otherwise, with such a huge sum, the bank would have frozen it long ago.</p>
<p begin="00:26:44.933" end="00:26:47.016" style="s2">This money is absolutely clean.</p>
<p begin="00:26:49.600" end="00:26:51.016" style="s2">You&#39;re amazing.</p>
<p begin="00:26:52.400" end="00:26:54.083" style="s2">Sis is the pride of our whole family.</p>
<p begin="00:26:55.999" end="00:26:57.950" style="s2">Last place in the whole school.</p>
<p begin="00:26:58.133" end="00:27:01.716" style="s2">What&#39;s the use of being good at racing? It won&#39;t add points for you.</p>
<p begin="00:27:02.266" end="00:27:03.283" style="s2">Back at school,</p>
<p begin="00:27:03.733" end="00:27:05.816" style="s2">let&#39;s see if you can still be so glorious.</p>
<p begin="00:27:10.933" end="00:27:12.383" style="s2">I&#39;ve already transferred the money to this card.</p>
<p begin="00:27:12.533" end="00:27:13.583" style="s2">The password is six zeros.</p>
<p begin="00:27:14.133" end="00:27:16.116" style="s2">Take the money and get lost.</p>
<p begin="00:27:16.400" end="00:27:17.716" style="s2">Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:27:22.933" end="00:27:23.550" style="s2">Leader.</p>
<p begin="00:27:24.133" end="00:27:25.450" style="s2">Rakshasa logged into an external account.</p>
<p begin="00:27:25.600" end="00:27:27.283" style="s2">We traced the information and locked down her identity.</p>
<p begin="00:27:33.600" end="00:27:37.183" style="s2">She&#39;s the woman who grabbed your hand in the mountains and called you &#39;big brother&#39;.</p>
<p begin="00:27:38.133" end="00:27:40.616" style="s2">She even forcefully kissed your face on the plane.</p>
<p begin="00:27:41.866" end="00:27:45.983" style="s2">She&#39;s already died once, how dare she still take advantage of your hand?</p>
<p begin="00:27:51.600" end="00:27:52.516" style="s2">What level is Class D?</p>
<p begin="00:27:54.400" end="00:27:55.416" style="s2">The worst level.</p>
<p begin="00:27:59.999" end="00:28:01.049" style="s2">Help me fabricate an identity.</p>
<p begin="00:28:01.866" end="00:28:03.049" style="s2">I want to get into Black Forest Academy.</p>
<p begin="00:28:04.533" end="00:28:05.149" style="s2">Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:28:12.933" end="00:28:15.583" style="s2">Young Master Chen and Mengdie are a match made in heaven.</p>
<p begin="00:28:15.866" end="00:28:18.216" style="s2">Luo Ying delusionally wants to compete with Mengdie for him.</p>
<p begin="00:28:18.266" end="00:28:19.683" style="s2">Ugly people always make a fuss.</p>
<p begin="00:28:20.266" end="00:28:23.283" style="s2">Writing that disgusting diary to pester Young Master Chen.</p>
<p begin="00:28:23.600" end="00:28:25.416" style="s2">Just thinking about it makes me sick.</p>
<p begin="00:28:28.400" end="00:28:30.483" style="s2">Thank goodness heaven has eyes.</p>
<p begin="00:28:31.333" end="00:28:35.950" style="s2">Some people do too many bad things and fall from the rooftop.</p>
<p begin="00:28:36.799" end="00:28:37.416" style="s2">Mengdie,</p>
<p begin="00:28:37.733" end="00:28:39.316" style="s2">you&#39;re just too kind.</p>
<p begin="00:28:39.600" end="00:28:43.316" style="s2">You even tried to pull her then, almost getting dragged down yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:28:44.133" end="00:28:47.049" style="s2">Mengdie, from now on, stay away from people with such dark minds.</p>
<p begin="00:28:47.333" end="00:28:47.850" style="s2">Stay far away.</p>
<p begin="00:28:48.799" end="00:28:50.516" style="s2">Brother Chen, don&#39;t say that.</p>
<p begin="00:28:51.200" end="00:28:52.116" style="s2">It&#39;s all in the past.</p>
<p begin="00:28:52.533" end="00:28:54.249" style="s2">She didn&#39;t do it on purpose.</p>
<p begin="00:29:00.666" end="00:29:02.516" style="s2">I fell accidentally myself.</p>
<p begin="00:29:03.466" end="00:29:04.383" style="s2">Didn&#39;t I?</p>
<p begin="00:29:09.466" end="00:29:10.349" style="s2">Luo Ying,</p>
<p begin="00:29:12.400" end="00:29:14.249" style="s2">you clearly pushed me down.</p>
<p begin="00:29:15.866" end="00:29:18.083" style="s2">Stop falsely accusing people. Do you have evidence?</p>
<p begin="00:29:18.933" end="00:29:21.850" style="s2">Luo Ying, don&#39;t think you can throw dirty water on Mengdie.</p>
<p begin="00:29:21.999" end="00:29:22.916" style="s2">I&#39;d like you.</p>
<p begin="00:29:24.133" end="00:29:27.550" style="s2">For someone like you, if the whole world were just you and a dog,</p>
<p begin="00:29:28.400" end="00:29:29.450" style="s2">I still wouldn&#39;t pick you.</p>
<p begin="00:29:32.933" end="00:29:34.349" style="s2">You have peculiar taste.</p>
<p begin="00:29:35.066" end="00:29:37.049" style="s2">Duanmu Chen, listen carefully.</p>
<p begin="00:29:37.466" end="00:29:38.883" style="s2">I don&#39;t like you now.</p>
<p begin="00:29:39.600" end="00:29:42.650" style="s2">Your body&#39;s drained by wine and lust, you lost the race to me.</p>
<p begin="00:29:43.200" end="00:29:44.916" style="s2">A useless cripple who can&#39;t even keep his legs.</p>
<p begin="00:29:45.466" end="00:29:48.333" style="s2">You only deserve to be paired with a vicious woman like Luo Mengdie.</p>
<p begin="00:29:48.500" end="00:29:49.283" style="s2">You two make a perfect couple.</p>
<p begin="00:29:51.866" end="00:29:54.516" style="s2">Slandering me isn&#39;t enough, you dare insult Brother Chen too?</p>
<p begin="00:29:56.533" end="00:29:57.416" style="s2">Show evidence.</p>
<p begin="00:29:57.999" end="00:30:00.116" style="s2">Otherwise, kneel and apologize to us.</p>
<p begin="00:30:00.266" end="00:30:02.116" style="s2">You want evidence? I have it.</p>
<p begin="00:30:09.600" end="00:30:09.983" style="s2">Lu Heng.</p>
<p begin="00:30:10.933" end="00:30:13.816" style="s2">Why is he chasing again? My identity&#39;s been discovered.</p>
<p begin="00:30:14.133" end="00:30:15.133" style="s2">But why is he helping me?</p>
<p begin="00:30:20.666" end="00:30:21.816" style="s2">Looking at it this way,</p>
<p begin="00:30:22.133" end="00:30:24.199" style="s2">It was Luo Mengdie grabbing Luo Ying&#39;s wrist,</p>
<p begin="00:30:24.366" end="00:30:27.149" style="s2">pushing her down. Luo Mengdie is a murderer.</p>
<p begin="00:30:29.866" end="00:30:31.583" style="s2">Mengdie, what&#39;s going on?</p>
<p begin="00:30:32.933" end="00:30:35.450" style="s2">Brother Chen, believe me.</p>
<p begin="00:30:36.000" end="00:30:38.516" style="s2">She almost fell during the struggle.</p>
<p begin="00:30:38.533" end="00:30:39.983" style="s2">I tried desperately to pull her.</p>
<p begin="00:30:40.799" end="00:30:44.516" style="s2">It was too chaotic, the movements looked a bit strange.</p>
<p begin="00:30:45.600" end="00:30:50.116" style="s2">Seems reasonable, the video is blurry and hard to tell.</p>
<p begin="00:30:52.666" end="00:30:53.550" style="s2">Saving someone,</p>
<p begin="00:30:54.133" end="00:30:56.649" style="s2">or pushing someone, let&#39;s not say for now.</p>
<p begin="00:30:56.666" end="00:30:57.850" style="s2">On the rooftop,</p>
<p begin="00:30:58.533" end="00:31:01.183" style="s2">you publicly read someone&#39;s private diary.</p>
<p begin="00:31:01.733" end="00:31:02.616" style="s2">This point,</p>
<p begin="00:31:03.166" end="00:31:03.950" style="s2">you can&#39;t argue against.</p>
<p begin="00:31:05.200" end="00:31:06.749" style="s2">Apologize to her.</p>
<p begin="00:31:08.933" end="00:31:11.416" style="s2">Who are you? You&#39;re not qualified to boss me around.</p>
<p begin="00:31:12.666" end="00:31:15.316" style="s2">Luo Ying, where did you find this pretty boy?</p>
<p begin="00:31:15.733" end="00:31:17.716" style="s2">He looks quite convincing.</p>
<p begin="00:31:19.200" end="00:31:20.116" style="s2">Two fools.</p>
<p begin="00:31:20.533" end="00:31:23.683" style="s2">Lu Heng is the chief mercenary, leader of the Crimson Flame Legion.</p>
<p begin="00:31:24.000" end="00:31:26.216" style="s2">Even I wouldn&#39;t dare confront him directly.</p>
<p begin="00:31:26.399" end="00:31:27.450" style="s2">You&#39;re really asking for death.</p>
<p begin="00:31:28.666" end="00:31:29.016" style="s2">Leader.</p>
<p begin="00:31:29.733" end="00:31:30.616" style="s2">Should we deal with them?</p>
<p begin="00:31:37.866" end="00:31:41.450" style="s2">Principal Wang is someone even city officials treat with respect.</p>
<p begin="00:31:41.866" end="00:31:43.450" style="s2">What&#39;s this man&#39;s background?</p>
<p begin="00:31:43.733" end="00:31:47.850" style="s2">Lu Lu... Chief, almost said Leader Lu.</p>
<p begin="00:31:48.133" end="00:31:50.783" style="s2">This gentleman is here as the chief military training instructor.</p>
<p begin="00:31:50.933" end="00:31:52.516" style="s2">His identity must never be exposed.</p>
<p begin="00:31:52.533" end="00:31:53.850" style="s2">Instructor Lu, you&#39;re here.</p>
<p begin="00:31:55.733" end="00:31:56.649" style="s2">You two,</p>
<p begin="00:31:56.666" end="00:31:59.983" style="s2">hurry up and listen to Instructor Lu, apologize to Luo Ying.</p>
<p begin="00:32:00.933" end="00:32:01.850" style="s2">Principal, I</p>
<p begin="00:32:04.533" end="00:32:06.116" style="s2">You made me apologize to a cutie like Luo Ying</p>
<p begin="00:32:06.666" end="00:32:07.316" style="s2">Does she deserve it?</p>
<p begin="00:32:07.466" end="00:32:09.733" style="s2">What is Chen Shao&#39;s status?</p>
<p begin="00:32:10.733" end="00:32:12.083" style="s2">What is her status?</p>
<p begin="00:32:12.933" end="00:32:13.983" style="s2">Not cooperating, fine</p>
<p begin="00:32:14.133" end="00:32:15.950" style="s2">Go handle the withdrawal procedures now</p>
<p begin="00:32:16.133" end="00:32:16.916" style="s2">Black Forest Academy</p>
<p begin="00:32:17.066" end="00:32:19.049" style="s2">Can&#39;t accommodate you two big shots</p>
<p begin="00:32:23.866" end="00:32:24.916" style="s2">The students here</p>
<p begin="00:32:25.600" end="00:32:27.583" style="s2">Everyone is future connections and resources</p>
<p begin="00:32:28.399" end="00:32:30.783" style="s2">If I get expelled, my dad will beat me to death</p>
<p begin="00:32:34.000" end="00:32:35.583" style="s2">Luo Ying, I&#39;m sorry</p>
<p begin="00:32:36.266" end="00:32:39.683" style="s2">Not just verbal apology, each person also has to write ten thousand words</p>
<p begin="00:32:39.733" end="00:32:41.850" style="s2">Post it on the campus forum, publicly humiliate</p>
<p begin="00:32:42.399" end="00:32:43.399" style="s2">Did you hear that?</p>
<p begin="00:32:43.799" end="00:32:44.883" style="s2">I heard it</p>
<p begin="00:32:45.466" end="00:32:46.516" style="s2">We&#39;ll go write now</p>
<p begin="00:32:48.266" end="00:32:48.649" style="s2">Let&#39;s go</p>
<p begin="00:33:01.333" end="00:33:04.350" style="s2">What, not thanking your big brother?</p>
<p begin="00:33:05.466" end="00:33:06.483" style="s2">The world has gone crazy</p>
<p begin="00:33:07.200" end="00:33:09.816" style="s2">The leader doesn&#39;t kill people, but flirts with them</p>
<p begin="00:33:11.333" end="00:33:14.616" style="s2">What a coincidence, big brother, thanks for standing up for me</p>
<p begin="00:33:16.000" end="00:33:16.616" style="s2">You&#39;re welcome</p>
<p begin="00:33:23.200" end="00:33:25.983" style="s2">Brother Chen, it&#39;s all that jinx Luo Ying&#39;s fault</p>
<p begin="00:33:26.133" end="00:33:27.316" style="s2">Because of writing the self-criticism</p>
<p begin="00:33:27.866" end="00:33:29.183" style="s2">My hands are all swollen</p>
<p begin="00:33:31.200" end="00:33:34.916" style="s2">This is a math open class for S class and D class together</p>
<p begin="00:33:35.200" end="00:33:37.316" style="s2">There will definitely be interactive Q&amp;A in class</p>
<p begin="00:33:37.733" end="00:33:39.316" style="s2">You&#39;re in the top ten of the grade</p>
<p begin="00:33:40.133" end="00:33:42.616" style="s2">Find a chance to humiliate her then</p>
<p begin="00:33:43.200" end="00:33:45.049" style="s2">I must make that loser</p>
<p begin="00:33:45.200" end="00:33:48.250" style="s2">Show her true colors in front of everyone</p>
<p begin="00:33:52.799" end="00:33:55.716" style="s2">Why are S class and D class having class together?</p>
<p begin="00:33:56.266" end="00:33:57.716" style="s2">To prevent good students who are weak in some subjects</p>
<p begin="00:33:57.866" end="00:34:00.350" style="s2">From being buried in D class because of low total scores</p>
<p begin="00:34:00.666" end="00:34:03.816" style="s2">Let S class and D class participate in classroom competitions together</p>
<p begin="00:34:04.000" end="00:34:06.250" style="s2">Once we find students who have been held back</p>
<p begin="00:34:06.266" end="00:34:09.583" style="s2">We will directly promote them to S class for key training</p>
<p begin="00:34:16.000" end="00:34:17.583" style="s2">Luo Ying, pay for my phone</p>
<p begin="00:34:20.533" end="00:34:21.149" style="s2">Sure</p>
<p begin="00:34:24.933" end="00:34:26.350" style="s2">Paying for your phone is enough</p>
<p begin="00:34:29.600" end="00:34:31.049" style="s2">Luo Ying, what are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:34:33.066" end="00:34:36.250" style="s2">Teacher, Luo Ying is bullying me</p>
<p begin="00:34:39.333" end="00:34:41.416" style="s2">Luo Ying openly bullies classmates in class</p>
<p begin="00:34:41.466" end="00:34:43.283" style="s2">Must give you a demerit</p>
<p begin="00:34:45.200" end="00:34:47.183" style="s2">The teacher comes in without asking a single question about what happened</p>
<p begin="00:34:47.333" end="00:34:50.083" style="s2">Just listening to one side and concluding I&#39;m the bully</p>
<p begin="00:34:50.799" end="00:34:51.683" style="s2">Or is it</p>
<p begin="00:34:52.799" end="00:34:54.383" style="s2">Because she&#39;s a top student in S class</p>
<p begin="00:34:54.933" end="00:34:57.983" style="s2">You&#39;re naturally taking her side.</p>
<p begin="00:34:58.533" end="00:35:00.116" style="s2">What right do you have to say I&#39;m taking sides?</p>
<p begin="00:35:00.399" end="00:35:03.183" style="s2">Mengdie is always in the top ten of the grade in every exam.</p>
<p begin="00:35:03.333" end="00:35:04.383" style="s2">She brings honor to the school.</p>
<p begin="00:35:05.066" end="00:35:05.683" style="s2">You...</p>
<p begin="00:35:06.666" end="00:35:09.283" style="s2">Aside from that scandal everyone knows about,</p>
<p begin="00:35:09.733" end="00:35:10.883" style="s2">you even resorted to physical violence.</p>
<p begin="00:35:12.266" end="00:35:15.149" style="s2">Apologize for your despicable behavior immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:35:16.000" end="00:35:18.116" style="s2">Is being in the top ten really that impressive?</p>
<p begin="00:35:18.399" end="00:35:20.516" style="s2">Is that her license to slander classmates at will?</p>
<p begin="00:35:22.266" end="00:35:23.583" style="s2">You still look down on me.</p>
<p begin="00:35:24.133" end="00:35:26.516" style="s2">If you&#39;ve got the guts, compete with me.</p>
<p begin="00:35:28.933" end="00:35:29.550" style="s2">Compete on what?</p>
<p begin="00:35:30.399" end="00:35:34.116" style="s2">The upcoming in-class quiz. Whoever scores lower</p>
<p begin="00:35:34.399" end="00:35:37.583" style="s2">apologizes in front of the whole school.</p>
<p begin="00:35:37.866" end="00:35:39.716" style="s2">Luo Mengdie, you&#39;re too despicable.</p>
<p begin="00:35:39.866" end="00:35:41.850" style="s2">Math is your strongest subject.</p>
<p begin="00:35:42.133" end="00:35:44.250" style="s2">Comparing your strength to Luo Ying&#39;s weakness—</p>
<p begin="00:35:44.266" end="00:35:45.316" style="s2">is that fair?</p>
<p begin="00:35:46.133" end="00:35:47.049" style="s2">What?</p>
<p begin="00:35:47.733" end="00:35:51.016" style="s2">Scared? Where&#39;s that splashing confidence from earlier?</p>
<p begin="00:35:51.733" end="00:35:55.716" style="s2">Losers are losers, only resorting to underhanded tricks.</p>
<p begin="00:35:56.399" end="00:35:57.450" style="s2">Of course she wouldn&#39;t dare.</p>
<p begin="00:35:58.000" end="00:35:59.266" style="s2">Why waste your time on trash</p>
<p begin="00:35:59.433" end="00:36:01.550" style="s2">destined to struggle at the bottom?</p>
<p begin="00:36:01.866" end="00:36:02.916" style="s2">I&#39;ll compete with you.</p>
<p begin="00:36:03.733" end="00:36:05.416" style="s2">If I win, you—</p>
<p begin="00:36:06.000" end="00:36:07.583" style="s2">Luo Mengdie, you—</p>
<p begin="00:36:08.133" end="00:36:10.649" style="s2">Duanmu Chen, and you—</p>
<p begin="00:36:11.866" end="00:36:13.583" style="s2">this teacher who favors the top student—</p>
<p begin="00:36:13.866" end="00:36:17.049" style="s2">all three of you go to the school broadcast room</p>
<p begin="00:36:17.200" end="00:36:18.350" style="s2">and broadcast to the whole school:</p>
<p begin="00:36:18.933" end="00:36:19.850" style="s2">I wronged Luo Ying.</p>
<p begin="00:36:20.533" end="00:36:21.183" style="s2">I was wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:36:22.133" end="00:36:24.383" style="s2">If you lose, you drop out automatically.</p>
<p begin="00:36:24.666" end="00:36:25.316" style="s2">Dare you?</p>
<p begin="00:36:27.200" end="00:36:27.983" style="s2">Of course I dare.</p>
<p begin="00:36:29.733" end="00:36:32.216" style="s2">I don&#39;t mind using what you&#39;re most proud of</p>
<p begin="00:36:33.066" end="00:36:33.816" style="s2">to slap you in the face.</p>
<p begin="00:36:36.266" end="00:36:38.250" style="s2">I&#39;ll bet five million that Mengdie wins.</p>
<p begin="00:36:38.799" end="00:36:41.716" style="s2">Everyone watch—see what happens to a fool</p>
<p begin="00:36:41.733" end="00:36:42.883" style="s2">who overestimates herself.</p>
<p begin="00:36:43.466" end="00:36:45.983" style="s2">Luo Mengdie is the math goddess, no contest.</p>
<p begin="00:36:46.000" end="00:36:46.916" style="s2">I bet on Mengdie to win.</p>
<p begin="00:36:46.933" end="00:36:49.450" style="s2">Adding another million to show Luo Ying the gap.</p>
<p begin="00:36:49.600" end="00:36:50.783" style="s2">The odds are one-sided.</p>
<p begin="00:36:51.066" end="00:36:51.983" style="s2">The bookmaker takes all.</p>
<p begin="00:36:52.000" end="00:36:53.983" style="s2">I&#39;ll follow Young Master Chen and bet five hundred thousand for fun.</p>
<p begin="00:36:54.000" end="00:36:56.733" style="s2">Luo Ying is pretty, but no brains.</p>
<p begin="00:36:56.833" end="00:36:57.899" style="s2">Just waiting for the dropout announcement.</p>
<p begin="00:36:58.366" end="00:36:59.016" style="s2">Mo Si</p>
<p begin="00:36:59.866" end="00:37:02.316" style="s2">Chief, how much are you betting on Luo Mengdie to win?</p>
<p begin="00:37:02.433" end="00:37:03.583" style="s2">Who said I&#39;m betting on her?</p>
<p begin="00:37:06.133" end="00:37:08.083" style="s2">Ten million. I&#39;m betting on Luo Ying to win.</p>
<p begin="00:37:12.000" end="00:37:12.916" style="s2">Yes, Chief.</p>
<p begin="00:37:13.466" end="00:37:15.983" style="s2">What exactly is the relationship between Luo Ying and Lu Heng?</p>
<p begin="00:37:16.266" end="00:37:17.183" style="s2">Never mind.</p>
<p begin="00:37:17.200" end="00:37:19.183" style="s2">Even if Luo Ying loses, I&#39;m still betting on her.</p>
<p begin="00:37:21.066" end="00:37:22.599" style="s2">Officer Lu really has a sharp eye.</p>
<p begin="00:37:22.766" end="00:37:24.383" style="s2">I&#39;ll match it with a million. I support her.</p>
<p begin="00:37:24.399" end="00:37:24.783" style="s2">Student Luo Ying.</p>
<p begin="00:37:29.066" end="00:37:30.783" style="s2">Brother Chen, what&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:37:31.200" end="00:37:32.516" style="s2">Who did the Principal bet on?</p>
<p begin="00:37:33.066" end="00:37:33.850" style="s2">Luo Ying to win.</p>
<p begin="00:37:36.133" end="00:37:39.950" style="s2">He&#39;s definitely just putting on a show out of respect for Instructor Lu.</p>
<p begin="00:37:41.466" end="00:37:43.450" style="s2">Teacher, please give us the question.</p>
<p begin="00:38:15.333" end="00:38:18.516" style="s2">Calculate a triple integral. This is a competition-level problem.</p>
<p begin="00:38:19.600" end="00:38:21.316" style="s2">You&#39;ve probably never even heard of it.</p>
<p begin="00:38:22.000" end="00:38:24.916" style="s2">Using a question like this is clearly intentional sabotage.</p>
<p begin="00:38:25.333" end="00:38:26.516" style="s2">This is so unfair.</p>
<p begin="00:38:26.933" end="00:38:30.250" style="s2">If you can&#39;t solve it, get off stage now and drop out voluntarily.</p>
<p begin="00:38:30.799" end="00:38:31.716" style="s2">So noisy.</p>
<p begin="00:39:01.466" end="00:39:02.116" style="s2">You lost.</p>
<p begin="00:39:05.333" end="00:39:08.250" style="s2">Are you kidding? You just wrote down a random number.</p>
<p begin="00:39:08.399" end="00:39:09.416" style="s2">And then claimed I lost?</p>
<p begin="00:39:10.133" end="00:39:12.883" style="s2">Do you think this is a guessing game? It&#39;s hilarious.</p>
<p begin="00:39:17.200" end="00:39:18.383" style="s2">No, that&#39;s not right.</p>
<p begin="00:39:19.866" end="00:39:22.749" style="s2">Did you hear that? The teacher said you&#39;re wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:39:24.399" end="00:39:25.716" style="s2">I said your answer is wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:39:26.666" end="00:39:27.983" style="s2">Student Luo Ying&#39;s answer...</p>
<p begin="00:39:28.533" end="00:39:29.416" style="s2">...is correct.</p>
<p begin="00:39:32.533" end="00:39:35.716" style="s2">Impossible! She&#39;s just a good-for-nothing slacker.</p>
<p begin="00:39:36.266" end="00:39:37.183" style="s2">She must have guessed it.</p>
<p begin="00:39:37.600" end="00:39:40.250" style="s2">There&#39;s no way anyone could guess a math problem this difficult correctly.</p>
<p begin="00:39:40.933" end="00:39:43.049" style="s2">Luo Ying is the real math genius.</p>
<p begin="00:39:45.200" end="00:39:46.116" style="s2">You&#39;re just trash.</p>
<p begin="00:39:46.799" end="00:39:47.850" style="s2">Brother Chen.</p>
<p begin="00:39:54.000" end="00:39:55.716" style="s2">How can someone as lowly as Luo Ying...</p>
<p begin="00:39:56.266" end="00:39:57.450" style="s2">...deserve an apology from me?</p>
<p begin="00:40:03.733" end="00:40:04.350" style="s2">Principal!</p>
<p begin="00:40:09.600" end="00:40:11.683" style="s2">Connect the microphone to all the school speakers.</p>
<p begin="00:40:11.866" end="00:40:12.649" style="s2">A bet is a bet.</p>
<p begin="00:40:12.933" end="00:40:14.250" style="s2">Apologize to Student Luo Ying.</p>
<p begin="00:40:18.133" end="00:40:18.649" style="s2">Principal!</p>
<p begin="00:40:19.200" end="00:40:20.383" style="s2">I can have my dad donate a building!</p>
<p begin="00:40:20.666" end="00:40:21.983" style="s2">You rebellious child, shut up!</p>
<p begin="00:40:28.533" end="00:40:29.149" style="s2">Dad?</p>
<p begin="00:40:30.000" end="00:40:31.016" style="s2">Why did you hit me?</p>
<p begin="00:40:31.733" end="00:40:36.116" style="s2">You lost tens of millions in a bet, causing the group&#39;s stock price to plummet.</p>
<p begin="00:40:36.533" end="00:40:38.383" style="s2">And you still have the nerve to act rich here?</p>
<p begin="00:40:39.466" end="00:40:40.649" style="s2">Apologize to Luo Ying.</p>
<p begin="00:40:43.733" end="00:40:45.450" style="s2">You bitch, it&#39;s all your fault.</p>
<p begin="00:40:52.133" end="00:40:53.016" style="s2">Apologize.</p>
<p begin="00:41:02.533" end="00:41:03.583" style="s2">I wronged Luo Ying.</p>
<p begin="00:41:04.933" end="00:41:05.950" style="s2">I was wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:41:14.000" end="00:41:15.049" style="s2">I wronged Luo Ying.</p>
<p begin="00:41:15.600" end="00:41:16.483" style="s2">I was wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:41:21.600" end="00:41:23.683" style="s2">I wronged Luo Ying, I was wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:41:29.733" end="00:41:30.783" style="s2">Luo Ying.</p>
<p begin="00:41:30.799" end="00:41:33.583" style="s2">You&#39;re so good at math, staying in Class D is a complete</p>
<p begin="00:41:33.600" end="00:41:36.250" style="s2">waste of talent. I formally invite you</p>
<p begin="00:41:36.533" end="00:41:38.916" style="s2">to join our Class S starting tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:41:44.799" end="00:41:47.049" style="s2">A teacher like you doesn&#39;t deserve to teach me.</p>
<p begin="00:41:52.533" end="00:41:55.316" style="s2">Instructor Lu, you&#39;ve been following me the whole way.</p>
<p begin="00:41:55.466" end="00:41:56.516" style="s2">Is there something you need?</p>
<p begin="00:41:57.733" end="00:42:00.866" style="s2">With Lu Heng&#39;s personality, he wouldn&#39;t help someone for no reason.</p>
<p begin="00:42:01.033" end="00:42:02.350" style="s2">He&#39;s testing me.</p>
<p begin="00:42:02.933" end="00:42:03.816" style="s2">Or maybe</p>
<p begin="00:42:04.399" end="00:42:05.850" style="s2">he&#39;s already confirmed my identity.</p>
<p begin="00:42:08.366" end="00:42:09.416" style="s2">My car is outside.</p>
<p begin="00:42:10.499" end="00:42:11.816" style="s2">Little girl.</p>
<p begin="00:42:12.533" end="00:42:15.816" style="s2">How do you feel about a man walking on the road—</p>
<p begin="00:42:24.533" end="00:42:27.316" style="s2">Luo Ying, I didn&#39;t think you&#39;d be this shameless.</p>
<p begin="00:42:27.733" end="00:42:29.583" style="s2">Just to find a backer at school,</p>
<p begin="00:42:30.133" end="00:42:31.983" style="s2">you won&#39;t even spare the new instructor.</p>
<p begin="00:42:32.533" end="00:42:33.416" style="s2">What did you say?</p>
<p begin="00:42:34.133" end="00:42:35.016" style="s2">Still pretending.</p>
<p begin="00:42:35.600" end="00:42:38.216" style="s2">Next week&#39;s paintball combat class—</p>
<p begin="00:42:38.533" end="00:42:39.950" style="s2">Lu Heng is the head instructor.</p>
<p begin="00:42:40.666" end="00:42:44.083" style="s2">You&#39;re clinging to him just so he&#39;ll give you a high score</p>
<p begin="00:42:44.133" end="00:42:45.283" style="s2">and get you into the military district, right?</p>
<p begin="00:42:47.466" end="00:42:48.216" style="s2">Relying on men.</p>
<p begin="00:42:49.066" end="00:42:49.983" style="s2">In my eyes,</p>
<p begin="00:42:50.533" end="00:42:52.483" style="s2">a bullet never needs to rely on anyone.</p>
<p begin="00:42:52.933" end="00:42:55.149" style="s2">My bullseye, I call the shots.</p>
<p begin="00:42:56.266" end="00:42:59.450" style="s2">Don&#39;t bring your mediocre math-and-racing tricks</p>
<p begin="00:42:59.733" end="00:43:01.450" style="s2">to the shooting range and embarrass yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:43:01.733" end="00:43:04.250" style="s2">I trained hard for three years and spent countless money</p>
<p begin="00:43:04.933" end="00:43:06.116" style="s2">just to hit ninety points.</p>
<p begin="00:43:06.933" end="00:43:10.216" style="s2">When I shoot, my hands don&#39;t show mercy.</p>
<p begin="00:43:10.933" end="00:43:12.616" style="s2">You&#39;d better not have any accidents.</p>
<p begin="00:43:19.466" end="00:43:21.316" style="s2">I heard military training instructors are all super handsome.</p>
<p begin="00:43:21.466" end="00:43:22.783" style="s2">I wonder if our class&#39;s instructor</p>
<p begin="00:43:22.799" end="00:43:23.933" style="s2">will also be super handsome.</p>
<p begin="00:43:24.100" end="00:43:26.116" style="s2">I&#39;m so excited, my little heart.</p>
<p begin="00:43:26.666" end="00:43:28.116" style="s2">Excited about what?</p>
<p begin="00:43:28.133" end="00:43:30.083" style="s2">You&#39;ll know what regret means soon enough.</p>
<p begin="00:43:31.466" end="00:43:33.450" style="s2">Xiao Ying, aren&#39;t you excited about the instructor?</p>
<p begin="00:43:33.866" end="00:43:35.149" style="s2">I&#39;m not interested in any of that.</p>
<p begin="00:43:35.866" end="00:43:38.216" style="s2">Lu Heng is already here, and you&#39;re still pretending.</p>
<p begin="00:43:44.266" end="00:43:47.016" style="s2">I&#39;m Chief Instructor Liu Zhenghua.</p>
<p begin="00:43:48.399" end="00:43:52.616" style="s2">If you feel unwell during training, come to me immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:43:52.933" end="00:43:55.016" style="s2">So it can be handled promptly.</p>
<p begin="00:43:55.333" end="00:43:56.333" style="s2">Did you hear that?</p>
<p begin="00:43:56.333" end="00:44:00.216" style="s2">Yes, we&#39;ll have our gear on in ten minutes.</p>
<p begin="00:44:00.533" end="00:44:01.049" style="s2">Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:44:08.133" end="00:44:09.416" style="s2">So fast.</p>
<p begin="00:44:17.600" end="00:44:20.516" style="s2">Who cut my bulletproof vest? That&#39;s too much.</p>
<p begin="00:44:21.466" end="00:44:22.350" style="s2">What&#39;s going on?</p>
<p begin="00:44:23.066" end="00:44:23.950" style="s2">Instructor, look.</p>
<p begin="00:44:25.066" end="00:44:27.016" style="s2">Instructor Liu, it&#39;s a water pellet.</p>
<p begin="00:44:27.333" end="00:44:29.183" style="s2">Close-range impact.</p>
<p begin="00:44:29.200" end="00:44:29.850" style="s2">Can&#39;t be underestimated.</p>
<p begin="00:44:30.399" end="00:44:33.950" style="s2">The vest is damaged; key areas lost protection.</p>
<p begin="00:44:34.000" end="00:44:37.716" style="s2">If hit, it could cause severe subcutaneous bruising.</p>
<p begin="00:44:37.733" end="00:44:40.250" style="s2">Or even concuss internal organs.</p>
<p begin="00:44:41.066" end="00:44:42.783" style="s2">Clearly someone did this on purpose.</p>
<p begin="00:44:44.266" end="00:44:46.216" style="s2">Luo Ying, was it you?</p>
<p begin="00:44:48.933" end="00:44:49.850" style="s2">I didn&#39;t do it.</p>
<p begin="00:44:50.133" end="00:44:52.783" style="s2">Xiao Ying has been with me the whole time.</p>
<p begin="00:44:52.799" end="00:44:54.749" style="s2">She never touched your vest.</p>
<p begin="00:44:55.066" end="00:44:58.616" style="s2">You two are friends, of course you&#39;d lie for her.</p>
<p begin="00:44:59.066" end="00:44:59.683" style="s2">Instructor Liu.</p>
<p begin="00:45:00.133" end="00:45:03.550" style="s2">Could we have everyone open their bags for inspection?</p>
<p begin="00:45:04.799" end="00:45:08.350" style="s2">Open your bags and take everything out.</p>
<p begin="00:45:18.799" end="00:45:23.049" style="s2">Luo Ying, caught red-handed. What do you have to say?</p>
<p begin="00:45:23.066" end="00:45:25.816" style="s2">Cutting the vest—what were you trying to do?</p>
<p begin="00:45:25.866" end="00:45:28.916" style="s2">How badly did you want Mengdie to get hurt in training?</p>
<p begin="00:45:34.000" end="00:45:35.149" style="s2">You did it.</p>
<p begin="00:45:37.466" end="00:45:38.483" style="s2">I said I didn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:45:39.466" end="00:45:40.083" style="s2">Do you believe me?</p>
<p begin="00:45:41.066" end="00:45:43.933" style="s2">How could an ordinary schoolgirl have</p>
<p begin="00:45:44.100" end="00:45:47.416" style="s2">such a ruthless look and cut someone&#39;s vest?</p>
<p begin="00:45:47.733" end="00:45:49.149" style="s2">You&#39;re punished to stand at attention</p>
<p begin="00:45:49.200" end="00:45:52.083" style="s2">one hour longer than the others before the match.</p>
<p begin="00:45:52.799" end="00:45:54.883" style="s2">Apologize right now.</p>
<p begin="00:45:56.266" end="00:45:59.316" style="s2">Being forced to apologize publicly is awful.</p>
<p begin="00:45:59.600" end="00:46:00.116" style="s2">Luo Ying.</p>
<p begin="00:46:00.533" end="00:46:01.850" style="s2">This is what you owe me.</p>
<p begin="00:46:12.399" end="00:46:13.716" style="s2">I&#39;m not used to people touching me.</p>
<p begin="00:46:14.000" end="00:46:15.850" style="s2">Also, I&#39;ll say this once.</p>
<p begin="00:46:16.799" end="00:46:19.183" style="s2">I didn&#39;t cut her vest.</p>
<p begin="00:46:19.833" end="00:46:21.266" style="s2">What did Luo Ying just do?</p>
<p begin="00:46:21.700" end="00:46:24.883" style="s2">She actually threw Instructor Liu, who had formal military training,</p>
<p begin="00:46:25.200" end="00:46:27.950" style="s2">to the ground with a textbook shoulder throw.</p>
<p begin="00:46:28.399" end="00:46:29.983" style="s2">Her strength is terrifying.</p>
<p begin="00:46:32.399" end="00:46:34.216" style="s2">Is she possessed?</p>
<p begin="00:46:38.000" end="00:46:40.616" style="s2">Instructor, you&#39;re not so tough.</p>
<p begin="00:46:40.666" end="00:46:42.350" style="s2">Can&#39;t even beat a girl.</p>
<p begin="00:46:42.533" end="00:46:44.466" style="s2">I think you really wronged her.</p>
<p begin="00:46:44.633" end="00:46:45.950" style="s2">Look at that skill.</p>
<p begin="00:46:46.000" end="00:46:47.850" style="s2">No need to sneak around bullying people.</p>
<p begin="00:46:48.533" end="00:46:49.666" style="s2">I can take on two</p>
<p begin="00:46:49.833" end="00:46:52.216" style="s2">big guys by myself, no problem.</p>
<p begin="00:46:52.533" end="00:46:55.683" style="s2">This girl in front of me is actually stronger than me.</p>
<p begin="00:46:56.133" end="00:46:59.416" style="s2">Is this innate fighting talent, or</p>
<p begin="00:46:59.733" end="00:47:02.483" style="s2">has she received training even tougher than mine?</p>
<p begin="00:47:02.799" end="00:47:04.749" style="s2">Luo Ying, you&#39;ve got some nerve.</p>
<p begin="00:47:04.933" end="00:47:06.083" style="s2">Daring to hit even the instructor.</p>
<p begin="00:47:14.933" end="00:47:15.316" style="s2">Mosi.</p>
<p begin="00:47:16.000" end="00:47:16.616" style="s2">Instructor Liu.</p>
<p begin="00:47:17.333" end="00:47:19.283" style="s2">This is the surveillance footage from the bus.</p>
<p begin="00:47:26.399" end="00:47:29.583" style="s2">Luo Mengdie, so you staged the whole thing.</p>
<p begin="00:47:29.600" end="00:47:31.183" style="s2">Maliciously framing a classmate.</p>
<p begin="00:47:31.600" end="00:47:34.516" style="s2">You&#39;re despicable, acting so wronged earlier.</p>
<p begin="00:47:34.533" end="00:47:37.149" style="s2">Insisting it was Luo Ying, how shameless.</p>
<p begin="00:47:37.333" end="00:47:38.483" style="s2">Framing again.</p>
<p begin="00:47:38.799" end="00:47:41.316" style="s2">Is framing Luo Ying the only thing you know how to do?</p>
<p begin="00:47:42.266" end="00:47:44.616" style="s2">A leopard can&#39;t change its spots.</p>
<p begin="00:47:45.066" end="00:47:49.716" style="s2">From pushing someone off the rooftop to the math competition, to self-harm framing today.</p>
<p begin="00:47:50.133" end="00:47:53.016" style="s2">Luo Mengdie lies through her teeth, hopeless.</p>
<p begin="00:47:53.200" end="00:47:54.116" style="s2">Luo Mengdie.</p>
<p begin="00:47:54.799" end="00:47:58.483" style="s2">You&#39;ve seriously violated discipline. One hour of standing at attention.</p>
<p begin="00:47:58.933" end="00:47:59.933" style="s2">Execute immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:48:01.600" end="00:48:03.850" style="s2">An hour will kill us.</p>
<p begin="00:48:04.266" end="00:48:05.149" style="s2">Two hours.</p>
<p begin="00:48:12.399" end="00:48:15.016" style="s2">Sorry, I misjudged earlier.</p>
<p begin="00:48:15.066" end="00:48:16.116" style="s2">It was my fault.</p>
<p begin="00:48:16.533" end="00:48:18.616" style="s2">I don&#39;t accept your apology.</p>
<p begin="00:48:37.433" end="00:48:38.916" style="s2">Why won&#39;t you accept Liu Zhenghua&#39;s apology?</p>
<p begin="00:48:39.733" end="00:48:41.850" style="s2">Apologies are the most useless thing in this world.</p>
<p begin="00:48:42.666" end="00:48:43.716" style="s2">No one will</p>
<p begin="00:48:43.733" end="00:48:46.116" style="s2">let you off for doing wrong just because you apologize.</p>
<p begin="00:48:47.866" end="00:48:49.983" style="s2">The weak deserve to be killed.</p>
<p begin="00:48:50.666" end="00:48:53.450" style="s2">Only the strong deserve to reach the top of the pyramid.</p>
<p begin="00:48:54.533" end="00:48:56.116" style="s2">And earn the right to survive.</p>
<p begin="00:49:13.866" end="00:49:15.049" style="s2">10.1 rings.</p>
<p begin="00:49:17.333" end="00:49:17.983" style="s2">10 rings.</p>
<p begin="00:49:19.866" end="00:49:21.149" style="s2">10.2 rings.</p>
<p begin="00:49:21.733" end="00:49:24.749" style="s2">I heard you&#39;ve even handled real guns, amazing.</p>
<p begin="00:49:24.933" end="00:49:26.083" style="s2">Your marksmanship is so good.</p>
<p begin="00:49:26.266" end="00:49:28.599" style="s2">In the jungle shooting competition later, you&#39;ll definitely be</p>
<p begin="00:49:28.766" end="00:49:30.466" style="s2">the most dazzling one. All the boys</p>
<p begin="00:49:30.633" end="00:49:33.266" style="s2">will be drawn to you. I bet next Monday back at school,</p>
<p begin="00:49:33.433" end="00:49:36.250" style="s2">you&#39;ll get so many love letters you can&#39;t even count them.</p>
<p begin="00:49:36.533" end="00:49:39.816" style="s2">What goddess? Just hyped up by a bunch of fools.</p>
<p begin="00:49:46.533" end="00:49:49.550" style="s2">You&#39;ve changed so much lately, but what&#39;s the point?</p>
<p begin="00:49:50.000" end="00:49:53.316" style="s2">I fire a few shots casually and they&#39;re still all over me.</p>
<p begin="00:49:55.066" end="00:49:57.016" style="s2">As long as you&#39;re happy.</p>
<p begin="00:49:57.066" end="00:49:57.850" style="s2">Everyone assemble.</p>
<p begin="00:50:07.733" end="00:50:10.783" style="s2">Everyone will get a rifle later.</p>
<p begin="00:50:11.333" end="00:50:13.716" style="s2">The guns shoot water pellets.</p>
<p begin="00:50:14.133" end="00:50:15.283" style="s2">After the match starts,</p>
<p begin="00:50:15.466" end="00:50:17.533" style="s2">anyone who gets a mark on their clothes from being hit</p>
<p begin="00:50:17.700" end="00:50:19.450" style="s2">means they&#39;ve been shot.</p>
<p begin="00:50:19.733" end="00:50:22.250" style="s2">In the game, that counts as dead.</p>
<p begin="00:50:23.066" end="00:50:25.183" style="s2">They can&#39;t shoot anyone anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:50:26.000" end="00:50:29.016" style="s2">Anyone dead in the game goes back to the meeting point immediately</p>
<p begin="00:50:29.200" end="00:50:30.116" style="s2">and waits for the results.</p>
<p begin="00:50:30.399" end="00:50:31.983" style="s2">The last one standing wins.</p>
<p begin="00:50:32.533" end="00:50:33.316" style="s2">Any objections?</p>
<p begin="00:50:34.000" end="00:50:34.783" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="00:50:35.600" end="00:50:35.983" style="s2">Dismissed.</p>
<p begin="00:50:39.466" end="00:50:40.350" style="s2">Everyone follow me over here.</p>
<p begin="00:50:46.666" end="00:50:48.483" style="s2">Xiao Ying, how do we move?</p>
<p begin="00:50:48.533" end="00:50:50.883" style="s2">Find somewhere to hide and don&#39;t get spotted.</p>
<p begin="00:50:50.933" end="00:50:52.483" style="s2">Xiao Ying, where are you going?</p>
<p begin="00:50:54.266" end="00:50:55.450" style="s2">I&#39;m going to kill people.</p>
<p begin="00:50:55.733" end="00:50:57.450" style="s2">Xiao Ying, be careful.</p>
<p begin="00:51:12.533" end="00:51:14.616" style="s2">Mengdie, you&#39;re amazing.</p>
<p begin="00:51:14.799" end="00:51:16.883" style="s2">You took out a whole team so easily.</p>
<p begin="00:51:17.066" end="00:51:18.216" style="s2">They were too weak.</p>
<p begin="00:51:18.399" end="00:51:20.616" style="s2">Mengdie, we&#39;re counting on you later.</p>
<p begin="00:51:20.799" end="00:51:22.483" style="s2">Mengdie, I trust you.</p>
<p begin="00:51:23.066" end="00:51:24.783" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry, Chen gege.</p>
<p begin="00:51:25.333" end="00:51:26.916" style="s2">Xiao Ying, be careful.</p>
<p begin="00:51:51.600" end="00:51:52.216" style="s2">Who&#39;s there?</p>
<p begin="00:51:52.799" end="00:51:54.350" style="s2">Five kills, headshots.</p>
<p begin="00:52:03.066" end="00:52:03.950" style="s2">Luo Ying.</p>
<p begin="00:52:05.466" end="00:52:09.133" style="s2">Luo Ying&#39;s shooting is faster than Luo Mengdie&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="00:52:09.300" end="00:52:10.083" style="s2">And more accurate.</p>
<p begin="00:52:10.399" end="00:52:12.083" style="s2">There&#39;s no comparison at all.</p>
<p begin="00:52:12.266" end="00:52:14.350" style="s2">Luo Ying is as fast as a special forces soldier.</p>
<p begin="00:52:17.200" end="00:52:18.883" style="s2">Luo Ying, you bitch.</p>
<p begin="00:52:19.200" end="00:52:21.049" style="s2">How dare you steal Chen gege&#39;s attention.</p>
<p begin="00:52:22.266" end="00:52:24.749" style="s2">Die! I lost.</p>
<p begin="00:52:24.933" end="00:52:25.950" style="s2">But you won&#39;t win either.</p>
<p begin="00:52:26.799" end="00:52:27.416" style="s2">Mengdie!</p>
<p begin="00:52:28.666" end="00:52:29.916" style="s2">Luo Mengdie, are you crazy?</p>
<p begin="00:52:30.066" end="00:52:30.799" style="s2">You&#39;re already dead.</p>
<p begin="00:52:30.866" end="00:52:31.850" style="s2">You can&#39;t attack Luo Ying.</p>
<p begin="00:52:36.533" end="00:52:37.683" style="s2">Luo Ying&#39;s gone crazy too.</p>
<p begin="00:52:37.866" end="00:52:39.950" style="s2">She didn&#39;t dodge—she charged straight in.</p>
<p begin="00:52:46.000" end="00:52:49.266" style="s2">Luo Ying, you little cutie, how dare you do this to me.</p>
<p begin="00:52:49.433" end="00:52:50.783" style="s2">I&#39;ll kill you.</p>
<p begin="00:52:53.200" end="00:52:54.749" style="s2">Luo Ying, you little cutie.</p>
<p begin="00:52:55.066" end="00:52:56.483" style="s2">You actually dare to treat me like this.</p>
<p begin="00:52:56.933" end="00:52:58.083" style="s2">I&#39;ll kill you.</p>
<p begin="00:52:58.933" end="00:53:00.083" style="s2">Shut your mouth.</p>
<p begin="00:53:00.666" end="00:53:02.749" style="s2">Say one more word and I&#39;ll kill you.</p>
<p begin="00:53:04.266" end="00:53:05.149" style="s2">You dare</p>
<p begin="00:53:08.933" end="00:53:10.083" style="s2">See if I dare</p>
<p begin="00:53:10.533" end="00:53:13.583" style="s2">Even a water bullet has impact when fired</p>
<p begin="00:53:13.866" end="00:53:17.183" style="s2">The human eye is the most vulnerable part of the body</p>
<p begin="00:53:17.200" end="00:53:19.583" style="s2">With this shot, even if Luo Mengdie doesn&#39;t die</p>
<p begin="00:53:19.866" end="00:53:21.550" style="s2">Her eyes definitely won&#39;t survive</p>
<p begin="00:53:21.733" end="00:53:23.283" style="s2">Luo Ying, don&#39;t be impulsive</p>
<p begin="00:53:23.733" end="00:53:25.683" style="s2">Mengdie, apologize to Luo Ying now</p>
<p begin="00:53:30.133" end="00:53:31.950" style="s2">I was wrong, Luo Ying</p>
<p begin="00:53:32.399" end="00:53:33.550" style="s2">Let me go</p>
<p begin="00:53:33.733" end="00:53:35.850" style="s2">I won&#39;t target you anymore</p>
<p begin="00:53:36.133" end="00:53:37.183" style="s2">I&#39;m the cute one</p>
<p begin="00:53:37.333" end="00:53:38.749" style="s2">Please let me go</p>
<p begin="00:53:50.533" end="00:53:53.283" style="s2">Luo Mengdie was so scared by Luo Ying she peed in public</p>
<p begin="00:53:58.133" end="00:53:59.283" style="s2">You do evil, you get retribution</p>
<p begin="00:54:00.000" end="00:54:01.016" style="s2">Talking about you</p>
<p begin="00:54:06.266" end="00:54:06.883" style="s2">Hand them all over</p>
<p begin="00:54:17.066" end="00:54:19.950" style="s2">Only a woman like Luo Ying deserves me</p>
<p begin="00:54:20.266" end="00:54:20.883" style="s2">Luo Ying</p>
<p begin="00:54:21.733" end="00:54:22.883" style="s2">Please wait</p>
<p begin="00:54:25.066" end="00:54:25.683" style="s2">I know</p>
<p begin="00:54:26.266" end="00:54:29.416" style="s2">You&#39;ve always hated me because of the love letter</p>
<p begin="00:54:30.266" end="00:54:33.016" style="s2">Here, I want to sincerely apologize to you</p>
<p begin="00:54:33.866" end="00:54:36.516" style="s2">Can we still be friends?</p>
<p begin="00:54:37.433" end="00:54:38.516" style="s2">Brother</p>
<p begin="00:54:42.000" end="00:54:42.350" style="s2">Sure</p>
<p begin="00:54:43.466" end="00:54:44.350" style="s2">Really?</p>
<p begin="00:54:46.533" end="00:54:47.683" style="s2">You really</p>
<p begin="00:54:48.266" end="00:54:49.683" style="s2">Don&#39;t hold a grudge about that?</p>
<p begin="00:54:51.066" end="00:54:52.083" style="s2">Go die right now</p>
<p begin="00:54:52.666" end="00:54:53.583" style="s2">Then I won&#39;t hold a grudge</p>
<p begin="00:55:00.133" end="00:55:01.583" style="s2">Captain, why are you here?</p>
<p begin="00:55:02.000" end="00:55:05.049" style="s2">Leader Lu is personally hosting the Black Forest Academy shooting practical class</p>
<p begin="00:55:05.466" end="00:55:07.983" style="s2">These kids should have good physical fitness</p>
<p begin="00:55:08.266" end="00:55:10.783" style="s2">I&#39;m here to see if I can pick a few good prospects</p>
<p begin="00:55:11.866" end="00:55:14.116" style="s2">Captain, you want to try it yourself?</p>
<p begin="00:55:14.533" end="00:55:15.850" style="s2">Haven&#39;t stretched my muscles in a while</p>
<p begin="00:55:16.399" end="00:55:18.216" style="s2">I&#39;ll play with these kids</p>
<p begin="00:55:18.266" end="00:55:19.583" style="s2">If the captain joins in</p>
<p begin="00:55:19.600" end="00:55:21.983" style="s2">These students will all come out injured</p>
<p begin="00:55:23.333" end="00:55:25.983" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry, none of us will use our real strength</p>
<p begin="00:55:26.933" end="00:55:28.383" style="s2">Just playing for fun</p>
<p begin="00:55:29.066" end="00:55:29.983" style="s2">Captain</p>
<p begin="00:55:30.533" end="00:55:31.716" style="s2">Be careful</p>
<p begin="00:55:32.933" end="00:55:35.283" style="s2">There&#39;s a nasty one inside</p>
<p begin="00:55:36.000" end="00:55:36.783" style="s2">A venomous snake</p>
<p begin="00:55:39.066" end="00:55:42.116" style="s2">Leader Lu worries too much, even if I&#39;m not as good as when I was young</p>
<p begin="00:55:42.533" end="00:55:45.049" style="s2">I&#39;ll never be beaten by kids</p>
<p begin="00:55:45.733" end="00:55:46.083" style="s2">Let&#39;s go</p>
<p begin="00:55:49.733" end="00:55:51.416" style="s2">You took Duanmu Chen and the others&#39; guns</p>
<p begin="00:55:52.000" end="00:55:53.683" style="s2">Do we have too many guns?</p>
<p begin="00:55:54.666" end="00:55:56.616" style="s2">Only load ten bullets in each rifle.</p>
<p begin="00:55:56.933" end="00:55:59.583" style="s2">We must make sure our guns are always loaded.</p>
<p begin="00:56:06.799" end="00:56:09.016" style="s2">Kids these days are too soft.</p>
<p begin="00:56:09.600" end="00:56:10.783" style="s2">They have no sense of alertness at all.</p>
<p begin="00:56:11.466" end="00:56:13.183" style="s2">I remember that batch of kids from a few years back.</p>
<p begin="00:56:13.600" end="00:56:15.950" style="s2">Every one of them had drive, and among them</p>
<p begin="00:56:16.666" end="00:56:18.083" style="s2">there were quite a few promising ones.</p>
<p begin="00:56:18.399" end="00:56:18.749" style="s2">Captain.</p>
<p begin="00:56:19.466" end="00:56:21.533" style="s2">You can&#39;t use the methods for training new recruits</p>
<p begin="00:56:21.700" end="00:56:24.616" style="s2">to demand things of these kids. They&#39;re not your soldiers.</p>
<p begin="00:56:25.466" end="00:56:28.350" style="s2">I&#39;ve never seen anyone dodge the captain&#39;s bullets.</p>
<p begin="00:56:29.200" end="00:56:31.049" style="s2">We ran into them as soon as we got in.</p>
<p begin="00:56:31.466" end="00:56:33.149" style="s2">This group of students has bad luck.</p>
<p begin="00:56:41.600" end="00:56:42.216" style="s2">Take cover.</p>
<p begin="00:56:58.133" end="00:57:01.550" style="s2">That girl seemed to sense the captain&#39;s ambush directly.</p>
<p begin="00:57:01.866" end="00:57:03.316" style="s2">She actually dodged the bullet in an instant.</p>
<p begin="00:57:03.733" end="00:57:05.850" style="s2">She even protected all her teammates.</p>
<p begin="00:57:06.666" end="00:57:12.483" style="s2">Let me try.</p>
<p begin="00:57:18.666" end="00:57:19.550" style="s2">People.</p>
<p begin="00:57:23.200" end="00:57:25.316" style="s2">So you were hiding here all along.</p>
<p begin="00:57:26.000" end="00:57:27.983" style="s2">But I still found you right away.</p>
<p begin="00:57:33.733" end="00:57:35.049" style="s2">When did you move here?</p>
<p begin="00:57:37.466" end="00:57:39.316" style="s2">Captain, watch out. The target has already taken me down.</p>
<p begin="00:57:48.266" end="00:57:49.316" style="s2">Total wipeout.</p>
<p begin="00:57:53.200" end="00:57:54.116" style="s2">The few of us,</p>
<p begin="00:57:54.266" end="00:57:58.216" style="s2">special operatives who came out of the devil&#39;s training ground, actually lost to</p>
<p begin="00:57:58.666" end="00:58:01.683" style="s2">the marksmanship of a little sister still studying at an advanced academy.</p>
<p begin="00:58:02.399" end="00:58:04.516" style="s2">In the jungle combat terrain we&#39;re best at,</p>
<p begin="00:58:05.066" end="00:58:08.083" style="s2">we were taken out by an ordinary female student from an advanced academy.</p>
<p begin="00:58:14.933" end="00:58:17.149" style="s2">This girl looks a lot like my late wife.</p>
<p begin="00:58:17.466" end="00:58:21.283" style="s2">If my daughter were still alive, she&#39;d be about this age.</p>
<p begin="00:58:23.066" end="00:58:23.950" style="s2">Special operative.</p>
<p begin="00:58:24.533" end="00:58:25.149" style="s2">Little sister.</p>
<p begin="00:58:25.866" end="00:58:26.749" style="s2">How did you know?</p>
<p begin="00:58:28.133" end="00:58:30.216" style="s2">A guess? Of course not a guess.</p>
<p begin="00:58:30.933" end="00:58:34.116" style="s2">I used to work for the underground, and I&#39;ve dealt with many special operatives.</p>
<p begin="00:58:34.533" end="00:58:35.950" style="s2">I can recognize them at a glance.</p>
<p begin="00:58:36.933" end="00:58:37.550" style="s2">Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:58:38.933" end="00:58:39.816" style="s2">Over the years,</p>
<p begin="00:58:40.133" end="00:58:41.683" style="s2">I&#39;ve also met many</p>
<p begin="00:58:41.733" end="00:58:43.950" style="s2">young promising talents with a gift for combat.</p>
<p begin="00:58:44.666" end="00:58:47.016" style="s2">Strong enough to easily defeat them.</p>
<p begin="00:58:47.600" end="00:58:50.749" style="s2">This talent—I&#39;m afraid you won&#39;t find a second person like her in all of Huaguo.</p>
<p begin="00:58:51.866" end="00:58:54.616" style="s2">If she isn&#39;t cultivated, this will definitely be a loss</p>
<p begin="00:58:56.000" end="00:58:57.583" style="s2">to our organization.</p>
<p begin="00:58:59.066" end="00:58:59.683" style="s2">Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:59:04.799" end="00:59:05.416" style="s2">Is there something else?</p>
<p begin="00:59:06.000" end="00:59:06.616" style="s2">Little sister.</p>
<p begin="00:59:07.333" end="00:59:10.216" style="s2">I&#39;m the captain of the Special Operations Bureau of the Fifth District of Heimmu City.</p>
<p begin="00:59:10.399" end="00:59:11.016" style="s2">Deng Zhiguo</p>
<p begin="00:59:11.733" end="00:59:13.850" style="s2">I&#39;m formally inviting you to join us now.</p>
<p begin="00:59:14.133" end="00:59:15.683" style="s2">Become a member of the Fifth District.</p>
<p begin="00:59:16.133" end="00:59:17.416" style="s2">Will you?</p>
<p begin="00:59:18.666" end="00:59:19.283" style="s2">Captain,</p>
<p begin="00:59:20.000" end="00:59:23.416" style="s2">our unit has never accepted students from advanced academies before.</p>
<p begin="00:59:23.466" end="00:59:25.683" style="s2">Yeah, Captain. We can&#39;t rush this.</p>
<p begin="00:59:26.533" end="00:59:27.149" style="s2">Nonsense!</p>
<p begin="00:59:28.933" end="00:59:31.816" style="s2">I&#39;m reserving her spot in advance for our military region later on.</p>
<p begin="00:59:31.866" end="00:59:33.049" style="s2">Not right now.</p>
<p begin="00:59:34.000" end="00:59:37.049" style="s2">Even with my authority, I can&#39;t bring this special academy student into the military region during the assessment period.</p>
<p begin="00:59:37.200" end="00:59:39.416" style="s2">during the assessment period.</p>
<p begin="00:59:40.399" end="00:59:41.016" style="s2">I refuse.</p>
<p begin="00:59:44.133" end="00:59:46.216" style="s2">Why? Being directly reserved...</p>
<p begin="00:59:46.399" end="00:59:47.400" style="s2">During the assessment,</p>
<p begin="00:59:47.566" end="00:59:50.250" style="s2">as long as you pass the physical exam, no other tests are needed.</p>
<p begin="00:59:50.266" end="00:59:51.683" style="s2">You&#39;d enter the Fifth Military Region directly</p>
<p begin="00:59:51.866" end="00:59:53.550" style="s2">and become a special forces operative.</p>
<p begin="00:59:53.600" end="00:59:56.483" style="s2">I&#39;ve finally found some peace. I don&#39;t want to risk it again.</p>
<p begin="00:59:56.799" end="00:59:57.683" style="s2">Not interested.</p>
<p begin="01:00:00.666" end="01:00:02.749" style="s2">I&#39;ll give you my contact info later.</p>
<p begin="01:00:03.200" end="01:00:05.550" style="s2">If you change your mind, reach out anytime.</p>
<p begin="01:00:06.000" end="01:00:06.383" style="s2">Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:00:11.866" end="01:00:13.583" style="s2">In this jungle shooting competition,</p>
<p begin="01:00:16.933" end="01:00:17.716" style="s2">the Blue Team wins!</p>
<p begin="01:00:18.133" end="01:00:18.649" style="s2">Awesome!</p>
<p begin="01:00:21.466" end="01:00:23.049" style="s2">Xiao Ying, you&#39;re amazing!</p>
<p begin="01:00:23.200" end="01:00:25.149" style="s2">You led us to victory so easily.</p>
<p begin="01:00:27.200" end="01:00:29.016" style="s2">Where&#39;s Luo Mengdie?</p>
<p begin="01:00:29.200" end="01:00:31.450" style="s2">Heard she peed herself during the shooting match.</p>
<p begin="01:00:31.466" end="01:00:32.749" style="s2">Soaked her pants.</p>
<p begin="01:00:33.866" end="01:00:35.683" style="s2">Isn&#39;t she supposed to be the &#39;Goddess of Marksmanship&#39;?</p>
<p begin="01:00:35.733" end="01:00:37.049" style="s2">How did she get scared enough to pee herself?</p>
<p begin="01:00:40.133" end="01:00:40.783" style="s2">Who knows?</p>
<p begin="01:00:41.733" end="01:00:42.783" style="s2">Luo Ying...</p>
<p begin="01:00:43.466" end="01:00:46.516" style="s2">You made me a laughingstock in front of everyone.</p>
<p begin="01:00:47.733" end="01:00:50.083" style="s2">Don&#39;t blame me if I ruin you.</p>
<p begin="01:00:56.000" end="01:00:56.649" style="s2">Rakshasa.</p>
<p begin="01:00:59.866" end="01:01:01.850" style="s2">Had enough of this cat-and-mouse game?</p>
<p begin="01:01:01.866" end="01:01:03.183" style="s2">This feeling...</p>
<p begin="01:01:03.200" end="01:01:05.683" style="s2">He&#39;s not wearing gloves. Don&#39;t you have mysophobia?</p>
<p begin="01:01:06.533" end="01:01:08.216" style="s2">Oh no, why did I say that out loud?</p>
<p begin="01:01:09.200" end="01:01:10.516" style="s2">You know I have mysophobia,</p>
<p begin="01:01:11.200" end="01:01:11.983" style="s2">yet you kissed me,</p>
<p begin="01:01:12.533" end="01:01:13.583" style="s2">and touched my hand.</p>
<p begin="01:01:16.000" end="01:01:19.816" style="s2">Do you know what happens to people who touch me?</p>
<p begin="01:01:19.866" end="01:01:20.916" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="01:01:21.466" end="01:01:25.183" style="s2">But it&#39;s not entirely my fault. I haven&#39;t dated in two lifetimes.</p>
<p begin="01:01:25.200" end="01:01:27.666" style="s2">Leader Lu is just too handsome. On the plane,</p>
<p begin="01:01:27.833" end="01:01:29.049" style="s2">I couldn&#39;t resist kissing him.</p>
<p begin="01:01:29.466" end="01:01:32.083" style="s2">Digging up my family&#39;s grave, harassing my people</p>
<p begin="01:01:32.533" end="01:01:33.816" style="s2">And you still think you&#39;re in the right</p>
<p begin="01:01:34.266" end="01:01:35.316" style="s2">Things have come to this</p>
<p begin="01:01:36.000" end="01:01:38.083" style="s2">How do you want me to compensate you, Leader Lu</p>
<p begin="01:01:39.733" end="01:01:40.733" style="s2">Take responsibility for me</p>
<p begin="01:01:41.133" end="01:01:42.116" style="s2">Responsible</p>
<p begin="01:01:48.399" end="01:01:49.550" style="s2">Not responsible</p>
<p begin="01:01:52.799" end="01:01:53.683" style="s2">I&#39;ll shoot you dead</p>
<p begin="01:01:54.000" end="01:01:56.250" style="s2">God, please be kind to me</p>
<p begin="01:01:56.266" end="01:01:57.716" style="s2">Someone who&#39;s never been in love</p>
<p begin="01:01:57.866" end="01:01:59.583" style="s2">Who gets confessed to for the first time</p>
<p begin="01:01:59.733" end="01:02:02.916" style="s2">With a gun to their chest, what is this</p>
<p begin="01:02:02.933" end="01:02:05.683" style="s2">Hardcore romance? Calm down first</p>
<p begin="01:02:06.799" end="01:02:08.083" style="s2">I&#39;ll take responsibility for you</p>
<p begin="01:02:11.600" end="01:02:12.216" style="s2">Trying to run</p>
<p begin="01:02:13.466" end="01:02:16.216" style="s2">Guns can go off easily, it&#39;s dangerous. Can you put the gun away</p>
<p begin="01:02:24.766" end="01:02:25.266" style="s2">Luo Ying</p>
<p begin="01:02:26.666" end="01:02:27.316" style="s2">You lied to me</p>
<p begin="01:02:28.266" end="01:02:31.850" style="s2">This body is too weak. I can easily handle others</p>
<p begin="01:02:32.133" end="01:02:34.483" style="s2">But not Lu Heng. You misunderstood</p>
<p begin="01:02:35.200" end="01:02:37.049" style="s2">I just like the feeling of fighting you</p>
<p begin="01:02:37.200" end="01:02:38.649" style="s2">I was just playing around with you earlier</p>
<p begin="01:02:44.399" end="01:02:45.049" style="s2">Number</p>
<p begin="01:02:59.333" end="01:03:01.183" style="s2">The Blood Jade is a treasure my family protects</p>
<p begin="01:03:02.133" end="01:03:05.583" style="s2">It has mysterious power, it can even bring people back to life</p>
<p begin="01:03:05.733" end="01:03:07.450" style="s2">You are the future mistress of the Lu family</p>
<p begin="01:03:08.000" end="01:03:09.149" style="s2">You have the right to wear it</p>
<p begin="01:03:09.866" end="01:03:12.649" style="s2">You must protect it, and protect yourself too</p>
<p begin="01:03:12.933" end="01:03:14.483" style="s2">Why bring this up all of a sudden</p>
<p begin="01:03:15.066" end="01:03:18.200" style="s2">The Nine Colors organization you were in before sent an assassin, Tyrannosaurus</p>
<p begin="01:03:18.366" end="01:03:20.916" style="s2">Arrived in Huaguo yesterday. The organization gave a death order</p>
<p begin="01:03:21.466" end="01:03:23.983" style="s2">Bring you back alive or see your corpse</p>
<p begin="01:03:24.533" end="01:03:26.916" style="s2">I used money from overseas accounts, and he found out</p>
<p begin="01:03:28.266" end="01:03:29.583" style="s2">When you need help</p>
<p begin="01:03:30.133" end="01:03:31.049" style="s2">Contact me in time</p>
<p begin="01:03:32.933" end="01:03:35.183" style="s2">What, not afraid</p>
<p begin="01:03:35.600" end="01:03:36.250" style="s2">Afraid of what</p>
<p begin="01:03:36.933" end="01:03:38.616" style="s2">I don&#39;t mind their lousy position</p>
<p begin="01:03:38.666" end="01:03:39.316" style="s2">Let someone else sit in it</p>
<p begin="01:03:40.933" end="01:03:43.049" style="s2">Your current physical condition can&#39;t compare to before</p>
<p begin="01:03:44.266" end="01:03:45.049" style="s2">Little thing</p>
<p begin="01:03:45.733" end="01:03:47.049" style="s2">I advise you to behave</p>
<p begin="01:03:48.666" end="01:03:51.550" style="s2">By the way, I&#39;ve always wanted to ask you something</p>
<p begin="01:03:51.600" end="01:03:53.016" style="s2">After you got the Blood Jade</p>
<p begin="01:03:53.866" end="01:03:55.316" style="s2">Why did you take a plane to Huaguo</p>
<p begin="01:03:57.200" end="01:03:59.016" style="s2">I found traces of my biological parents</p>
<p begin="01:03:59.466" end="01:04:00.649" style="s2">They&#39;re in Huaguo</p>
<p begin="01:04:01.466" end="01:04:02.649" style="s2">I want to ask them</p>
<p begin="01:04:03.333" end="01:04:04.916" style="s2">Why they cruelly abandoned me</p>
<p begin="01:04:05.200" end="01:04:08.116" style="s2">Let me grow up in a killer organization that kills without blinking</p>
<p begin="01:04:09.066" end="01:04:10.883" style="s2">The organization won&#39;t let me leave Country M.</p>
<p begin="01:04:11.466" end="01:04:12.916" style="s2">Only by escaping with the Blood Jade</p>
<p begin="01:04:13.333" end="01:04:15.416" style="s2">will they not actually kill me.</p>
<p begin="01:04:30.933" end="01:04:32.916" style="s2">Everyone in the organization is ruthless.</p>
<p begin="01:04:33.333" end="01:04:36.516" style="s2">I can handle them alone, but I fear implicating my family.</p>
<p begin="01:04:37.733" end="01:04:38.783" style="s2">The special forces</p>
<p begin="01:04:39.466" end="01:04:41.049" style="s2">will protect team members&#39; families.</p>
<p begin="01:04:44.133" end="01:04:46.516" style="s2">Captain Deng, notify me of the next assessment.</p>
<p begin="01:04:46.666" end="01:04:47.183" style="s2">Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:04:47.733" end="01:04:48.916" style="s2">Welcome to join us.</p>
<p begin="01:04:51.200" end="01:04:54.783" style="s2">So annoying, there&#39;s a placement test right after military training.</p>
<p begin="01:04:56.266" end="01:04:56.916" style="s2">Xiao Ying,</p>
<p begin="01:04:57.466" end="01:04:59.316" style="s2">how many points do you plan to score on this monthly exam?</p>
<p begin="01:05:00.266" end="01:05:03.050" style="s2">How about we make a pact to both score zero?</p>
<p begin="01:05:03.866" end="01:05:04.916" style="s2">So unambitious.</p>
<p begin="01:05:05.466" end="01:05:09.983" style="s2">We&#39;re at the bottom anyway, zero or not makes no difference.</p>
<p begin="01:05:10.399" end="01:05:12.116" style="s2">My family sacrifices everything to send me to school.</p>
<p begin="01:05:12.399" end="01:05:15.183" style="s2">I can&#39;t let them down. What&#39;s the total score?</p>
<p begin="01:05:15.200" end="01:05:16.516" style="s2">Why are you asking that?</p>
<p begin="01:05:16.933" end="01:05:20.250" style="s2">The total score is 750.</p>
<p begin="01:05:21.599" end="01:05:23.183" style="s2">Then I&#39;ll score 750.</p>
<p begin="01:05:28.000" end="01:05:31.316" style="s2">You don&#39;t have a fever, so why are you talking nonsense?</p>
<p begin="01:05:33.066" end="01:05:34.649" style="s2">750 points.</p>
<p begin="01:05:35.200" end="01:05:39.316" style="s2">What big talk, walking right into me to get slapped.</p>
<p begin="01:05:39.866" end="01:05:41.983" style="s2">Don&#39;t blame me for being rude.</p>
<p begin="01:05:45.200" end="01:05:48.883" style="s2">Luo Ying, you made me lose all face at school.</p>
<p begin="01:05:49.333" end="01:05:53.816" style="s2">This time, I&#39;ll make all the bosses&#39; wives here see clearly</p>
<p begin="01:05:54.666" end="01:05:58.083" style="s2">what a disgraceful thing you are.</p>
<p begin="01:05:59.466" end="01:06:02.216" style="s2">The placement test results come out today.</p>
<p begin="01:06:02.800" end="01:06:06.749" style="s2">I heard from Mengdie that Luo Ying bragged at the academy</p>
<p begin="01:06:07.066" end="01:06:09.150" style="s2">that she was confident she&#39;d get a perfect score.</p>
<p begin="01:06:13.333" end="01:06:16.083" style="s2">Little sister, did you say that?</p>
<p begin="01:06:16.133" end="01:06:17.016" style="s2">Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:06:18.933" end="01:06:22.083" style="s2">I know you&#39;ve been working hard lately, but studying isn&#39;t racing.</p>
<p begin="01:06:22.266" end="01:06:25.016" style="s2">It won&#39;t improve immediately just because you work hard and have technique.</p>
<p begin="01:06:25.333" end="01:06:27.949" style="s2">You&#39;ve only studied for half a month, how could you possibly get a perfect score?</p>
<p begin="01:06:28.133" end="01:06:31.283" style="s2">Exactly, Xiao Ying, if you can&#39;t learn it,</p>
<p begin="01:06:31.333" end="01:06:33.550" style="s2">you shouldn&#39;t lie and brag.</p>
<p begin="01:06:33.599" end="01:06:36.866" style="s2">Your mouth can deceive people, but the report card can&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="01:06:37.033" end="01:06:39.016" style="s2">Don&#39;t you all agree?</p>
<p begin="01:06:40.933" end="01:06:43.316" style="s2">Isn&#39;t this Luo Ying? I heard at school</p>
<p begin="01:06:43.599" end="01:06:46.516" style="s2">she tried to kill herself over the young master of the Duanmu Group,</p>
<p begin="01:06:46.533" end="01:06:48.116" style="s2">jumping from the sixth floor.</p>
<p begin="01:06:49.333" end="01:06:51.450" style="s2">Making a life-or-death fuss over a man.</p>
<p begin="01:06:51.733" end="01:06:53.050" style="s2">Thank goodness my daughter isn&#39;t like that.</p>
<p begin="01:06:54.533" end="01:06:56.783" style="s2">And she still dares to say she can get a perfect score?</p>
<p begin="01:06:58.399" end="01:06:59.683" style="s2">Making a fool of us all.</p>
<p begin="01:07:00.399" end="01:07:03.416" style="s2">This little sister of mine loves to brag.</p>
<p begin="01:07:04.533" end="01:07:07.983" style="s2">Bad grades, yet loves to put on airs and save face.</p>
<p begin="01:07:08.266" end="01:07:10.483" style="s2">She&#39;ll definitely amount to nothing in the future.</p>
<p begin="01:07:10.800" end="01:07:14.083" style="s2">When she grows up, she&#39;ll just be a female thug.</p>
<p begin="01:07:14.399" end="01:07:17.416" style="s2">But Mengdie is good at studying and steady.</p>
<p begin="01:07:18.000" end="01:07:19.183" style="s2">A hundred times better than her.</p>
<p begin="01:07:22.800" end="01:07:25.016" style="s2">No matter what my daughter did before,</p>
<p begin="01:07:26.133" end="01:07:28.350" style="s2">she will always be my pride.</p>
<p begin="01:07:29.066" end="01:07:29.683" style="s2">You people</p>
<p begin="01:07:30.399" end="01:07:31.816" style="s2">have no right to judge her.</p>
<p begin="01:07:33.599" end="01:07:34.216" style="s2">Mom.</p>
<p begin="01:07:34.933" end="01:07:37.816" style="s2">My little sister used to hate studying, now she&#39;s willing to brag.</p>
<p begin="01:07:38.000" end="01:07:39.316" style="s2">That shows she&#39;s started to work hard.</p>
<p begin="01:07:39.733" end="01:07:40.350" style="s2">Right.</p>
<p begin="01:07:42.533" end="01:07:46.016" style="s2">A loser like Luo Ying, is worth protecting like this?</p>
<p begin="01:07:46.166" end="01:07:46.766" style="s2">Yingying,</p>
<p begin="01:07:47.333" end="01:07:48.649" style="s2">Are you done with your nonsense?</p>
<p begin="01:07:49.333" end="01:07:53.416" style="s2">How can you say that about my mom? She&#39;s your own aunt.</p>
<p begin="01:07:53.866" end="01:07:55.949" style="s2">She cares about you for your own good.</p>
<p begin="01:07:56.399" end="01:07:57.583" style="s2">Aren&#39;t you going too far?</p>
<p begin="01:07:57.866" end="01:07:59.016" style="s2">I don&#39;t need it.</p>
<p begin="01:07:59.200" end="01:08:00.516" style="s2">As your elder,</p>
<p begin="01:08:01.066" end="01:08:03.816" style="s2">I remind you, don&#39;t be ungrateful.</p>
<p begin="01:08:04.399" end="01:08:07.949" style="s2">Luo Ying, even if you don&#39;t worry about your future,</p>
<p begin="01:08:08.266" end="01:08:10.483" style="s2">you should think about your father.</p>
<p begin="01:08:11.200" end="01:08:11.816" style="s2">Look.</p>
<p begin="01:08:23.200" end="01:08:26.083" style="s2">Isn&#39;t the interpreter here yet? Why so slow?</p>
<p begin="01:08:26.399" end="01:08:29.583" style="s2">If he doesn&#39;t come soon, my business with Mr. Hebrew will fall through.</p>
<p begin="01:08:31.466" end="01:08:33.416" style="s2">Uncle Zhang, I&#39;ll help you translate.</p>
<p begin="01:08:34.266" end="01:08:35.266" style="s2">You can translate?</p>
<p begin="01:08:35.466" end="01:08:36.350" style="s2">Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:08:37.333" end="01:08:39.316" style="s2">Guobin, you&#39;ve raised a good daughter.</p>
<p begin="01:08:41.599" end="01:08:44.083" style="s2">Tell the others, no need to find an interpreter.</p>
<p begin="01:08:45.733" end="01:08:48.216" style="s2">This kid, you have to nurture her.</p>
<p begin="01:08:48.933" end="01:08:51.550" style="s2">See, she&#39;s useful at the critical moment.</p>
<p begin="01:08:52.399" end="01:08:55.583" style="s2">Boss Zhang is the richest man in Heilin City, Mengdie helps him</p>
<p begin="01:08:55.599" end="01:08:59.816" style="s2">deal with such a big trouble, Boss Luo will be carried by his daughter.</p>
<p begin="01:09:02.133" end="01:09:02.749" style="s2">How about it?</p>
<p begin="01:09:04.666" end="01:09:06.083" style="s2">Boss Zhang refuses to invest.</p>
<p begin="01:09:09.033" end="01:09:09.949" style="s2">Luo Ying,</p>
<p begin="01:09:10.533" end="01:09:14.216" style="s2">I&#39;m about to slap you hard in the face.</p>
<p begin="01:09:21.599" end="01:09:22.483" style="s2">Hello.</p>
<p begin="01:09:24.133" end="01:09:27.583" style="s2">Please communicate with Mr. Hebrew in Korean.</p>
<p begin="01:09:27.599" end="01:09:29.716" style="s2">Tell him I want to discuss business with him.</p>
<p begin="01:09:30.000" end="01:09:33.283" style="s2">Korean, not English?</p>
<p begin="01:09:33.866" end="01:09:35.283" style="s2">I don&#39;t know Korean.</p>
<p begin="01:09:36.000" end="01:09:38.350" style="s2">You were the one who volunteered to translate just now.</p>
<p begin="01:09:38.533" end="01:09:39.683" style="s2">Now you say you can&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="01:09:40.133" end="01:09:41.716" style="s2">Do you know how much money I might lose?</p>
<p begin="01:09:42.399" end="01:09:43.899" style="s2">You didn&#39;t say in advance he&#39;s Korean.</p>
<p begin="01:09:44.399" end="01:09:45.550" style="s2">You</p>
<p begin="01:09:46.000" end="01:09:46.883" style="s2">idiot.</p>
<p begin="01:09:47.066" end="01:09:47.949" style="s2">Shut up.</p>
<p begin="01:09:53.066" end="01:09:55.000" style="s2">Hello, Mr. Hebrew</p>
<p begin="01:09:55.300" end="01:09:56.350" style="s2">Hello</p>
<p begin="01:09:58.933" end="01:10:01.050" style="s2">Little sister, are you speaking Korean?</p>
<p begin="01:10:02.000" end="01:10:05.683" style="s2">She&#39;s last in our school, she&#39;s never learned Korean</p>
<p begin="01:10:06.133" end="01:10:07.016" style="s2">Boss Zhang</p>
<p begin="01:10:07.066" end="01:10:08.216" style="s2">Don&#39;t let her fool you</p>
<p begin="01:10:08.533" end="01:10:09.849" style="s2">Then what is she saying?</p>
<p begin="01:10:10.533" end="01:10:13.683" style="s2">Who knows where she picked up a few words</p>
<p begin="01:10:13.733" end="01:10:14.883" style="s2">Making things up here</p>
<p begin="01:10:15.333" end="01:10:17.949" style="s2">Hello, nice to meet you</p>
<p begin="01:10:18.133" end="01:10:19.283" style="s2">Hello</p>
<p begin="01:10:20.800" end="01:10:23.816" style="s2">Mr. Hebrew actually understood</p>
<p begin="01:10:24.133" end="01:10:25.949" style="s2">When did Luo Ying learn Korean?</p>
<p begin="01:10:26.933" end="01:10:30.483" style="s2">She&#39;s not like you, I almost believed your nonsense</p>
<p begin="01:10:31.733" end="01:10:32.383" style="s2">Little girl</p>
<p begin="01:10:32.933" end="01:10:34.516" style="s2">Can you be my translator?</p>
<p begin="01:10:36.666" end="01:10:37.283" style="s2">Sure</p>
<p begin="01:10:39.466" end="01:10:42.350" style="s2">Please help me translate, tell him</p>
<p begin="01:10:42.533" end="01:10:45.050" style="s2">I want to discuss a hundred million deal with him</p>
<p begin="01:11:10.133" end="01:11:11.450" style="s2">Thank you, little girl</p>
<p begin="01:11:11.733" end="01:11:13.983" style="s2">You closed a hundred million deal for me</p>
<p begin="01:11:14.266" end="01:11:15.983" style="s2">That&#39;s like saving my life</p>
<p begin="01:11:17.599" end="01:11:18.250" style="s2">Boss Zhang</p>
<p begin="01:11:18.933" end="01:11:22.483" style="s2">Luo Ying is my niece, could you</p>
<p begin="01:11:22.533" end="01:11:26.350" style="s2">Please, for her sake, forgive my daughter this once</p>
<p begin="01:11:26.533" end="01:11:30.083" style="s2">She&#39;s young and foolish, I didn&#39;t mean to offend</p>
<p begin="01:11:30.933" end="01:11:31.849" style="s2">Boss Zhang</p>
<p begin="01:11:32.666" end="01:11:33.949" style="s2">I have nothing to do with them</p>
<p begin="01:11:36.399" end="01:11:39.016" style="s2">Luo Ying, I&#39;m your uncle</p>
<p begin="01:11:41.200" end="01:11:42.616" style="s2">They are my family</p>
<p begin="01:11:46.000" end="01:11:46.916" style="s2">My apologies</p>
<p begin="01:11:47.599" end="01:11:49.583" style="s2">So you&#39;re Luo Ying&#39;s father</p>
<p begin="01:11:50.266" end="01:11:52.516" style="s2">What you mentioned earlier, that&#39;s easy</p>
<p begin="01:11:52.800" end="01:11:55.849" style="s2">Come to my company tomorrow, we&#39;ll talk investment</p>
<p begin="01:11:58.133" end="01:11:58.749" style="s2">This</p>
<p begin="01:11:59.466" end="01:12:01.150" style="s2">Thank you, thank you Boss Zhang</p>
<p begin="01:12:01.200" end="01:12:01.583" style="s2">You two talk</p>
<p begin="01:12:07.466" end="01:12:08.616" style="s2">What do you have to be proud of?</p>
<p begin="01:12:08.800" end="01:12:10.216" style="s2">So what if you know Korean?</p>
<p begin="01:12:10.666" end="01:12:13.550" style="s2">You&#39;re still last in class</p>
<p begin="01:12:16.666" end="01:12:20.616" style="s2">Sometimes I really envy your ignorance and confidence</p>
<p begin="01:12:27.000" end="01:12:29.949" style="s2">Teacher, I&#39;m Yingying&#39;s father</p>
<p begin="01:12:30.266" end="01:12:33.816" style="s2">Everyone saw, her grades are bad</p>
<p begin="01:12:34.133" end="01:12:37.000" style="s2">The teacher called for a home visit</p>
<p begin="01:12:37.166" end="01:12:39.550" style="s2">Maybe to persuade her to drop out</p>
<p begin="01:12:48.266" end="01:12:50.333" style="s2">Teacher, please say it out loud</p>
<p begin="01:12:50.833" end="01:12:51.649" style="s2">Luo Ying</p>
<p begin="01:12:52.266" end="01:12:53.416" style="s2">What rank did she get</p>
<p begin="01:12:54.266" end="01:12:55.183" style="s2">Luo Mengdie</p>
<p begin="01:12:56.133" end="01:12:57.450" style="s2">Don&#39;t go too far</p>
<p begin="01:12:58.933" end="01:13:01.816" style="s2">Didn&#39;t you say you didn&#39;t mind Luo Ying ranking last?</p>
<p begin="01:13:02.133" end="01:13:03.416" style="s2">Why are you pulling me?</p>
<p begin="01:13:03.466" end="01:13:06.749" style="s2">What, you feel embarrassed too?</p>
<p begin="01:13:07.466" end="01:13:08.383" style="s2">Let me go first.</p>
<p begin="01:13:08.933" end="01:13:09.816" style="s2">Let her ask.</p>
<p begin="01:13:11.466" end="01:13:13.683" style="s2">Luo Ying&#39;s family is right next to the phone.</p>
<p begin="01:13:13.866" end="01:13:14.483" style="s2">Teacher,</p>
<p begin="01:13:14.933" end="01:13:16.616" style="s2">hurry up and announce her rank.</p>
<p begin="01:13:16.666" end="01:13:17.550" style="s2">Say it already!</p>
<p begin="01:13:18.666" end="01:13:20.483" style="s2">Luo Ying&#39;s parent, congratulations!</p>
<p begin="01:13:20.666" end="01:13:22.749" style="s2">Luo Ying scored first place in the whole school this time.</p>
<p begin="01:13:23.066" end="01:13:25.583" style="s2">Total score 750, a perfect score.</p>
<p begin="01:13:25.599" end="01:13:26.383" style="s2">That&#39;s amazing!</p>
<p begin="01:13:26.533" end="01:13:27.533" style="s2">Perfect score!</p>
<p begin="01:13:28.533" end="01:13:30.616" style="s2">My Yingying got a perfect score!</p>
<p begin="01:13:31.466" end="01:13:32.083" style="s2">Old Luo,</p>
<p begin="01:13:33.066" end="01:13:34.066" style="s2">did you hear that?</p>
<p begin="01:13:34.466" end="01:13:36.350" style="s2">I heard, I heard it all.</p>
<p begin="01:13:37.066" end="01:13:41.283" style="s2">My daughter, Luo Guodong&#39;s daughter, is first place, a genius!</p>
<p begin="01:13:42.266" end="01:13:44.216" style="s2">I&#39;ve never been this proud in my life.</p>
<p begin="01:13:45.066" end="01:13:47.550" style="s2">Sis, you&#39;re truly my ancestor!</p>
<p begin="01:13:47.733" end="01:13:49.416" style="s2">From now on, your second brother is following you.</p>
<p begin="01:13:49.466" end="01:13:49.983" style="s2">Sis,</p>
<p begin="01:13:52.800" end="01:13:54.383" style="s2">Luo Ying got a perfect score!</p>
<p begin="01:13:54.666" end="01:13:58.350" style="s2">Didn&#39;t Luo Mengdie say she was at the bottom and a poor student?</p>
<p begin="01:13:58.666" end="01:14:02.516" style="s2">I bet Luo Mengdie was jealous of Luo Ying and deliberately lied to smear her.</p>
<p begin="01:14:02.733" end="01:14:05.150" style="s2">Cheating, Luo Ying must have cheated!</p>
<p begin="01:14:05.333" end="01:14:08.383" style="s2">Last monthly exam she was still last in the whole school.</p>
<p begin="01:14:09.066" end="01:14:11.416" style="s2">It&#39;s impossible to get a perfect score in just one month.</p>
<p begin="01:14:11.966" end="01:14:14.466" style="s2">Luo Mengdie, our school&#39;s surveillance</p>
<p begin="01:14:14.633" end="01:14:16.483" style="s2">and anti-cheating systems are top-notch nationwide.</p>
<p begin="01:14:16.666" end="01:14:18.883" style="s2">The scores are absolutely real. Besides,</p>
<p begin="01:14:19.066" end="01:14:20.616" style="s2">Luo Ying&#39;s ability has long been proven.</p>
<p begin="01:14:20.800" end="01:14:23.816" style="s2">You already lost to her in last week&#39;s math test.</p>
<p begin="01:14:28.133" end="01:14:30.749" style="s2">You can&#39;t beat her yourself, so you slander her for cheating.</p>
<p begin="01:14:31.200" end="01:14:32.783" style="s2">I was almost fooled by her too.</p>
<p begin="01:14:34.533" end="01:14:37.050" style="s2">Luo Ying, you&#39;re so scheming.</p>
<p begin="01:14:37.333" end="01:14:40.083" style="s2">You deliberately did poorly to mislead me,</p>
<p begin="01:14:40.399" end="01:14:43.416" style="s2">just to make me look bad in front of all the elites today.</p>
<p begin="01:14:44.666" end="01:14:47.683" style="s2">You&#39;re not even worth my scheming.</p>
<p begin="01:14:48.399" end="01:14:50.749" style="s2">You&#39;ve embarrassed yourself enough. Come home with me.</p>
<p begin="01:14:57.333" end="01:14:58.483" style="s2">Dad, Mom,</p>
<p begin="01:14:59.066" end="01:15:01.949" style="s2">With Boss Zhang&#39;s funding, our company will slowly recover.</p>
<p begin="01:15:02.133" end="01:15:03.016" style="s2">How about</p>
<p begin="01:15:03.866" end="01:15:05.683" style="s2">we send Big Brother and Second Brother back to school?</p>
<p begin="01:15:07.200" end="01:15:08.616" style="s2">I was thinking the same thing.</p>
<p begin="01:15:09.200" end="01:15:10.083" style="s2">Great!</p>
<p begin="01:15:10.666" end="01:15:13.416" style="s2">I never thought I&#39;d have another chance to study.</p>
<p begin="01:15:14.133" end="01:15:16.350" style="s2">We have to thank Yingying for helping the family pay off debts</p>
<p begin="01:15:16.666" end="01:15:18.083" style="s2">and securing Boss Zhang&#39;s investment.</p>
<p begin="01:15:19.733" end="01:15:22.883" style="s2">I don&#39;t want to study. With that money, you might as well get me a racing team.</p>
<p begin="01:15:23.066" end="01:15:24.216" style="s2">Let me go compete.</p>
<p begin="01:15:24.266" end="01:15:24.883" style="s2">You&#39;ve got guts.</p>
<p begin="01:15:25.066" end="01:15:26.883" style="s2">What future can you have without studying?</p>
<p begin="01:15:29.733" end="01:15:33.283" style="s2">Mom, I don&#39;t think Second Brother is cut out for studying.</p>
<p begin="01:15:33.866" end="01:15:37.316" style="s2">Racing can win prize money too, just let Second Brother go.</p>
<p begin="01:15:42.533" end="01:15:43.949" style="s2">Let&#39;s all listen to Yingying.</p>
<p begin="01:15:44.800" end="01:15:45.416" style="s2">Like this.</p>
<p begin="01:15:46.666" end="01:15:50.883" style="s2">Once the company gets running, I&#39;ll invest one million in your racing team.</p>
<p begin="01:15:50.933" end="01:15:52.350" style="s2">Deal, that&#39;s great.</p>
<p begin="01:15:52.666" end="01:15:54.616" style="s2">Thanks Dad, thanks little sister.</p>
<p begin="01:16:01.200" end="01:16:02.083" style="s2">Get out of the way!</p>
<p begin="01:16:04.133" end="01:16:05.016" style="s2">A gunfight!</p>
<p begin="01:16:07.466" end="01:16:08.350" style="s2">Second Brother, hurry!</p>
<p begin="01:16:12.533" end="01:16:13.683" style="s2">Little sister, come back!</p>
<p begin="01:16:16.666" end="01:16:18.616" style="s2">How can a person be this fast?</p>
<p begin="01:16:18.800" end="01:16:19.816" style="s2">Faster than a bullet.</p>
<p begin="01:16:20.533" end="01:16:22.383" style="s2">Is this the power of the King of Killers?</p>
<p begin="01:16:22.666" end="01:16:23.816" style="s2">Too terrifying.</p>
<p begin="01:16:24.266" end="01:16:27.016" style="s2">You should be grateful I don&#39;t kill easily now.</p>
<p begin="01:16:27.200" end="01:16:28.516" style="s2">Go back and tell Tyrannosaurus.</p>
<p begin="01:16:29.200" end="01:16:31.183" style="s2">Don&#39;t touch my family, or else.</p>
<p begin="01:16:32.266" end="01:16:33.849" style="s2">I don&#39;t mind going down with him.</p>
<p begin="01:16:41.066" end="01:16:43.683" style="s2">Little sister, who are they?</p>
<p begin="01:16:44.133" end="01:16:45.550" style="s2">What on earth is going on?</p>
<p begin="01:16:46.533" end="01:16:48.749" style="s2">How am I supposed to explain all this to my family?</p>
<p begin="01:16:58.800" end="01:17:00.216" style="s2">So handsome!</p>
<p begin="01:17:00.533" end="01:17:03.683" style="s2">Isn&#39;t this exactly what I dreamed of looking like when I grow up?</p>
<p begin="01:17:06.933" end="01:17:10.216" style="s2">His eyes are terrifying, like he wants to kill me.</p>
<p begin="01:17:22.866" end="01:17:23.983" style="s2">Yingying.</p>
<p begin="01:17:24.666" end="01:17:26.466" style="s2">Are they your friends?</p>
<p begin="01:17:26.766" end="01:17:27.949" style="s2">Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:17:30.666" end="01:17:32.250" style="s2">You&#39;re Luo Ying&#39;s family.</p>
<p begin="01:17:33.066" end="01:17:35.583" style="s2">Let me introduce myself first, my name is Deng Zhiguo.</p>
<p begin="01:17:36.000" end="01:17:36.916" style="s2">I&#39;m with the military.</p>
<p begin="01:17:37.466" end="01:17:39.983" style="s2">Captain Deng, may I ask.</p>
<p begin="01:17:40.399" end="01:17:42.483" style="s2">Why did they attack us?</p>
<p begin="01:17:42.800" end="01:17:45.316" style="s2">I don&#39;t know where classmate Luo Ying provoked overseas killers.</p>
<p begin="01:17:45.466" end="01:17:47.450" style="s2">Since she chose to join the special forces.</p>
<p begin="01:17:47.466" end="01:17:49.016" style="s2">I have an obligation to help cover for her.</p>
<p begin="01:17:51.599" end="01:17:54.883" style="s2">It&#39;s like this, during military training, classmate Luo Ying.</p>
<p begin="01:17:54.933" end="01:17:57.283" style="s2">Showed extremely high talent in shooting and combat.</p>
<p begin="01:17:57.599" end="01:18:00.383" style="s2">So our military made an exception to recruit her.</p>
<p begin="01:18:01.333" end="01:18:03.283" style="s2">After these overseas criminals found out.</p>
<p begin="01:18:03.333" end="01:18:05.983" style="s2">They wanted to coerce her by attacking her family.</p>
<p begin="01:18:06.000" end="01:18:07.050" style="s2">To strike at us through this.</p>
<p begin="01:18:08.399" end="01:18:09.550" style="s2">Can she not join?</p>
<p begin="01:18:10.266" end="01:18:11.150" style="s2">It&#39;s too dangerous.</p>
<p begin="01:18:12.933" end="01:18:13.550" style="s2">Mom.</p>
<p begin="01:18:14.533" end="01:18:16.383" style="s2">I&#39;m already exposed to them now.</p>
<p begin="01:18:16.533" end="01:18:18.116" style="s2">It&#39;s too late to back out now.</p>
<p begin="01:18:18.933" end="01:18:21.050" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry, today was an accident.</p>
<p begin="01:18:21.466" end="01:18:24.649" style="s2">Starting tomorrow, I&#39;ll have people stationed around your home.</p>
<p begin="01:18:24.666" end="01:18:25.450" style="s2">To protect you.</p>
<p begin="01:18:26.933" end="01:18:27.849" style="s2">And this one here.</p>
<p begin="01:18:28.533" end="01:18:29.583" style="s2">He&#39;s the leader of the Chiyan Legion.</p>
<p begin="01:18:30.533" end="01:18:31.849" style="s2">He&#39;ll also send people to protect you.</p>
<p begin="01:18:33.599" end="01:18:34.216" style="s2">Leader.</p>
<p begin="01:18:35.333" end="01:18:36.883" style="s2">Sounds impressive.</p>
<p begin="01:18:38.133" end="01:18:40.749" style="s2">Hello, Leader. I&#39;m Luo Ying&#39;s second brother.</p>
<p begin="01:18:41.733" end="01:18:44.350" style="s2">Our leader has OCD. No handshakes.</p>
<p begin="01:18:51.066" end="01:18:53.716" style="s2">See? Leader Lu doesn&#39;t mind me.</p>
<p begin="01:18:55.333" end="01:18:56.749" style="s2">I never mind.</p>
<p begin="01:18:58.266" end="01:18:59.183" style="s2">My own family.</p>
<p begin="01:19:01.333" end="01:19:02.216" style="s2">Family?</p>
<p begin="01:19:03.733" end="01:19:05.550" style="s2">Leader, what do you mean?</p>
<p begin="01:19:06.000" end="01:19:07.050" style="s2">Am I not your family?</p>
<p begin="01:19:09.200" end="01:19:11.716" style="s2">We don&#39;t seem to be related.</p>
<p begin="01:19:12.266" end="01:19:12.916" style="s2">Leader Lu.</p>
<p begin="01:19:14.133" end="01:19:15.583" style="s2">What do you mean by that?</p>
<p begin="01:19:17.333" end="01:19:19.983" style="s2">Leader Lu, you&#39;re a distant relative of the Luo family.</p>
<p begin="01:19:20.666" end="01:19:23.183" style="s2">No wonder Leader Lu cares so much about Luo Ying.</p>
<p begin="01:19:27.333" end="01:19:28.383" style="s2">What are you trying to do?</p>
<p begin="01:19:28.933" end="01:19:29.816" style="s2">Don&#39;t talk nonsense.</p>
<p begin="01:19:30.533" end="01:19:31.050" style="s2">Miss Luo.</p>
<p begin="01:19:31.733" end="01:19:33.683" style="s2">You still don&#39;t really know our leader.</p>
<p begin="01:19:34.266" end="01:19:36.649" style="s2">No one can stop him from doing what he wants.</p>
<p begin="01:19:40.800" end="01:19:42.216" style="s2">Seems little Ying hasn&#39;t told you yet.</p>
<p begin="01:19:42.800" end="01:19:44.250" style="s2">We&#39;ve already made a private commitment.</p>
<p begin="01:19:46.000" end="01:19:48.616" style="s2">Once she graduates, we&#39;ll get our marriage certificate.</p>
<p begin="01:19:51.066" end="01:19:54.883" style="s2">I actually recruited Leader Lu&#39;s fiancée into the army.</p>
<p begin="01:19:58.666" end="01:20:00.083" style="s2">Is what he said true?</p>
<p begin="01:20:01.866" end="01:20:03.316" style="s2">If you dare say no—</p>
<p begin="01:20:04.000" end="01:20:06.216" style="s2">I&#39;ll expose your real identity.</p>
<p begin="01:20:06.933" end="01:20:09.550" style="s2">If I become a ruthless villain—</p>
<p begin="01:20:09.866" end="01:20:11.949" style="s2">You&#39;ll be the one to blame.</p>
<p begin="01:20:14.533" end="01:20:16.116" style="s2">Do you know how to write the word &#39;shame&#39;?</p>
<p begin="01:20:17.333" end="01:20:19.050" style="s2">Compared to you, a flower-picking thief—</p>
<p begin="01:20:19.466" end="01:20:21.016" style="s2">I think I still have some shame.</p>
<p begin="01:20:28.000" end="01:20:29.683" style="s2">Yingying just loves clinging to me.</p>
<p begin="01:20:30.266" end="01:20:33.949" style="s2">Mom, Dad, don&#39;t worry. I&#39;ll take good care of Yingying.</p>
<p begin="01:20:38.133" end="01:20:40.916" style="s2">You&#39;re already calling them Mom and Dad before marriage?</p>
<p begin="01:20:42.266" end="01:20:43.416" style="s2">It&#39;s only a matter of time.</p>
<p begin="01:20:44.133" end="01:20:46.749" style="s2">No wonder Yingying stopped clinging to Duanmu Chen.</p>
<p begin="01:20:46.933" end="01:20:48.116" style="s2">So it&#39;s because of Leader Lu.</p>
<p begin="01:20:49.200" end="01:20:52.116" style="s2">Leader Lu is handsome, has status and position.</p>
<p begin="01:20:52.933" end="01:20:55.416" style="s2">He seems quite compatible with Yingying.</p>
<p begin="01:20:56.266" end="01:20:57.450" style="s2">That&#39;s true.</p>
<p begin="01:20:58.533" end="01:20:59.183" style="s2">Little Lu.</p>
<p begin="01:20:59.866" end="01:21:03.550" style="s2">Why don&#39;t you come inside and chat? Luo Ying&#39;s dad is a great cook.</p>
<p begin="01:21:03.866" end="01:21:05.683" style="s2">Let him cook you some of his specialties.</p>
<p begin="01:21:06.533" end="01:21:07.683" style="s2">Come sit at home.</p>
<p begin="01:21:08.399" end="01:21:09.583" style="s2">I&#39;m afraid that won&#39;t work.</p>
<p begin="01:21:10.133" end="01:21:12.383" style="s2">Tomorrow is the special agent selection day.</p>
<p begin="01:21:12.933" end="01:21:14.783" style="s2">Luo Ying, come back to the army with me.</p>
<p begin="01:21:16.000" end="01:21:17.716" style="s2">Luo Ying, let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="01:21:20.933" end="01:21:21.550" style="s2">Goodbye.</p>
<p begin="01:21:30.266" end="01:21:32.866" style="s2">Captain Deng, a man like you actually lives</p>
<p begin="01:21:33.033" end="01:21:34.749" style="s2">in such an ordinary old neighborhood.</p>
<p begin="01:21:36.000" end="01:21:37.416" style="s2">Don&#39;t stand, sit.</p>
<p begin="01:21:42.800" end="01:21:45.416" style="s2">Captain Deng, thanks for helping me out.</p>
<p begin="01:21:46.266" end="01:21:48.383" style="s2">Chief Lu contacted me and asked me to come.</p>
<p begin="01:21:48.533" end="01:21:49.150" style="s2">What?</p>
<p begin="01:21:50.000" end="01:21:51.683" style="s2">Are we family or not? No need for formalities.</p>
<p begin="01:21:52.666" end="01:21:54.649" style="s2">Thank you, Chief Lu.</p>
<p begin="01:21:56.800" end="01:21:58.483" style="s2">Can&#39;t let him keep talking.</p>
<p begin="01:21:59.333" end="01:22:00.216" style="s2">Captain Deng.</p>
<p begin="01:22:01.066" end="01:22:02.516" style="s2">Last time you mentioned an assessment.</p>
<p begin="01:22:02.666" end="01:22:04.883" style="s2">Why is it now a special agent selection?</p>
<p begin="01:22:06.666" end="01:22:08.916" style="s2">Foreign assassin organizations have infiltrated the country.</p>
<p begin="01:22:09.866" end="01:22:11.050" style="s2">They have two targets.</p>
<p begin="01:22:12.266" end="01:22:13.849" style="s2">First, assassinate the King of Assassins, Rakshasa.</p>
<p begin="01:22:14.266" end="01:22:17.316" style="s2">Second, attack key personnel of our country.</p>
<p begin="01:22:18.533" end="01:22:21.183" style="s2">The special agents&#39; mission is to stop their plans.</p>
<p begin="01:22:21.333" end="01:22:22.649" style="s2">Ensure personnel safety.</p>
<p begin="01:22:22.933" end="01:22:25.849" style="s2">I vouched for you to the organization to let you participate exceptionally.</p>
<p begin="01:22:26.266" end="01:22:27.150" style="s2">So that&#39;s how it is.</p>
<p begin="01:22:28.933" end="01:22:30.733" style="s2">Look at my memory, please sit down first.</p>
<p begin="01:22:30.900" end="01:22:32.083" style="s2">I&#39;ll make tea for you.</p>
<p begin="01:22:42.266" end="01:22:45.183" style="s2">You&#39;re a bit strange today.</p>
<p begin="01:22:48.800" end="01:22:49.450" style="s2">Am I?</p>
<p begin="01:22:51.333" end="01:22:52.250" style="s2">Honestly,</p>
<p begin="01:22:53.066" end="01:22:54.216" style="s2">what are you hiding?</p>
<p begin="01:23:05.599" end="01:23:06.483" style="s2">Take a look at this.</p>
<p begin="01:23:12.133" end="01:23:13.450" style="s2">After I asked you last time,</p>
<p begin="01:23:14.800" end="01:23:17.016" style="s2">I had someone investigate your biological parents&#39; information.</p>
<p begin="01:23:18.800" end="01:23:20.250" style="s2">Your father&#39;s name is Deng Zhiguo.</p>
<p begin="01:23:21.333" end="01:23:22.250" style="s2">Your mother&#39;s name is Luo Man.</p>
<p begin="01:23:26.000" end="01:23:27.050" style="s2">Luo Manren.</p>
<p begin="01:23:27.466" end="01:23:28.516" style="s2">Twelve years ago,</p>
<p begin="01:23:29.333" end="01:23:30.383" style="s2">died.</p>
<p begin="01:23:34.266" end="01:23:35.949" style="s2">Why did they abandon me?</p>
<p begin="01:23:38.133" end="01:23:39.716" style="s2">The information was erased.</p>
<p begin="01:23:40.266" end="01:23:41.050" style="s2">Can&#39;t find it.</p>
<p begin="01:23:42.933" end="01:23:44.383" style="s2">You can go ask him yourself.</p>
<p begin="01:23:48.000" end="01:23:48.916" style="s2">Give it to me.</p>
<p begin="01:23:54.800" end="01:23:57.283" style="s2">It&#39;s not good to do this on someone else&#39;s sofa.</p>
<p begin="01:24:03.066" end="01:24:03.849" style="s2">Why are you taking out a gun?</p>
<p begin="01:24:04.133" end="01:24:05.150" style="s2">Wait.</p>
<p begin="01:24:05.733" end="01:24:06.916" style="s2">Even if I hear one sentence.</p>
<p begin="01:24:07.866" end="01:24:10.649" style="s2">They abandoned me back then, they just didn&#39;t want this child.</p>
<p begin="01:24:12.533" end="01:24:14.383" style="s2">I would kill him directly.</p>
<p begin="01:24:17.466" end="01:24:19.016" style="s2">Sorry to keep you waiting.</p>
<p begin="01:24:24.266" end="01:24:26.116" style="s2">Freshly brewed Longjing tea, it&#39;s a bit hot.</p>
<p begin="01:24:26.133" end="01:24:27.316" style="s2">Drink slowly.</p>
<p begin="01:24:28.399" end="01:24:29.050" style="s2">Captain Deng.</p>
<p begin="01:24:29.866" end="01:24:31.983" style="s2">I heard your daughter went missing.</p>
<p begin="01:24:33.066" end="01:24:33.849" style="s2">I want to ask,</p>
<p begin="01:24:34.933" end="01:24:37.050" style="s2">why did you abandon her back then?</p>
<p begin="01:24:39.066" end="01:24:39.450" style="s2">Captain Deng.</p>
<p begin="01:24:40.533" end="01:24:42.250" style="s2">I heard your daughter went missing.</p>
<p begin="01:24:43.466" end="01:24:44.916" style="s2">I want to ask,</p>
<p begin="01:24:45.599" end="01:24:47.316" style="s2">why did you abandon her back then?</p>
<p begin="01:24:49.866" end="01:24:52.916" style="s2">How do you know about my daughter and wife?</p>
<p begin="01:24:53.200" end="01:24:54.116" style="s2">I told her.</p>
<p begin="01:24:56.800" end="01:24:57.716" style="s2">Speaking of which,</p>
<p begin="01:24:58.399" end="01:24:59.316" style="s2">it&#39;s quite a coincidence.</p>
<p begin="01:25:00.933" end="01:25:02.516" style="s2">My wife&#39;s surname is also Luo.</p>
<p begin="01:25:03.066" end="01:25:03.949" style="s2">Her name is Luo Man.</p>
<p begin="01:25:05.866" end="01:25:07.183" style="s2">I come from a military family.</p>
<p begin="01:25:08.133" end="01:25:10.483" style="s2">I met Luo Man through a blind date.</p>
<p begin="01:25:12.000" end="01:25:14.116" style="s2">I thought we&#39;d just make do.</p>
<p begin="01:25:14.933" end="01:25:18.916" style="s2">But it was love at first sight.</p>
<p begin="01:25:19.333" end="01:25:20.250" style="s2">Not long after,</p>
<p begin="01:25:21.066" end="01:25:22.116" style="s2">we had a child.</p>
<p begin="01:25:23.733" end="01:25:24.649" style="s2">Back then,</p>
<p begin="01:25:25.599" end="01:25:27.183" style="s2">Xiaoman held the baby every day,</p>
<p begin="01:25:28.133" end="01:25:29.583" style="s2">she wouldn&#39;t even let anyone else hold her.</p>
<p begin="01:25:30.266" end="01:25:31.849" style="s2">Sounds like he really cherished her.</p>
<p begin="01:25:33.599" end="01:25:34.916" style="s2">When my baby was born,</p>
<p begin="01:25:35.733" end="01:25:37.316" style="s2">she didn&#39;t cry or fuss.</p>
<p begin="01:25:38.399" end="01:25:40.083" style="s2">Even the hospital nurses said</p>
<p begin="01:25:40.933" end="01:25:42.383" style="s2">they&#39;d never seen such</p>
<p begin="01:25:43.066" end="01:25:44.516" style="s2">such a cute baby.</p>
<p begin="01:25:46.133" end="01:25:47.316" style="s2">I thought at the time,</p>
<p begin="01:25:48.533" end="01:25:49.949" style="s2">even though she&#39;s a girl,</p>
<p begin="01:25:50.933" end="01:25:51.716" style="s2">but in the future,</p>
<p begin="01:25:52.266" end="01:25:53.849" style="s2">maybe she could inherit my career</p>
<p begin="01:25:54.533" end="01:25:57.716" style="s2">and become a female soldier serving the country and the people.</p>
<p begin="01:25:58.266" end="01:25:59.583" style="s2">You&#39;d never dream</p>
<p begin="01:26:00.399" end="01:26:01.183" style="s2">that your daughter</p>
<p begin="01:26:01.599" end="01:26:05.150" style="s2">became a killer everyone hates and fears.</p>
<p begin="01:26:06.000" end="01:26:07.316" style="s2">But our happy days</p>
<p begin="01:26:08.399" end="01:26:09.316" style="s2">were completely shattered</p>
<p begin="01:26:09.333" end="01:26:12.383" style="s2">after I arrested Li Meng, the second-in-command of the international terrorist organization Nine Colors.</p>
<p begin="01:26:14.000" end="01:26:15.316" style="s2">were completely shattered.</p>
<p begin="01:26:17.466" end="01:26:22.383" style="s2">The leader of Nine Colors blamed me for his brother&#39;s death.</p>
<p begin="01:26:23.333" end="01:26:24.383" style="s2">He sent an assassin</p>
<p begin="01:26:26.133" end="01:26:27.450" style="s2">who killed my wife</p>
<p begin="01:26:28.133" end="01:26:29.316" style="s2">and took my child.</p>
<p begin="01:26:31.733" end="01:26:32.649" style="s2">Nineteen years.</p>
<p begin="01:26:34.399" end="01:26:35.983" style="s2">I&#39;ll never forget that day.</p>
<p begin="01:26:37.866" end="01:26:39.583" style="s2">Xiaoman.</p>
<p begin="01:26:40.266" end="01:26:42.116" style="s2">In a white dress.</p>
<p begin="01:26:44.133" end="01:26:45.583" style="s2">Lying in a pool of blood.</p>
<p begin="01:26:46.666" end="01:26:48.116" style="s2">She died with her eyes open.</p>
<p begin="01:26:49.599" end="01:26:50.516" style="s2">The one who killed your wife</p>
<p begin="01:26:51.866" end="01:26:54.250" style="s2">is the world&#39;s second-ranked assassin.</p>
<p begin="01:26:55.599" end="01:26:56.250" style="s2">T-Rex.</p>
<p begin="01:26:58.399" end="01:26:59.050" style="s2">It&#39;s him.</p>
<p begin="01:27:00.266" end="01:27:01.000" style="s2">Leader of the Nine Colors organization.</p>
<p begin="01:27:01.166" end="01:27:03.450" style="s2">He trained me as an assassin to get revenge on Deng Zhiguo.</p>
<p begin="01:27:04.000" end="01:27:04.916" style="s2">Unfortunately,</p>
<p begin="01:27:05.599" end="01:27:08.616" style="s2">this man is so mysterious even I don&#39;t know who he is.</p>
<p begin="01:27:09.333" end="01:27:11.583" style="s2">I wonder if the military has found anything.</p>
<p begin="01:27:12.933" end="01:27:13.716" style="s2">Tell me,</p>
<p begin="01:27:14.266" end="01:27:15.716" style="s2">who is the leader of that underground organization?</p>
<p begin="01:27:19.599" end="01:27:20.783" style="s2">I&#39;ve been investigating for nineteen years.</p>
<p begin="01:27:21.866" end="01:27:22.649" style="s2">All I know is</p>
<p begin="01:27:23.333" end="01:27:24.783" style="s2">he&#39;s Li Meng&#39;s biological older brother.</p>
<p begin="01:27:25.733" end="01:27:29.849" style="s2">His name? Can&#39;t find it.</p>
<p begin="01:27:30.133" end="01:27:31.450" style="s2">To find his information,</p>
<p begin="01:27:32.399" end="01:27:35.183" style="s2">you&#39;d need a world-class hacker.</p>
<p begin="01:27:37.733" end="01:27:39.050" style="s2">I plan to spend a fortune</p>
<p begin="01:27:39.733" end="01:27:41.183" style="s2">to hire a world-class hacker</p>
<p begin="01:27:42.000" end="01:27:44.616" style="s2">to uncover all his identities. Supposedly</p>
<p begin="01:27:45.333" end="01:27:47.016" style="s2">the success rate is only ten percent.</p>
<p begin="01:27:49.733" end="01:27:50.250" style="s2">Even if</p>
<p begin="01:27:50.933" end="01:27:52.116" style="s2">there&#39;s only a one percent chance,</p>
<p begin="01:27:55.599" end="01:27:56.649" style="s2">I won&#39;t give up.</p>
<p begin="01:27:57.733" end="01:27:58.649" style="s2">No need for all that trouble.</p>
<p begin="01:28:00.000" end="01:28:02.649" style="s2">I&#39;ll find all his information for you.</p>
<p begin="01:28:03.466" end="01:28:05.450" style="s2">Success rate: one hundred percent.</p>
<p begin="01:28:06.666" end="01:28:07.949" style="s2">Leave the revenge to me too.</p>
<p begin="01:28:11.466" end="01:28:13.933" style="s2">The success rate a world-class hacker quoted</p>
<p begin="01:28:14.100" end="01:28:14.883" style="s2">is only ten percent.</p>
<p begin="01:28:16.133" end="01:28:16.649" style="s2">Luo Ying,</p>
<p begin="01:28:17.599" end="01:28:18.649" style="s2">stop messing with me.</p>
<p begin="01:28:19.866" end="01:28:20.649" style="s2">I&#39;m not joking.</p>
<p begin="01:28:28.266" end="01:28:29.016" style="s2">Captain Deng,</p>
<p begin="01:28:30.399" end="01:28:31.416" style="s2">trust Luo Ying.</p>
<p begin="01:28:33.466" end="01:28:34.516" style="s2">Can this really work?</p>
<p begin="01:28:37.733" end="01:28:40.116" style="s2">Then I&#39;ll thank you.</p>
<p begin="01:28:41.466" end="01:28:42.083" style="s2">You&#39;re welcome.</p>
<p begin="01:28:42.933" end="01:28:43.816" style="s2">I have things to do.</p>
<p begin="01:28:44.399" end="01:28:45.550" style="s2">I&#39;ll come another day.</p>
<p begin="01:28:47.599" end="01:28:52.483" style="s2">Next time you come, I&#39;ll cook something good for you.</p>
<p begin="01:29:04.133" end="01:29:05.283" style="s2">Why won&#39;t you reveal yourself to him?</p>
<p begin="01:29:07.866" end="01:29:08.616" style="s2">If I did,</p>
<p begin="01:29:09.599" end="01:29:11.183" style="s2">do you think he&#39;d still let me into the special forces?</p>
<p begin="01:29:14.133" end="01:29:15.016" style="s2">I&#39;m going to avenge</p>
<p begin="01:29:15.599" end="01:29:16.749" style="s2">myself</p>
<p begin="01:29:17.599" end="01:29:18.649" style="s2">and Luoman.</p>
<p begin="01:29:21.599" end="01:29:22.783" style="s2">The number of selected candidates is set.</p>
<p begin="01:29:23.333" end="01:29:25.849" style="s2">This time, the people participating in the special operations selection</p>
<p begin="01:29:25.866" end="01:29:26.383" style="s2">are more than in previous years.</p>
<p begin="01:29:27.333" end="01:29:29.050" style="s2">But only three will be chosen.</p>
<p begin="01:29:30.399" end="01:29:32.250" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry if you don&#39;t make it.</p>
<p begin="01:29:32.933" end="01:29:34.883" style="s2">You&#39;re still young and have potential.</p>
<p begin="01:29:35.200" end="01:29:36.749" style="s2">You can try again next year.</p>
<p begin="01:29:37.733" end="01:29:41.416" style="s2">Forget three spots—even if there&#39;s only one, it&#39;s mine.</p>
<p begin="01:29:42.266" end="01:29:43.450" style="s2">I admire your confidence.</p>
<p begin="01:29:44.133" end="01:29:45.050" style="s2">Good luck.</p>
<p begin="01:29:54.800" end="01:29:55.949" style="s2">What are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="01:29:56.666" end="01:29:57.050" style="s2">Madam.</p>
<p begin="01:29:57.866" end="01:29:59.583" style="s2">To ensure we select the top candidates,</p>
<p begin="01:30:00.000" end="01:30:02.916" style="s2">we&#39;ve specially invited the leader to serve as commander of the final assessment.</p>
<p begin="01:30:03.333" end="01:30:05.849" style="s2">All assessors are from our Crimson Flame Legion,</p>
<p begin="01:30:06.000" end="01:30:08.333" style="s2">the S-class mercenaries with the most combat experience.</p>
<p begin="01:30:08.433" end="01:30:09.666" style="s2">S-class mercenaries.</p>
<p begin="01:30:09.833" end="01:30:12.383" style="s2">Every one of them is a war machine that crawled out of a pile of corpses.</p>
<p begin="01:30:12.533" end="01:30:15.316" style="s2">This assessment is hell-level difficulty.</p>
<p begin="01:30:15.733" end="01:30:19.150" style="s2">Interesting. That way we won&#39;t waste time.</p>
<p begin="01:30:20.266" end="01:30:21.316" style="s2">It&#39;s about time.</p>
<p begin="01:30:23.066" end="01:30:23.416" style="s2">Yingying,</p>
<p begin="01:30:24.399" end="01:30:25.283" style="s2">take care of yourself.</p>
<p begin="01:30:25.866" end="01:30:27.050" style="s2">I can&#39;t go with you,</p>
<p begin="01:30:27.733" end="01:30:29.416" style="s2">but you can call me anytime.</p>
<p begin="01:30:29.733" end="01:30:31.849" style="s2">Tell me right away if anything feels off.</p>
<p begin="01:30:32.800" end="01:30:33.416" style="s2">Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:30:44.533" end="01:30:45.849" style="s2">The first test is language.</p>
<p begin="01:30:46.266" end="01:30:48.516" style="s2">On the ever-changing overseas battlefield,</p>
<p begin="01:30:49.066" end="01:30:51.716" style="s2">knowing one more language means one more way to survive.</p>
<p begin="01:30:52.266" end="01:30:54.649" style="s2">Only those who master more than ten foreign languages</p>
<p begin="01:30:55.200" end="01:30:55.849" style="s2">can pass.</p>
<p begin="01:30:56.533" end="01:31:00.116" style="s2">Many candidates have been training this skill since childhood.</p>
<p begin="01:31:02.266" end="01:31:03.416" style="s2">Madam came in a hurry to compete.</p>
<p begin="01:31:04.399" end="01:31:06.250" style="s2">I&#39;m afraid she won&#39;t even pass the first test.</p>
<p begin="01:31:07.599" end="01:31:10.883" style="s2">Candidate Luo Ying, masters thirty-eight languages.</p>
<p begin="01:31:11.066" end="01:31:12.616" style="s2">Assessment passed.</p>
<p begin="01:31:17.333" end="01:31:18.749" style="s2">Amazing!</p>
<p begin="01:31:19.733" end="01:31:21.849" style="s2">Thirty-eight? Is she even human?</p>
<p begin="01:31:22.266" end="01:31:23.716" style="s2">Thirty-eight.</p>
<p begin="01:31:24.666" end="01:31:26.083" style="s2">Are you sure the number wasn&#39;t misreported?</p>
<p begin="01:31:26.666" end="01:31:29.716" style="s2">Even an eighty or ninety-year-old</p>
<p begin="01:31:30.000" end="01:31:33.583" style="s2">who&#39;s spent a lifetime studying foreign languages couldn&#39;t reach that level.</p>
<p begin="01:31:34.266" end="01:31:36.383" style="s2">No mistake. I heard it clearly just now.</p>
<p begin="01:31:36.399" end="01:31:37.849" style="s2">She really does know thirty-eight languages.</p>
<p begin="01:31:39.466" end="01:31:40.250" style="s2">I heard it too.</p>
<p begin="01:31:42.000" end="01:31:44.216" style="s2">Second assessment item: shooting.</p>
<p begin="01:31:44.666" end="01:31:46.250" style="s2">Your opponents are three mercenaries.</p>
<p begin="01:31:47.066" end="01:31:48.749" style="s2">The mercenaries have no guns on them.</p>
<p begin="01:31:49.066" end="01:31:52.749" style="s2">Knock one down and cause minor injury: plus two points.</p>
<p begin="01:31:52.933" end="01:31:55.050" style="s2">Cause serious injury: plus five points.</p>
<p begin="01:31:55.466" end="01:31:57.316" style="s2">Kill them: plus ten points.</p>
<p begin="01:31:57.866" end="01:32:00.383" style="s2">Last year they were fake guns, why are they real this year?</p>
<p begin="01:32:00.800" end="01:32:01.983" style="s2">What if someone gets killed?</p>
<p begin="01:32:02.533" end="01:32:04.916" style="s2">Just give us fake guns that shoot colored pellets.</p>
<p begin="01:32:05.200" end="01:32:06.216" style="s2">At least nothing will go wrong.</p>
<p begin="01:32:06.399" end="01:32:07.583" style="s2">Those afraid to die</p>
<p begin="01:32:08.399" end="01:32:09.183" style="s2">can forfeit.</p>
<p begin="01:32:09.866" end="01:32:11.683" style="s2">This is life-threatening, sir.</p>
<p begin="01:32:11.866" end="01:32:12.866" style="s2">I forfeit.</p>
<p begin="01:32:12.966" end="01:32:15.550" style="s2">Sir, I forfeit too.</p>
<p begin="01:32:18.133" end="01:32:21.983" style="s2">The leader&#39;s clever plan wiped out nearly half the people right at the start.</p>
<p begin="01:32:24.266" end="01:32:25.316" style="s2">The rest of you,</p>
<p begin="01:32:26.266" end="01:32:26.783" style="s2">proceed.</p>
<p begin="01:32:27.333" end="01:32:27.683" style="s2">Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:32:34.399" end="01:32:35.183" style="s2">Don&#39;t just stand there, everyone.</p>
<p begin="01:32:35.866" end="01:32:38.749" style="s2">Luo Ying isn&#39;t just good at foreign languages, her marksmanship is impressive too.</p>
<p begin="01:32:38.800" end="01:32:40.783" style="s2">That&#39;s why she was selected to compete for special operative.</p>
<p begin="01:32:41.866" end="01:32:42.749" style="s2">If she goes first,</p>
<p begin="01:32:43.599" end="01:32:45.283" style="s2">we might not be able to score at all.</p>
<p begin="01:32:54.266" end="01:32:55.450" style="s2">Drawing hatred toward the lady.</p>
<p begin="01:32:56.533" end="01:32:57.583" style="s2">What a scheme.</p>
<p begin="01:32:58.133" end="01:32:58.783" style="s2">Leader,</p>
<p begin="01:32:59.333" end="01:33:00.516" style="s2">aren&#39;t you worried about your lady?</p>
<p begin="01:33:01.066" end="01:33:02.649" style="s2">Worried she won&#39;t have enough fun?</p>
<p begin="01:33:19.333" end="01:33:20.516" style="s2">Something&#39;s wrong.</p>
<p begin="01:33:21.599" end="01:33:23.316" style="s2">The smoke is mixed with knockout drugs.</p>
<p begin="01:33:24.000" end="01:33:24.649" style="s2">Lu Heng.</p>
<p begin="01:33:25.466" end="01:33:26.516" style="s2">You planned this well.</p>
<p begin="01:33:40.266" end="01:33:42.749" style="s2">Thank you, leader&#39;s lady, for sparing our lives.</p>
<p begin="01:34:05.733" end="01:34:07.150" style="s2">Luo Ying, you&#39;re too selfish.</p>
<p begin="01:34:07.200" end="01:34:09.550" style="s2">If you kill them all, how are we supposed to accumulate points?</p>
<p begin="01:34:09.733" end="01:34:11.400" style="s2">You get to show off, but have you considered</p>
<p begin="01:34:11.566" end="01:34:14.383" style="s2">how the rest of us feel? On the assessment field, everyone relies on their own skills.</p>
<p begin="01:34:14.666" end="01:34:17.683" style="s2">What&#39;s the use of complaining? Instead of wasting time whining,</p>
<p begin="01:34:17.866" end="01:34:20.749" style="s2">better think about how to catch up on points in the next round.</p>
<p begin="01:34:20.800" end="01:34:22.749" style="s2">That&#39;s right, Luo Ying won by her own ability.</p>
<p begin="01:34:22.800" end="01:34:24.483" style="s2">What we should do is adjust our mindset</p>
<p begin="01:34:24.533" end="01:34:26.083" style="s2">and give our all in the upcoming assessment.</p>
<p begin="01:34:26.266" end="01:34:27.683" style="s2">Stop arguing, everyone.</p>
<p begin="01:34:28.266" end="01:34:29.550" style="s2">Haven&#39;t you noticed something&#39;s off?</p>
<p begin="01:34:29.866" end="01:34:31.716" style="s2">Yeah, the second assessment is over.</p>
<p begin="01:34:32.000" end="01:34:33.683" style="s2">Why isn&#39;t anyone taking us to the next place?</p>
<p begin="01:34:33.866" end="01:34:35.016" style="s2">Let&#39;s walk back and take a look.</p>
<p begin="01:34:36.399" end="01:34:37.399" style="s2">Too late.</p>
<p begin="01:34:37.699" end="01:34:38.616" style="s2">What do you mean too late?</p>
<p begin="01:35:02.133" end="01:35:03.849" style="s2">The quality of this batch of newcomers is a bit lacking.</p>
<p begin="01:35:05.200" end="01:35:06.749" style="s2">No counter-surveillance skills at all.</p>
<p begin="01:35:09.333" end="01:35:10.116" style="s2">What&#39;s the leader laughing at?</p>
<p begin="01:35:11.066" end="01:35:11.583" style="s2">Look.</p>
<p begin="01:35:22.666" end="01:35:23.816" style="s2">Found you.</p>
<p begin="01:35:24.933" end="01:35:27.316" style="s2">Our cameras are well hidden.</p>
<p begin="01:35:28.133" end="01:35:30.250" style="s2">She found them in no time.</p>
<p begin="01:35:30.933" end="01:35:31.716" style="s2">Amazing.</p>
<p begin="01:35:32.533" end="01:35:33.716" style="s2">Found you.</p>
<p begin="01:35:34.266" end="01:35:34.916" style="s2">What did she say?</p>
<p begin="01:35:35.066" end="01:35:35.983" style="s2">Found you.</p>
<p begin="01:35:36.133" end="01:35:38.649" style="s2">I remember her. Zhiguo brought her in.</p>
<p begin="01:35:39.200" end="01:35:40.916" style="s2">She got full marks in the second event.</p>
<p begin="01:35:41.466" end="01:35:43.849" style="s2">I have high hopes for her. Look how energetic she is.</p>
<p begin="01:35:44.533" end="01:35:45.716" style="s2">She&#39;s probably faking the faint.</p>
<p begin="01:35:46.933" end="01:35:48.116" style="s2">I take back what I said.</p>
<p begin="01:35:48.800" end="01:35:50.883" style="s2">This batch of newcomers has a lot of talent.</p>
<p begin="01:35:56.800" end="01:35:58.649" style="s2">Luo Ying, what are you looking at?</p>
<p begin="01:35:59.066" end="01:36:01.183" style="s2">Nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:36:01.333" end="01:36:03.016" style="s2">Let&#39;s hurry and find the exit.</p>
<p begin="01:36:08.800" end="01:36:10.483" style="s2">We&#39;ve checked all four sides. No exit.</p>
<p begin="01:36:10.533" end="01:36:12.216" style="s2">The walls are solid. We can&#39;t get out.</p>
<p begin="01:36:12.933" end="01:36:15.150" style="s2">Are we going to be caught by bad guys?</p>
<p begin="01:36:15.599" end="01:36:16.350" style="s2">Idiot.</p>
<p begin="01:36:16.933" end="01:36:18.383" style="s2">Candidates getting caught during the assessment?</p>
<p begin="01:36:18.666" end="01:36:20.350" style="s2">Do you think the military has no pride?</p>
<p begin="01:36:21.466" end="01:36:24.350" style="s2">This is my fourth year competing for special operative.</p>
<p begin="01:36:24.666" end="01:36:27.316" style="s2">This kind of test has never happened before.</p>
<p begin="01:36:28.266" end="01:36:29.949" style="s2">We&#39;ve definitely been caught by bad guys.</p>
<p begin="01:36:30.933" end="01:36:32.116" style="s2">Look, what&#39;s that?</p>
<p begin="01:36:38.399" end="01:36:40.516" style="s2">That&#39;s the sound of a bomb.</p>
<p begin="01:36:41.066" end="01:36:42.250" style="s2">See, I told you they were bad guys.</p>
<p begin="01:36:42.533" end="01:36:44.333" style="s2">How could the military use bombs to test us?</p>
<p begin="01:36:44.499" end="01:36:47.133" style="s2">Shut up. The priority is opening the safe.</p>
<p begin="01:36:47.300" end="01:36:48.083" style="s2">Defuse the bomb.</p>
<p begin="01:36:48.266" end="01:36:49.550" style="s2">I can crack any code.</p>
<p begin="01:36:49.599" end="01:36:50.066" style="s2">Let me do it.</p>
<p begin="01:36:56.800" end="01:36:58.216" style="s2">Only sixty seconds left.</p>
<p begin="01:36:59.200" end="01:37:01.416" style="s2">Hang Lu, hurry and defuse the bomb.</p>
<p begin="01:37:01.866" end="01:37:04.216" style="s2">I can crack codes, but I can&#39;t defuse bombs.</p>
<p begin="01:37:04.399" end="01:37:07.150" style="s2">How are you so useless? You can&#39;t even defuse a bomb.</p>
<p begin="01:37:07.599" end="01:37:09.283" style="s2">Are we going to die here?</p>
<p begin="01:37:10.000" end="01:37:10.616" style="s2">I&#39;ll do it.</p>
<p begin="01:37:10.666" end="01:37:13.949" style="s2">Can you? Don&#39;t mess up and get us killed.</p>
<p begin="01:37:15.200" end="01:37:15.816" style="s2">Then you do it.</p>
<p begin="01:37:31.333" end="01:37:33.716" style="s2">The first three to cross the yellow line will be accepted.</p>
<p begin="01:37:38.133" end="01:37:39.666" style="s2">Luo Ying, aren&#39;t you leaving?</p>
<p begin="01:37:39.833" end="01:37:42.066" style="s2">No one leaves until the bomb is defused.</p>
<p begin="01:37:42.233" end="01:37:43.949" style="s2">Fine, then I&#39;ll stay with you.</p>
<p begin="01:37:47.599" end="01:37:49.416" style="s2">I&#39;m staying too. After all,</p>
<p begin="01:37:49.599" end="01:37:50.483" style="s2">Luo Ying is saving my life.</p>
<p begin="01:37:50.800" end="01:37:53.550" style="s2">If something happens, I&#39;ll shield you with my body.</p>
<p begin="01:37:54.000" end="01:37:56.083" style="s2">If you won&#39;t leave, then I&#39;ll go first.</p>
<p begin="01:37:57.333" end="01:37:59.683" style="s2">You fools, get out of here!</p>
<p begin="01:38:03.066" end="01:38:03.533" style="s2">Great!</p>
<p begin="01:38:08.133" end="01:38:08.749" style="s2">Four years.</p>
<p begin="01:38:09.466" end="01:38:11.150" style="s2">I finally passed the assessment.</p>
<p begin="01:38:12.399" end="01:38:13.550" style="s2">You idiots!</p>
<p begin="01:38:14.133" end="01:38:17.450" style="s2">For that ridiculous loyalty, you wasted your spots.</p>
<p begin="01:38:18.266" end="01:38:21.283" style="s2">Luo Ying, you think defusing a bomb makes you impressive?</p>
<p begin="01:38:22.266" end="01:38:25.000" style="s2">In the commander&#39;s eyes, you&#39;re nothing but</p>
<p begin="01:38:25.166" end="01:38:26.749" style="s2">a reckless fool who doesn&#39;t know how to make choices.</p>
<p begin="01:38:27.599" end="01:38:28.216" style="s2">Hang Lu,</p>
<p begin="01:38:28.800" end="01:38:29.683" style="s2">Sun Wuhao,</p>
<p begin="01:38:30.533" end="01:38:33.716" style="s2">you two just pretend along with her until you&#39;re eliminated.</p>
<p begin="01:38:34.133" end="01:38:35.683" style="s2">Luo Ying risked her life to save everyone.</p>
<p begin="01:38:35.733" end="01:38:37.683" style="s2">You&#39;re not grateful, and you even mock her.</p>
<p begin="01:38:38.000" end="01:38:40.483" style="s2">Don&#39;t waste words on her; beasts don&#39;t understand human speech.</p>
<p begin="01:38:41.066" end="01:38:41.816" style="s2">Assemble!</p>
<p begin="01:38:47.200" end="01:38:50.116" style="s2">Commander, the three of us were the first to cross the yellow line.</p>
<p begin="01:38:50.533" end="01:38:52.483" style="s2">According to the rules, we&#39;re accepted.</p>
<p begin="01:38:52.800" end="01:38:55.050" style="s2">No, the three of you are eliminated.</p>
<p begin="01:38:55.466" end="01:38:58.250" style="s2">Why? We clearly passed first!</p>
<p begin="01:39:00.000" end="01:39:00.783" style="s2">Why?</p>
<p begin="01:39:01.466" end="01:39:03.799" style="s2">At the critical moment, you abandoned your comrades</p>
<p begin="01:39:03.966" end="01:39:05.416" style="s2">who were saving your lives.</p>
<p begin="01:39:05.599" end="01:39:07.933" style="s2">The final assessment of the special forces</p>
<p begin="01:39:08.100" end="01:39:10.516" style="s2">is not about who runs fastest, but about this.</p>
<p begin="01:39:11.066" end="01:39:13.050" style="s2">If you can easily abandon your comrades,</p>
<p begin="01:39:13.599" end="01:39:16.749" style="s2">on the battlefield, who would dare to have your back?</p>
<p begin="01:39:17.066" end="01:39:19.683" style="s2">How could the country entrust its mission to you?</p>
<p begin="01:39:19.866" end="01:39:20.749" style="s2">What was just announced</p>
<p begin="01:39:21.866" end="01:39:23.583" style="s2">is only part of the final test.</p>
<p begin="01:39:25.200" end="01:39:26.649" style="s2">The real test is:</p>
<p begin="01:39:27.200" end="01:39:30.649" style="s2">in desperate situations, can you still not abandon</p>
<p begin="01:39:31.066" end="01:39:31.816" style="s2">and not give up?</p>
<p begin="01:39:32.666" end="01:39:33.983" style="s2">Only those who choose to stay within the yellow line</p>
<p begin="01:39:35.066" end="01:39:36.616" style="s2">and share risks with their comrades</p>
<p begin="01:39:36.933" end="01:39:39.983" style="s2">deserve to wear that armband symbolizing honor.</p>
<p begin="01:39:43.466" end="01:39:44.749" style="s2">I failed again.</p>
<p begin="01:39:45.466" end="01:39:47.133" style="s2">Congratulations, from today on,</p>
<p begin="01:39:47.300" end="01:39:49.183" style="s2">you are officially special agents.</p>
<p begin="01:39:49.466" end="01:39:51.716" style="s2">May you never forget your original intention and keep your mission in mind.</p>
<p begin="01:39:52.266" end="01:39:56.116" style="s2">Use your passion to protect the lights of every home in this land.</p>
<p begin="01:39:56.399" end="01:39:59.050" style="s2">King of Killers, Special Agent.</p>
<p begin="01:39:59.866" end="01:40:02.116" style="s2">I like this identity change.</p>
<p begin="01:40:04.666" end="01:40:07.983" style="s2">Commander Lu, why don&#39;t you put it on Luo Ying?</p>
<p begin="01:40:08.266" end="01:40:09.050" style="s2">There&#39;s someone</p>
<p begin="01:40:10.666" end="01:40:11.583" style="s2">more suitable than me.</p>
<p begin="01:40:12.000" end="01:40:12.749" style="s2">Who?</p>
<p begin="01:40:13.733" end="01:40:14.250" style="s2">Captain Deng.</p>
<p begin="01:40:15.866" end="01:40:18.250" style="s2">You were the one who recommended Luo Ying for the assessment.</p>
<p begin="01:40:18.533" end="01:40:19.983" style="s2">You should be the one to put it on her.</p>
<p begin="01:40:37.200" end="01:40:38.116" style="s2">Reporting, sir.</p>
<p begin="01:40:38.266" end="01:40:41.450" style="s2">The head of an overseas assassin organization, Tyrannosaurus, has appeared in Huaguo.</p>
<p begin="01:40:42.133" end="01:40:43.183" style="s2">Tyrannosaurus.</p>
<p begin="01:40:45.866" end="01:40:46.649" style="s2">Where is he?</p>
<p begin="01:40:49.200" end="01:40:49.716" style="s2">Xiao Ying.</p>
<p begin="01:40:50.399" end="01:40:51.316" style="s2">You know him?</p>
<p begin="01:40:51.733" end="01:40:52.383" style="s2">I&#39;ve heard of him.</p>
<p begin="01:40:52.666" end="01:40:53.849" style="s2">The Dark Star River Arena.</p>
<p begin="01:40:55.599" end="01:40:57.816" style="s2">Officer Zhang, I request to carry out this mission.</p>
<p begin="01:40:58.133" end="01:41:00.649" style="s2">Old Deng, I know you want revenge for your wife and daughter.</p>
<p begin="01:41:01.200" end="01:41:02.916" style="s2">But no one controls that place.</p>
<p begin="01:41:03.200" end="01:41:05.450" style="s2">Without a reservation, no one can get in.</p>
<p begin="01:41:06.133" end="01:41:06.649" style="s2">Sir.</p>
<p begin="01:41:07.200" end="01:41:09.716" style="s2">Tyrannosaurus&#39;s appearance this time doesn&#39;t seem to be to provoke the military.</p>
<p begin="01:41:10.000" end="01:41:10.649" style="s2">Then what is it?</p>
<p begin="01:41:10.933" end="01:41:12.749" style="s2">Tyrannosaurus has booked Sand Platform No. 44.</p>
<p begin="01:41:12.933" end="01:41:15.550" style="s2">The bounty target is a foreign hacker codenamed Fox Charm.</p>
<p begin="01:41:16.000" end="01:41:17.983" style="s2">No money, just the person.</p>
<p begin="01:41:19.466" end="01:41:20.916" style="s2">Is this hacker&#39;s identity very important?</p>
<p begin="01:41:21.466" end="01:41:23.416" style="s2">Fox Charm is a subordinate of the King of Assassins, Rakshasa.</p>
<p begin="01:41:23.599" end="01:41:25.183" style="s2">He wants to use Fox Charm to lure out Rakshasa.</p>
<p begin="01:41:25.733" end="01:41:28.116" style="s2">Tyrannosaurus, you&#39;re asking for death.</p>
<p begin="01:41:28.133" end="01:41:29.716" style="s2">I don&#39;t mind starting with you.</p>
<p begin="01:41:30.000" end="01:41:32.649" style="s2">Internal strife within the organization doesn&#39;t threaten the military for now.</p>
<p begin="01:41:32.800" end="01:41:34.783" style="s2">Send someone to watch outside the arena first.</p>
<p begin="01:41:35.066" end="01:41:36.883" style="s2">Capture Tyrannosaurus as soon as he leaves the arena.</p>
<p begin="01:41:37.333" end="01:41:39.016" style="s2">Sir, send me.</p>
<p begin="01:41:39.200" end="01:41:39.983" style="s2">Old Deng.</p>
<p begin="01:41:40.800" end="01:41:43.050" style="s2">Precisely because it&#39;s you, I can&#39;t send you.</p>
<p begin="01:41:44.133" end="01:41:47.450" style="s2">With blood feuds, who can guarantee absolute calm?</p>
<p begin="01:41:47.733" end="01:41:49.316" style="s2">I&#39;ll arrange the surveillance.</p>
<p begin="01:41:49.466" end="01:41:51.849" style="s2">Your task is to stand by. That&#39;s an order.</p>
<p begin="01:41:53.466" end="01:41:53.849" style="s2">Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:42:04.499" end="01:42:05.849" style="s2">Lu Heng, why are you here?</p>
<p begin="01:42:07.200" end="01:42:07.716" style="s2">Without me,</p>
<p begin="01:42:08.666" end="01:42:09.316" style="s2">can you get in?</p>
<p begin="01:42:10.666" end="01:42:13.050" style="s2">My account is linked to all the arenas worldwide.</p>
<p begin="01:42:13.200" end="01:42:15.716" style="s2">The King of Assassins wants to get in, it&#39;s easy.</p>
<p begin="01:42:16.666" end="01:42:17.716" style="s2">Using your account will expose you.</p>
<p begin="01:42:22.133" end="01:42:24.383" style="s2">I&#39;m afraid I won&#39;t be able to kill Tyrannosaurus tonight.</p>
<p begin="01:42:28.399" end="01:42:29.983" style="s2">You won&#39;t abandon your subordinates.</p>
<p begin="01:42:31.200" end="01:42:31.983" style="s2">You won&#39;t let go of family revenge.</p>
<p begin="01:42:33.200" end="01:42:37.583" style="s2">And I won&#39;t let my little princess take risks alone.</p>
<p begin="01:42:38.666" end="01:42:40.116" style="s2">Although I don&#39;t like this nickname,</p>
<p begin="01:42:43.200" end="01:42:44.783" style="s2">but I like your attitude.</p>
<p begin="01:43:01.466" end="01:43:04.333" style="s2">Welcome everyone to the Dark Star River Arena.</p>
<p begin="01:43:04.566" end="01:43:06.200" style="s2">This match is on Platform No. 44.</p>
<p begin="01:43:06.366" end="01:43:09.416" style="s2">Those who step up either win or die.</p>
<p begin="01:43:09.466" end="01:43:13.816" style="s2">Kolya is about to finish the fight, let&#39;s cheer for him</p>
<p begin="01:43:17.699" end="01:43:21.150" style="s2">Go Kolya</p>
<p begin="01:43:21.200" end="01:43:22.200" style="s2">Trash</p>
<p begin="01:43:22.300" end="01:43:23.133" style="s2">Trash</p>
<p begin="01:43:24.000" end="01:43:24.616" style="s2">Come on</p>
<p begin="01:43:25.200" end="01:43:26.350" style="s2">Come kill me then</p>
<p begin="01:43:27.200" end="01:43:28.250" style="s2">Why are you failing</p>
<p begin="01:43:36.933" end="01:43:38.216" style="s2">Cheer</p>
<p begin="01:43:42.800" end="01:43:43.849" style="s2">Sun Wuhao</p>
<p begin="01:43:44.533" end="01:43:45.849" style="s2">Hang Lu, what&#39;s going on</p>
<p begin="01:43:46.133" end="01:43:47.816" style="s2">Chief Lu, Sister Ying</p>
<p begin="01:43:48.133" end="01:43:50.116" style="s2">Sun Wuhao and I are both from the special forces</p>
<p begin="01:43:50.666" end="01:43:51.983" style="s2">We have strong observation skills</p>
<p begin="01:43:52.399" end="01:43:54.783" style="s2">We saw you react strongly to the name Fox Spirit</p>
<p begin="01:43:55.200" end="01:43:56.383" style="s2">Guessed she might be your friend</p>
<p begin="01:43:56.800" end="01:43:58.116" style="s2">So we wanted to help you rescue her</p>
<p begin="01:43:58.933" end="01:43:59.316" style="s2">Ridiculous</p>
<p begin="01:44:00.000" end="01:44:01.683" style="s2">Kolya is T-Rex&#39;s top gladiator</p>
<p begin="01:44:02.266" end="01:44:03.450" style="s2">You&#39;re going to your deaths</p>
<p begin="01:44:10.933" end="01:44:12.916" style="s2">I&#39;ll beat you to death slowly</p>
<p begin="01:44:14.000" end="01:44:16.483" style="s2">Crush you completely</p>
<p begin="01:44:17.599" end="01:44:20.783" style="s2">Force your family to swallow your ashes</p>
<p begin="01:44:21.866" end="01:44:22.866" style="s2">Die</p>
<p begin="01:44:23.033" end="01:44:23.816" style="s2">Kolya</p>
<p begin="01:44:24.533" end="01:44:26.649" style="s2">Old bastard, still so arrogant</p>
<p begin="01:44:28.666" end="01:44:31.050" style="s2">Let him go, I&#39;ll duel you</p>
<p begin="01:44:32.533" end="01:44:33.150" style="s2">Sister Ying</p>
<p begin="01:44:36.533" end="01:44:37.450" style="s2">Rakshasa</p>
<p begin="01:44:38.000" end="01:44:39.450" style="s2">It&#39;s you</p>
<p begin="01:44:40.266" end="01:44:41.849" style="s2">I remember your voice</p>
<p begin="01:44:45.333" end="01:44:47.583" style="s2">T-Rex said I could duel you here</p>
<p begin="01:44:48.399" end="01:44:50.116" style="s2">He didn&#39;t lie to me after all</p>
<p begin="01:44:51.333" end="01:44:51.983" style="s2">Come on</p>
<p begin="01:44:53.333" end="01:44:55.583" style="s2">I&#39;ll kill you with my own hands</p>
<p begin="01:44:56.266" end="01:44:57.799" style="s2">Duel terminated</p>
<p begin="01:44:57.966" end="01:45:01.150" style="s2">Someone volunteers to replace Sun Wuhao</p>
<p begin="01:45:05.066" end="01:45:06.749" style="s2">Chief Lu, aren&#39;t you going to talk her out of it</p>
<p begin="01:45:07.333" end="01:45:07.849" style="s2">She wants to charge ahead</p>
<p begin="01:45:09.066" end="01:45:10.649" style="s2">So I&#39;ll hold the rear for her</p>
<p begin="01:45:11.333" end="01:45:13.316" style="s2">Unless I die, otherwise</p>
<p begin="01:45:14.533" end="01:45:16.250" style="s2">No one can get past me to touch her life</p>
<p begin="01:45:17.733" end="01:45:19.316" style="s2">Why is a woman coming up</p>
<p begin="01:45:19.466" end="01:45:21.000" style="s2">Trash, get down</p>
<p begin="01:45:21.433" end="01:45:22.466" style="s2">We want to see men fight</p>
<p begin="01:45:22.633" end="01:45:28.083" style="s2">Woman get down</p>
<p begin="01:45:32.666" end="01:45:34.083" style="s2">Everyone irrelevant get out</p>
<p begin="01:45:40.933" end="01:45:43.450" style="s2">A filthy beast in the arena</p>
<p begin="01:45:44.133" end="01:45:44.916" style="s2">Are you ready</p>
<p begin="01:45:45.466" end="01:45:47.683" style="s2">You&#39;re the beast, die</p>
<p begin="01:45:52.000" end="01:45:52.916" style="s2">She actually won</p>
<p begin="01:46:09.733" end="01:46:11.050" style="s2">T-Rex doesn&#39;t keep his word.</p>
<p begin="01:46:11.733" end="01:46:12.649" style="s2">Even if he wins, he might not release them.</p>
<p begin="01:46:13.333" end="01:46:17.183" style="s2">Kolia is a golden gladiator worth hundreds of millions.</p>
<p begin="01:46:17.733" end="01:46:19.316" style="s2">The Dark Star River people can&#39;t bear to let him die.</p>
<p begin="01:46:20.266" end="01:46:22.516" style="s2">Using him for negotiation is better than killing him outright.</p>
<p begin="01:46:23.599" end="01:46:26.749" style="s2">Release the fox demon, or I&#39;ll kill him.</p>
<p begin="01:46:32.533" end="01:46:33.816" style="s2">Fine, we&#39;ll release them.</p>
<p begin="01:46:34.266" end="01:46:35.050" style="s2">Let him go now!</p>
<p begin="01:46:35.733" end="01:46:36.516" style="s2">T-Rex!</p>
<p begin="01:46:37.599" end="01:46:39.050" style="s2">I&#39;m here.</p>
<p begin="01:46:51.466" end="01:46:51.983" style="s2">Captain Deng!</p>
<p begin="01:46:52.533" end="01:46:53.150" style="s2">Luo Ying!</p>
<p begin="01:46:53.733" end="01:46:55.450" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry about me, just go!</p>
<p begin="01:47:00.133" end="01:47:01.050" style="s2">Rakshasa.</p>
<p begin="01:47:01.599" end="01:47:03.550" style="s2">I finally see your true face.</p>
<p begin="01:47:04.133" end="01:47:05.550" style="s2">I never expected you in person</p>
<p begin="01:47:06.399" end="01:47:07.450" style="s2">to be this beautiful.</p>
<p begin="01:47:09.466" end="01:47:10.250" style="s2">Rakshasa.</p>
<p begin="01:47:12.933" end="01:47:13.583" style="s2">What?</p>
<p begin="01:47:14.800" end="01:47:16.649" style="s2">You recruited her into the army</p>
<p begin="01:47:17.333" end="01:47:19.050" style="s2">but didn&#39;t know her real identity?</p>
<p begin="01:47:19.866" end="01:47:22.483" style="s2">Isn&#39;t she the King of Killers ranked above me?</p>
<p begin="01:47:22.933" end="01:47:23.316" style="s2">Luo Ying.</p>
<p begin="01:47:23.599" end="01:47:24.783" style="s2">She is the King of Killers.</p>
<p begin="01:47:25.466" end="01:47:26.516" style="s2">Release them.</p>
<p begin="01:47:26.933" end="01:47:30.250" style="s2">If the famous King of Killers Rakshasa kneels before me,</p>
<p begin="01:47:31.333" end="01:47:32.516" style="s2">I&#39;ll consider releasing them.</p>
<p begin="01:47:33.733" end="01:47:35.316" style="s2">Don&#39;t listen to him, go!</p>
<p begin="01:47:43.733" end="01:47:44.250" style="s2">Hurry up!</p>
<p begin="01:47:44.800" end="01:47:45.316" style="s2">Kneel!</p>
<p begin="01:47:46.133" end="01:47:47.450" style="s2">I want everyone to see</p>
<p begin="01:47:48.533" end="01:47:50.116" style="s2">Rakshasa kneeling before me.</p>
<p begin="01:48:02.000" end="01:48:05.183" style="s2">This is the strength of the King of Killers.</p>
<p begin="01:48:06.133" end="01:48:08.116" style="s2">Back off, clear the way.</p>
<p begin="01:48:08.933" end="01:48:09.983" style="s2">Whoever dares to follow</p>
<p begin="01:48:10.800" end="01:48:12.783" style="s2">I&#39;ll slit his throat immediately.</p>
<p begin="01:48:14.000" end="01:48:15.583" style="s2">What are you standing around for? Get lost!</p>
<p begin="01:48:15.733" end="01:48:16.516" style="s2">Clear the way!</p>
<p begin="01:48:24.133" end="01:48:24.749" style="s2">Chief!</p>
<p begin="01:48:25.200" end="01:48:26.216" style="s2">Send them back to the military.</p>
<p begin="01:48:27.066" end="01:48:27.416" style="s2">Yes!</p>
<p begin="01:48:28.933" end="01:48:31.550" style="s2">They&#39;re from the Crimson Flame Legion, we can&#39;t afford to mess with them. Let&#39;s go!</p>
<p begin="01:48:35.466" end="01:48:36.083" style="s2">Go!</p>
<p begin="01:48:43.599" end="01:48:44.516" style="s2">Get your people in the car.</p>
<p begin="01:48:45.466" end="01:48:46.383" style="s2">I&#39;ll take you to the hospital.</p>
<p begin="01:48:47.333" end="01:48:47.849" style="s2">Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:48:52.666" end="01:48:53.183" style="s2">Captain Deng.</p>
<p begin="01:48:54.000" end="01:48:54.516" style="s2">Luo Ying.</p>
<p begin="01:48:55.066" end="01:48:55.983" style="s2">You don&#39;t need to say anything.</p>
<p begin="01:48:56.533" end="01:48:58.649" style="s2">I know you&#39;re a good kid.</p>
<p begin="01:48:59.733" end="01:49:00.733" style="s2">Thank you.</p>
<p begin="01:49:00.833" end="01:49:01.583" style="s2">I should be the one thanking you.</p>
<p begin="01:49:02.266" end="01:49:03.150" style="s2">You caught the Tyrannosaurus.</p>
<p begin="01:49:03.733" end="01:49:05.583" style="s2">You avenged my wife.</p>
<p begin="01:49:11.066" end="01:49:11.983" style="s2">How are the patients?</p>
<p begin="01:49:12.133" end="01:49:15.050" style="s2">The surgery was successful. Both are out of danger.</p>
<p begin="01:49:15.733" end="01:49:17.983" style="s2">Sun Wuhao hasn&#39;t woken up yet, but Humei is already awake.</p>
<p begin="01:49:18.266" end="01:49:19.183" style="s2">She says she wants to see Miss Luo.</p>
<p begin="01:49:29.599" end="01:49:30.649" style="s2">Humei was useless.</p>
<p begin="01:49:30.666" end="01:49:33.150" style="s2">She got herself caught trying to save me, exposing the Pavilion Master&#39;s identity.</p>
<p begin="01:49:33.866" end="01:49:34.216" style="s2">Come.</p>
<p begin="01:49:41.466" end="01:49:42.749" style="s2">I won&#39;t abandon my subordinates.</p>
<p begin="01:49:43.066" end="01:49:44.483" style="s2">I&#39;d do the same for anyone else.</p>
<p begin="01:49:44.933" end="01:49:45.716" style="s2">Don&#39;t blame yourself.</p>
<p begin="01:49:46.133" end="01:49:49.550" style="s2">Pavilion Master, I have something important to report.</p>
<p begin="01:49:52.666" end="01:49:54.383" style="s2">He&#39;s not an outsider. Go ahead.</p>
<p begin="01:49:54.666" end="01:49:57.983" style="s2">The last message I received was that you were being hunted by mercenaries.</p>
<p begin="01:49:58.399" end="01:50:01.283" style="s2">He&#39;s the mercenary leader. Can he really be trusted?</p>
<p begin="01:50:03.066" end="01:50:05.949" style="s2">Pavilion Master, I found clues about your origins.</p>
<p begin="01:50:07.066" end="01:50:07.583" style="s2">Tell me in detail.</p>
<p begin="01:50:08.666" end="01:50:11.050" style="s2">Your father was Deng Zhiguo, and your mother was Luo Man.</p>
<p begin="01:50:11.599" end="01:50:13.716" style="s2">Madam Luo Man was very smart and vigilant.</p>
<p begin="01:50:13.733" end="01:50:15.683" style="s2">She was extremely careful when caring for you.</p>
<p begin="01:50:16.266" end="01:50:17.983" style="s2">The organization shouldn&#39;t have found her so easily.</p>
<p begin="01:50:18.266" end="01:50:21.949" style="s2">What happened to her back then was because someone in the Luo family betrayed her.</p>
<p begin="01:50:23.733" end="01:50:25.716" style="s2">They lured you and her into an ambush.</p>
<p begin="01:50:27.066" end="01:50:28.116" style="s2">Where is her main family?</p>
<p begin="01:50:28.666" end="01:50:30.649" style="s2">The Luo family in Heimmu City.</p>
<p begin="01:50:31.466" end="01:50:32.783" style="s2">By relation...</p>
<p begin="01:50:32.933" end="01:50:35.816" style="s2">Madam Luo Man is also related to this body of yours.</p>
<p begin="01:50:36.266" end="01:50:38.383" style="s2">Madam Luo Man was the only bloodline of the main family.</p>
<p begin="01:50:38.666" end="01:50:41.416" style="s2">Luo Guodong and Luo Guobin were born to a branch of the Luo family.</p>
<p begin="01:50:42.000" end="01:50:42.649" style="s2">So by reckoning...</p>
<p begin="01:50:43.200" end="01:50:45.683" style="s2">Madam Luo Man was your body&#39;s paternal cousin aunt.</p>
<p begin="01:50:46.266" end="01:50:49.283" style="s2">Luo Man&#39;s death is connected to Luo Guobin.</p>
<p begin="01:50:49.733" end="01:50:53.316" style="s2">I don&#39;t know the details, but after Madam Luo Man passed away...</p>
<p begin="01:50:53.599" end="01:50:56.783" style="s2">No one inherited the Luo family business. Deng Zhiguo was an outsider by marriage.</p>
<p begin="01:50:56.800" end="01:50:59.050" style="s2">The shareholders didn&#39;t accept him. The Luo Group...</p>
<p begin="01:50:59.200" end="01:51:01.849" style="s2">is now managed by the Luo family&#39;s adopted son, Luo Jiacheng.</p>
<p begin="01:51:04.666" end="01:51:05.450" style="s2">Do you need my help?</p>
<p begin="01:51:17.166" end="01:51:17.716" style="s2">Yingying.</p>
<p begin="01:51:18.399" end="01:51:21.016" style="s2">The main family heard you got into the special forces.</p>
<p begin="01:51:21.200" end="01:51:23.583" style="s2">The old master and madam want to throw you a celebration banquet.</p>
<p begin="01:51:23.733" end="01:51:25.983" style="s2">They&#39;ve also invited your uncle&#39;s family. Do you want to go?</p>
<p begin="01:51:26.133" end="01:51:26.916" style="s2">When?</p>
<p begin="01:51:27.200" end="01:51:30.916" style="s2">After your cousin aunt Luo Man passed away, the old master and madam have been very lonely.</p>
<p begin="01:51:31.333" end="01:51:33.016" style="s2">This time the old master wants everyone to stay the night.</p>
<p begin="01:51:33.733" end="01:51:36.383" style="s2">We&#39;ll head back tomorrow. Let&#39;s pack up and go early.</p>
<p begin="01:51:36.666" end="01:51:38.250" style="s2">Okay, I&#39;ll head back now.</p>
<p begin="01:51:40.933" end="01:51:42.350" style="s2">Looks like I won&#39;t need your help after all.</p>
<p begin="01:51:42.933" end="01:51:43.949" style="s2">I&#39;ll go check myself.</p>
<p begin="01:51:47.200" end="01:51:48.083" style="s2">I&#39;ll go with you.</p>
<p begin="01:51:48.800" end="01:51:49.583" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="01:51:52.533" end="01:51:53.183" style="s2">Why?</p>
<p begin="01:51:55.333" end="01:51:55.949" style="s2">Am I too embarrassing to be seen?</p>
<p begin="01:52:02.933" end="01:52:03.816" style="s2">Eldest Brother, Second Brother.</p>
<p begin="01:52:05.333" end="01:52:08.083" style="s2">Your eldest brother has an exam today, and your second brother has a match.</p>
<p begin="01:52:08.133" end="01:52:09.150" style="s2">They didn&#39;t come over.</p>
<p begin="01:52:09.866" end="01:52:12.616" style="s2">Luo Ying, on such an important occasion today,</p>
<p begin="01:52:12.800" end="01:52:14.749" style="s2">why did you bring this pretty boy?</p>
<p begin="01:52:16.933" end="01:52:19.016" style="s2">Someone as presentable as you is here,</p>
<p begin="01:52:19.200" end="01:52:20.116" style="s2">so why can&#39;t he come?</p>
<p begin="01:52:21.466" end="01:52:25.416" style="s2">Luo Ying looks so much like Miss Luo Man, and even talks like her.</p>
<p begin="01:52:26.266" end="01:52:28.083" style="s2">Luo Ying, listen carefully.</p>
<p begin="01:52:28.933" end="01:52:32.883" style="s2">You Yu came back from Wall Street, worth billions.</p>
<p begin="01:52:33.599" end="01:52:36.216" style="s2">Our two families are officially engaged.</p>
<p begin="01:52:36.800" end="01:52:39.949" style="s2">From now on, with this boyfriend of unknown origin,</p>
<p begin="01:52:40.266" end="01:52:41.450" style="s2">be more polite to me.</p>
<p begin="01:52:42.233" end="01:52:42.916" style="s2">Otherwise,</p>
<p begin="01:52:44.000" end="01:52:46.649" style="s2">don&#39;t blame me for not warning you when you regret it.</p>
<p begin="01:52:47.866" end="01:52:50.083" style="s2">Alright, Mengdie, don&#39;t be so aggressive.</p>
<p begin="01:52:53.599" end="01:52:55.583" style="s2">The old master and madam have been waiting a long time.</p>
<p begin="01:52:55.733" end="01:52:57.416" style="s2">Everyone, please come in.</p>
<p begin="01:53:03.733" end="01:53:04.733" style="s2">Lu—</p>
<p begin="01:53:05.733" end="01:53:08.116" style="s2">Just call me Little Lu.</p>
<p begin="01:53:08.533" end="01:53:11.716" style="s2">Luo Mengdie is sick in the head, don&#39;t take her seriously.</p>
<p begin="01:53:14.000" end="01:53:14.749" style="s2">Come, please.</p>
<p begin="01:53:35.599" end="01:53:36.783" style="s2">This is Yingying.</p>
<p begin="01:53:38.666" end="01:53:39.716" style="s2">Yes, Madam.</p>
<p begin="01:53:40.933" end="01:53:41.550" style="s2">Old man,</p>
<p begin="01:53:42.666" end="01:53:46.083" style="s2">look, doesn&#39;t this child look familiar?</p>
<p begin="01:53:46.800" end="01:53:47.316" style="s2">Yes,</p>
<p begin="01:53:48.933" end="01:53:50.250" style="s2">she looks like Xiaoman.</p>
<p begin="01:53:53.200" end="01:53:53.716" style="s2">Child,</p>
<p begin="01:53:54.399" end="01:53:56.649" style="s2">come here, let me have a good look at you.</p>
<p begin="01:54:06.666" end="01:54:07.283" style="s2">Grandpa.</p>
<p begin="01:54:08.133" end="01:54:08.783" style="s2">Grandma.</p>
<p begin="01:54:10.000" end="01:54:13.550" style="s2">If Xiaoman&#39;s child could have grown up safely,</p>
<p begin="01:54:14.000" end="01:54:16.383" style="s2">she would definitely look exactly like her.</p>
<p begin="01:54:23.599" end="01:54:24.350" style="s2">Madam.</p>
<p begin="01:54:28.133" end="01:54:30.649" style="s2">Madam is in poor health, she can&#39;t get too emotional.</p>
<p begin="01:54:41.066" end="01:54:43.583" style="s2">You can&#39;t have anything happen to you.</p>
<p begin="01:54:44.800" end="01:54:48.116" style="s2">Xiaoman is already gone.</p>
<p begin="01:54:49.200" end="01:54:50.516" style="s2">By my side,</p>
<p begin="01:54:52.133" end="01:54:53.849" style="s2">only you are left.</p>
<p begin="01:54:54.933" end="01:54:55.983" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry.</p>
<p begin="01:54:56.533" end="01:54:58.250" style="s2">I won&#39;t leave you.</p>
<p begin="01:54:59.733" end="01:55:00.516" style="s2">It&#39;s just that</p>
<p begin="01:55:01.066" end="01:55:02.649" style="s2">that child</p>
<p begin="01:55:03.466" end="01:55:05.183" style="s2">looks too much like Xiaoman.</p>
<p begin="01:55:08.666" end="01:55:10.383" style="s2">It&#39;s rude to leave the guests outside.</p>
<p begin="01:55:11.066" end="01:55:12.783" style="s2">I&#39;ll go out and check.</p>
<p begin="01:55:14.266" end="01:55:15.583" style="s2">Dad, Mom.</p>
<p begin="01:55:15.866" end="01:55:16.883" style="s2">Get some rest.</p>
<p begin="01:55:17.066" end="01:55:17.849" style="s2">I&#39;ll go keep them company.</p>
<p begin="01:55:18.933" end="01:55:19.983" style="s2">Listen to Jiacheng.</p>
<p begin="01:55:20.933" end="01:55:21.583" style="s2">Alright then.</p>
<p begin="01:55:28.666" end="01:55:30.383" style="s2">This is Miss Luoman&#39;s room.</p>
<p begin="01:55:30.933" end="01:55:33.849" style="s2">The old madam said you should stay here.</p>
<p begin="01:55:38.133" end="01:55:39.316" style="s2">This is Mom&#39;s room.</p>
<p begin="01:55:42.266" end="01:55:43.150" style="s2">What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="01:55:44.133" end="01:55:47.316" style="s2">The Luo family has so many guest rooms, why arrange for her to stay here?</p>
<p begin="01:55:48.133" end="01:55:51.316" style="s2">In reply to Master Chengda, this is the old madam&#39;s wish.</p>
<p begin="01:55:52.000" end="01:55:54.916" style="s2">A little girl like her doesn&#39;t deserve to stay in Xiaoman&#39;s room.</p>
<p begin="01:55:55.866" end="01:55:57.183" style="s2">But the old madam, she—</p>
<p begin="01:55:57.200" end="01:55:57.983" style="s2">Uncle Zhong.</p>
<p begin="01:55:58.933" end="01:56:01.849" style="s2">You&#39;ve been in this house so long, have you forgotten?</p>
<p begin="01:56:02.133" end="01:56:03.983" style="s2">Who&#39;s really in charge here now?</p>
<p begin="01:56:05.066" end="01:56:06.383" style="s2">Do I need to remind you?</p>
<p begin="01:56:08.800" end="01:56:09.183" style="s2">Little girl.</p>
<p begin="01:56:10.266" end="01:56:11.716" style="s2">You dare defy my orders?</p>
<p begin="01:56:15.333" end="01:56:16.116" style="s2">Defy?</p>
<p begin="01:56:17.866" end="01:56:20.516" style="s2">An adopted son who only stands tall by managing the family business on someone else&#39;s behalf.</p>
<p begin="01:56:21.066" end="01:56:22.783" style="s2">You think you&#39;re fit to give me orders?</p>
<p begin="01:56:23.866" end="01:56:24.783" style="s2">I&#39;m staying here, and that&#39;s final.</p>
<p begin="01:56:25.599" end="01:56:26.483" style="s2">You&#39;re not happy about it?</p>
<p begin="01:56:27.200" end="01:56:27.983" style="s2">Fine.</p>
<p begin="01:56:28.666" end="01:56:30.649" style="s2">Let&#39;s go right now and let the old madam judge.</p>
<p begin="01:56:31.066" end="01:56:33.799" style="s2">Let her see how the Luo family&#39;s carefully raised good son—</p>
<p begin="01:56:33.966" end="01:56:35.050" style="s2">—throws his weight around.</p>
<p begin="01:56:36.000" end="01:56:38.749" style="s2">Even interfering with what she herself arranged.</p>
<p begin="01:56:38.933" end="01:56:39.283" style="s2">I—</p>
<p begin="01:56:46.133" end="01:56:46.916" style="s2">Hit me?</p>
<p begin="01:56:47.733" end="01:56:49.150" style="s2">Better be ready for your hand to hurt.</p>
<p begin="01:56:51.066" end="01:56:51.849" style="s2">By seniority.</p>
<p begin="01:56:52.533" end="01:56:55.450" style="s2">I&#39;m your cousin-uncle. You dare lay a hand on me?</p>
<p begin="01:56:56.266" end="01:56:59.550" style="s2">Luo Guobin is my own uncle, and I don&#39;t even respect him.</p>
<p begin="01:56:59.866" end="01:57:01.050" style="s2">So who do you think you are?</p>
<p begin="01:57:01.733" end="01:57:02.649" style="s2">You brat.</p>
<p begin="01:57:03.466" end="01:57:07.316" style="s2">Once you leave the main house, let&#39;s see if you can still be this arrogant.</p>
<p begin="01:57:07.733" end="01:57:09.050" style="s2">We&#39;ll see about that.</p>
<p begin="01:57:14.399" end="01:57:15.050" style="s2">Miss Ying.</p>
<p begin="01:57:15.599" end="01:57:17.016" style="s2">You were too impulsive.</p>
<p begin="01:57:17.733" end="01:57:21.450" style="s2">Right now, Master Jiacheng runs everything in the main house.</p>
<p begin="01:57:22.000" end="01:57:23.416" style="s2">He has immense power.</p>
<p begin="01:57:24.133" end="01:57:25.283" style="s2">If you anger him—</p>
<p begin="01:57:25.866" end="01:57:27.583" style="s2">I&#39;m afraid in the future you—</p>
<p begin="01:57:28.399" end="01:57:29.016" style="s2">He—</p>
<p begin="01:57:30.666" end="01:57:32.083" style="s2">He&#39;s not even worthy of being my opponent.</p>
<p begin="01:57:35.099" end="01:57:38.116" style="s2">You don&#39;t just look like Miss Luoman—</p>
<p begin="01:57:39.066" end="01:57:40.116" style="s2">Even her personality</p>
<p begin="01:57:40.666" end="01:57:42.250" style="s2">is exactly like hers.</p>
<p begin="01:57:47.066" end="01:57:48.116" style="s2">It&#39;s getting late.</p>
<p begin="01:57:48.666" end="01:57:49.450" style="s2">You should rest first.</p>
<p begin="01:57:57.599" end="01:57:58.883" style="s2">This is Mom&#39;s room.</p>
<p begin="01:58:06.266" end="01:58:07.050" style="s2">Rakshasa.</p>
<p begin="01:58:07.866" end="01:58:08.783" style="s2">Your temper</p>
<p begin="01:58:09.333" end="01:58:11.016" style="s2">hasn&#39;t changed at all.</p>
<p begin="01:58:21.733" end="01:58:22.733" style="s2">Not sleeping in the middle of the night—</p>
<p begin="01:58:23.966" end="01:58:24.466" style="s2">are you waiting for me?</p>
<p begin="01:58:25.066" end="01:58:27.450" style="s2">Cut it out. I&#39;m here in the study looking for evidence.</p>
<p begin="01:58:30.866" end="01:58:32.216" style="s2">You suspect Luo Jiacheng?</p>
<p begin="01:58:32.666" end="01:58:35.183" style="s2">My mom is dead, and he&#39;s the one who benefits.</p>
<p begin="01:58:35.466" end="01:58:36.383" style="s2">He&#39;s the prime suspect.</p>
<p begin="01:58:37.466" end="01:58:39.450" style="s2">That brat, her personality is just like that.</p>
<p begin="01:58:39.866" end="01:58:42.749" style="s2">She resorts to violence at the slightest disagreement, like a madwoman.</p>
<p begin="01:58:43.200" end="01:58:43.816" style="s2">Someone&#39;s coming.</p>
<p begin="01:59:16.633" end="01:59:19.583" style="s2">How many times have I told you not to come to me unless it&#39;s urgent?</p>
<p begin="01:59:20.666" end="01:59:25.583" style="s2">Boss, I wouldn&#39;t dare bother you if it weren&#39;t so tricky.</p>
<p begin="01:59:26.266" end="01:59:28.383" style="s2">Ever since we dealt with Luo Man,</p>
<p begin="01:59:28.533" end="01:59:30.383" style="s2">I&#39;ve been keeping my nose clean.</p>
<p begin="01:59:31.333" end="01:59:34.516" style="s2">But this time, Tyrannosaurus was captured by the military.</p>
<p begin="01:59:35.200" end="01:59:36.616" style="s2">I never expected this grudge</p>
<p begin="01:59:37.333" end="01:59:38.516" style="s2">to involve Luo Guobin too.</p>
<p begin="01:59:40.266" end="01:59:43.183" style="s2">He got caught, that&#39;s his problem. What does it have to do with us?</p>
<p begin="01:59:44.666" end="01:59:46.783" style="s2">I&#39;m worried he killed Luo Man back then,</p>
<p begin="01:59:46.933" end="01:59:49.316" style="s2">and now Deng Zhiguo is after him for revenge.</p>
<p begin="01:59:50.000" end="01:59:52.116" style="s2">If he rats us out in there,</p>
<p begin="01:59:52.666" end="01:59:53.716" style="s2">we&#39;re both done for.</p>
<p begin="01:59:57.200" end="01:59:59.849" style="s2">Tyrannosaurus wasn&#39;t killed by his enemies,</p>
<p begin="02:00:00.266" end="02:00:03.583" style="s2">but ended up in military hands. That&#39;s definitely unusual.</p>
<p begin="02:00:05.866" end="02:00:06.783" style="s2">I also heard</p>
<p begin="02:00:07.466" end="02:00:10.916" style="s2">Tyrannosaurus was taken down by a hitman.</p>
<p begin="02:00:11.066" end="02:00:11.583" style="s2">Boss,</p>
<p begin="02:00:11.866" end="02:00:15.983" style="s2">do you think Deng Zhiguo might have hired a hitman to come after us too?</p>
<p begin="02:00:16.533" end="02:00:19.450" style="s2">What&#39;s the panic? Losing your head will get you killed faster.</p>
<p begin="02:00:20.800" end="02:00:24.350" style="s2">Back then we could set a trap to lead Luo Man to his death.</p>
<p begin="02:00:25.866" end="02:00:28.649" style="s2">Now we can deal with Deng Zhiguo just the same.</p>
<p begin="02:00:29.466" end="02:00:31.983" style="s2">Everyone has a weakness.</p>
<p begin="02:00:32.266" end="02:00:33.050" style="s2">Once we grab it,</p>
<p begin="02:00:33.866" end="02:00:35.949" style="s2">he&#39;ll be at our mercy.</p>
<p begin="02:00:36.933" end="02:00:39.183" style="s2">Luo Man and the child are gone.</p>
<p begin="02:00:40.000" end="02:00:40.783" style="s2">Deng Zhiguo</p>
<p begin="02:00:41.333" end="02:00:42.649" style="s2">has no weaknesses left.</p>
<p begin="02:00:43.200" end="02:00:45.050" style="s2">Who says he doesn&#39;t? At my home,</p>
<p begin="02:00:45.066" end="02:00:46.649" style="s2">aren&#39;t there still two old geezers?</p>
<p begin="02:00:46.933" end="02:00:49.849" style="s2">Deng Zhiguo treats them like his own parents.</p>
<p begin="02:00:50.666" end="02:00:52.783" style="s2">They&#39;re perfect for this.</p>
<p begin="02:00:59.333" end="02:01:02.483" style="s2">Good plan, but too bad you won&#39;t get to carry it out.</p>
<p begin="02:01:03.066" end="02:01:04.866" style="s2">Cutie, what are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="02:01:05.033" end="02:01:06.083" style="s2">Brother, what should we do?</p>
<p begin="02:01:10.000" end="02:01:11.849" style="s2">Since you came here looking for death yourself,</p>
<p begin="02:01:12.533" end="02:01:14.116" style="s2">don&#39;t blame me for being ruthless.</p>
<p begin="02:01:14.800" end="02:01:16.383" style="s2">Only a dead man&#39;s mouth</p>
<p begin="02:01:17.066" end="02:01:18.116" style="s2">keeps secrets best.</p>
<p begin="02:01:20.399" end="02:01:23.016" style="s2">His moves are too strange—is he even human?</p>
<p begin="02:01:23.333" end="02:01:24.216" style="s2">Help! Help!</p>
<p begin="02:01:24.933" end="02:01:25.816" style="s2">My leg!</p>
<p begin="02:01:28.133" end="02:01:30.516" style="s2">What&#39;s going on?</p>
<p begin="02:01:32.266" end="02:01:35.849" style="s2">Who says there&#39;s no one? Aren&#39;t there two old geezers at my house?</p>
<p begin="02:01:35.866" end="02:01:38.916" style="s2">Deng Zhiguo treats them like his own parents.</p>
<p begin="02:01:39.333" end="02:01:41.283" style="s2">They&#39;re perfect for this.</p>
<p begin="02:01:41.599" end="02:01:43.050" style="s2">You beast!</p>
<p begin="02:01:44.800" end="02:01:47.716" style="s2">Back then you were picking through trash on the street,</p>
<p begin="02:01:48.533" end="02:01:51.416" style="s2">if Xiaoman hadn&#39;t taken pity on you</p>
<p begin="02:01:52.133" end="02:01:57.550" style="s2">and begged me to adopt you, you&#39;d have frozen to death long ago.</p>
<p begin="02:01:58.800" end="02:02:03.016" style="s2">How has the Luo family ever wronged you?</p>
<p begin="02:02:03.599" end="02:02:06.483" style="s2">And yet you colluded with killers</p>
<p begin="02:02:07.200" end="02:02:09.050" style="s2">to murder her!</p>
<p begin="02:02:11.066" end="02:02:12.383" style="s2">Your conscience—</p>
<p begin="02:02:13.066" end="02:02:15.050" style="s2">did the dogs eat it?</p>
<p begin="02:02:19.866" end="02:02:22.916" style="s2">If she&#39;d been willing to marry me, I wouldn&#39;t have killed her.</p>
<p begin="02:02:23.733" end="02:02:25.583" style="s2">But she&#39;d rather die than agree.</p>
<p begin="02:02:26.933" end="02:02:31.683" style="s2">She forced my hand in all of this.</p>
<p begin="02:02:37.866" end="02:02:40.116" style="s2">For your own selfish desires you harmed my wife and daughter!</p>
<p begin="02:02:40.933" end="02:02:42.649" style="s2">You coward, you scum!</p>
<p begin="02:02:43.200" end="02:02:44.783" style="s2">I want you to pay with your life for hers!</p>
<p begin="02:02:52.533" end="02:02:52.916" style="s2">Leave one alive.</p>
<p begin="02:02:54.000" end="02:02:54.649" style="s2">Deal with them according to the law.</p>
<p begin="02:03:00.399" end="02:03:01.183" style="s2">Men!</p>
<p begin="02:03:06.266" end="02:03:09.583" style="s2">The mastermind is Luo Jiacheng—he threatened me into helping him.</p>
<p begin="02:03:10.000" end="02:03:13.550" style="s2">It has nothing to do with me, please forgive me!</p>
<p begin="02:03:13.866" end="02:03:17.983" style="s2">Take him away. Mengdie, save Daddy!</p>
<p begin="02:03:19.599" end="02:03:20.749" style="s2">Let go of my dad!</p>
<p begin="02:03:21.866" end="02:03:24.083" style="s2">Luo Ying, where are you taking my dad?</p>
<p begin="02:03:26.133" end="02:03:27.016" style="s2">To his death.</p>
<p begin="02:03:27.599" end="02:03:28.749" style="s2">You&#39;re the one who&#39;s going to die!</p>
<p begin="02:03:32.666" end="02:03:35.550" style="s2">Luo Guobin conspired with Luo Jiacheng to murder Luo Man.</p>
<p begin="02:03:36.133" end="02:03:38.516" style="s2">A life for a life—that&#39;s only just.</p>
<p begin="02:03:39.200" end="02:03:41.550" style="s2">If you&#39;re not satisfied, go tell the judge.</p>
<p begin="02:03:42.533" end="02:03:44.616" style="s2">Taking your anger out on my Yingying—what&#39;s that supposed to be?</p>
<p begin="02:03:46.133" end="02:03:47.450" style="s2">You dare hit me?</p>
<p begin="02:03:49.466" end="02:03:50.616" style="s2">I don&#39;t mind breaking your hand for good.</p>
<p begin="02:03:52.333" end="02:03:52.883" style="s2">Youyu!</p>
<p begin="02:03:53.733" end="02:03:55.050" style="s2">They&#39;re all bullying me!</p>
<p begin="02:03:57.599" end="02:04:00.216" style="s2">Your father made a mistake, so he should be punished.</p>
<p begin="02:04:01.866" end="02:04:03.550" style="s2">Be good, okay?</p>
<p begin="02:04:04.266" end="02:04:04.616" style="s2">Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="02:04:10.133" end="02:04:10.516" style="s2">Yingying.</p>
<p begin="02:04:11.466" end="02:04:12.749" style="s2">Come here.</p>
<p begin="02:04:16.666" end="02:04:18.516" style="s2">Good child, thank you.</p>
<p begin="02:04:19.066" end="02:04:19.949" style="s2">If it weren&#39;t for you,</p>
<p begin="02:04:20.399" end="02:04:22.599" style="s2">we two old fools would still not know</p>
<p begin="02:04:22.766" end="02:04:25.983" style="s2">how long we&#39;d be deceived by that heartless person.</p>
<p begin="02:04:26.666" end="02:04:27.983" style="s2">The truth is out.</p>
<p begin="02:04:29.733" end="02:04:32.483" style="s2">Xiaoman in heaven</p>
<p begin="02:04:34.533" end="02:04:36.383" style="s2">can rest in peace now.</p>
<p begin="02:04:39.733" end="02:04:40.516" style="s2">Child,</p>
<p begin="02:04:41.733" end="02:04:44.083" style="s2">what reward do you want?</p>
<p begin="02:04:44.800" end="02:04:46.516" style="s2">Just say it.</p>
<p begin="02:04:46.933" end="02:04:47.283" style="s2">Right.</p>
<p begin="02:04:48.266" end="02:04:49.050" style="s2">I don&#39;t need anything.</p>
<p begin="02:04:49.733" end="02:04:51.550" style="s2">I only hope Grandpa Luo and Grandma Luo</p>
<p begin="02:04:52.133" end="02:04:53.150" style="s2">recover soon.</p>
<p begin="02:04:55.466" end="02:04:57.316" style="s2">You really don&#39;t need anything?</p>
<p begin="02:05:04.266" end="02:05:06.116" style="s2">Old master, madam, the doctor is here.</p>
<p begin="02:05:06.399" end="02:05:09.450" style="s2">Let him check your pulses and calm your nerves first.</p>
<p begin="02:05:12.800" end="02:05:15.016" style="s2">There&#39;s a lot going on today.</p>
<p begin="02:05:16.000" end="02:05:16.916" style="s2">Another day,</p>
<p begin="02:05:17.866" end="02:05:19.583" style="s2">we&#39;ll treat you to a meal</p>
<p begin="02:05:20.133" end="02:05:22.216" style="s2">to thank you properly.</p>
<p begin="02:05:23.599" end="02:05:24.216" style="s2">Old master,</p>
<p begin="02:05:24.800" end="02:05:25.983" style="s2">you&#39;re too kind.</p>
<p begin="02:05:26.800" end="02:05:27.849" style="s2">Take care of your health.</p>
<p begin="02:05:28.800" end="02:05:29.849" style="s2">We&#39;ll be going now.</p>
<p begin="02:05:32.266" end="02:05:33.550" style="s2">Let me see you out.</p>
<p begin="02:05:40.000" end="02:05:40.616" style="s2">Uncle, Auntie,</p>
<p begin="02:05:41.466" end="02:05:42.083" style="s2">I&#39;ll take you home.</p>
<p begin="02:05:42.533" end="02:05:43.416" style="s2">Sure.</p>
<p begin="02:05:44.266" end="02:05:47.016" style="s2">Last time you came, we didn&#39;t even treat you to a meal.</p>
<p begin="02:05:47.466" end="02:05:49.716" style="s2">This time you must try our cooking.</p>
<p begin="02:05:50.133" end="02:05:50.749" style="s2">Okay.</p>
<p begin="02:05:51.733" end="02:05:52.616" style="s2">Leader Lu,</p>
<p begin="02:05:53.066" end="02:05:55.666" style="s2">you agreed so readily—did you plan from the start</p>
<p begin="02:05:55.833" end="02:05:58.616" style="s2">to come to my house for dinner?</p>
<p begin="02:06:02.600" end="02:06:03.000" style="s2">Wrong.</p>
<p begin="02:06:07.466" end="02:06:08.599" style="s2">What I want to eat</p>
<p begin="02:06:09.566" end="02:06:11.316" style="s2">is clearly...</p>
<p begin="02:06:12.800" end="02:06:13.983" style="s2">Let&#39;s get in the car first.</p>
<p begin="02:06:18.399" end="02:06:18.749" style="s2">You...</p>
<p begin="02:06:23.333" end="02:06:24.916" style="s2">The police caught Tyrannosaurus and Luo Jiacheng.</p>
<p begin="02:06:25.599" end="02:06:27.716" style="s2">The mastermind will follow the clues to find you.</p>
<p begin="02:06:28.000" end="02:06:28.783" style="s2">Maybe</p>
<p begin="02:06:29.733" end="02:06:31.450" style="s2">they&#39;re already hiding by your side.</p>
<p begin="02:06:32.266" end="02:06:33.716" style="s2">I can&#39;t follow you all the time.</p>
<p begin="02:06:34.399" end="02:06:35.316" style="s2">You need to be careful.</p>
<p begin="02:06:36.399" end="02:06:37.050" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry.</p>
<p begin="02:06:38.133" end="02:06:39.316" style="s2">They can&#39;t do anything to me.</p>
<p begin="02:06:40.133" end="02:06:40.916" style="s2">So confident.</p>
<p begin="02:06:44.800" end="02:06:45.683" style="s2">You were born...</p>
<p begin="02:06:46.666" end="02:06:47.816" style="s2">You&#39;re going to be my wife.</p>
<p begin="02:06:56.666" end="02:06:57.016" style="s2">Yingying.</p>
<p begin="02:06:57.599" end="02:06:59.816" style="s2">Your brother bought a camera for me and your mom.</p>
<p begin="02:07:00.133" end="02:07:02.866" style="s2">So we can take pictures, but I don&#39;t know</p>
<p begin="02:07:03.033" end="02:07:05.533" style="s2">how to turn it on. You young people should</p>
<p begin="02:07:05.699" end="02:07:07.816" style="s2">know how. Come take a look.</p>
<p begin="02:07:08.133" end="02:07:10.916" style="s2">Chief Lu, who fears nothing, is afraid of my dad.</p>
<p begin="02:07:13.466" end="02:07:14.516" style="s2">That&#39;s not fear.</p>
<p begin="02:07:15.333" end="02:07:18.916" style="s2">That&#39;s called maintaining strategic respect for my future father-in-law.</p>
<p begin="02:07:20.133" end="02:07:22.350" style="s2">Yingying, is this the button? I—</p>
<p begin="02:07:24.000" end="02:07:25.150" style="s2">I forgot Little Lu was here.</p>
<p begin="02:07:26.000" end="02:07:29.550" style="s2">Right, Little Lu, you&#39;ve been abroad. You should know how to fix this.</p>
<p begin="02:07:30.133" end="02:07:31.283" style="s2">Take a look for me.</p>
<p begin="02:07:31.733" end="02:07:32.083" style="s2">Okay.</p>
<p begin="02:07:32.133" end="02:07:32.783" style="s2">Here.</p>
<p begin="02:07:33.333" end="02:07:35.150" style="s2">You two work on it. I&#39;ll go cook.</p>
<p begin="02:07:48.133" end="02:07:49.050" style="s2">Let me take the call.</p>
<p begin="02:07:55.066" end="02:07:56.749" style="s2">Little Ying.</p>
<p begin="02:07:57.333" end="02:07:59.283" style="s2">What happened? Don&#39;t panic, take your time.</p>
<p begin="02:07:59.333" end="02:08:02.250" style="s2">Someone&#39;s holding the school hostage. They told me to call you.</p>
<p begin="02:08:02.533" end="02:08:05.849" style="s2">It&#39;s the Nine Colors leader. He wants you to come to the school.</p>
<p begin="02:08:06.266" end="02:08:08.383" style="s2">If you don&#39;t come, he&#39;ll blow us all up.</p>
<p begin="02:08:09.333" end="02:08:11.050" style="s2">Little Ying, I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="02:08:11.466" end="02:08:12.350" style="s2">But—</p>
<p begin="02:08:12.933" end="02:08:15.550" style="s2">They&#39;ve locked down the school. No one can get out.</p>
<p begin="02:08:15.733" end="02:08:17.016" style="s2">I&#39;m so scared.</p>
<p begin="02:08:17.200" end="02:08:18.516" style="s2">Don&#39;t be afraid. Wait for me.</p>
<p begin="02:08:22.133" end="02:08:23.050" style="s2">It&#39;s the Nine Colors leader.</p>
<p begin="02:08:23.333" end="02:08:23.849" style="s2">I&#39;m coming with you.</p>
<p begin="02:08:28.533" end="02:08:29.716" style="s2">You draw their attention.</p>
<p begin="02:08:30.800" end="02:08:31.683" style="s2">I&#39;ll slip in.</p>
<p begin="02:08:33.200" end="02:08:33.816" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="02:08:34.533" end="02:08:35.550" style="s2">It&#39;s too dangerous alone.</p>
<p begin="02:08:37.066" end="02:08:38.616" style="s2">Lu Heng, I&#39;m going in.</p>
<p begin="02:08:45.599" end="02:08:46.250" style="s2">Don&#39;t be rash.</p>
<p begin="02:08:46.800" end="02:08:48.516" style="s2">The Crimson Flame Legion is on their way.</p>
<p begin="02:08:53.866" end="02:08:54.749" style="s2">Be good, don&#39;t worry.</p>
<p begin="02:09:08.933" end="02:09:10.483" style="s2">I&#39;m Lu Heng, leader of the Crimson Flame Legion.</p>
<p begin="02:09:11.066" end="02:09:11.949" style="s2">What&#39;s the situation?</p>
<p begin="02:09:12.533" end="02:09:15.016" style="s2">Sir, overseas terrorists have taken over Black Forest Academy.</p>
<p begin="02:09:15.066" end="02:09:16.883" style="s2">The academy is full of China&#39;s most important children.</p>
<p begin="02:09:17.200" end="02:09:18.783" style="s2">They&#39;re vital to China&#39;s economy.</p>
<p begin="02:09:19.066" end="02:09:20.616" style="s2">I&#39;ve already notified the special operations team.</p>
<p begin="02:09:20.800" end="02:09:21.949" style="s2">They&#39;re on their way here.</p>
<p begin="02:09:22.800" end="02:09:23.583" style="s2">What&#39;s it like inside?</p>
<p begin="02:09:24.399" end="02:09:26.383" style="s2">Sir, they&#39;re using a signal jammer.</p>
<p begin="02:09:26.666" end="02:09:28.250" style="s2">We can&#39;t get a full picture inside for now.</p>
<p begin="02:09:30.800" end="02:09:33.016" style="s2">You can&#39;t go in there, miss. Get out of here.</p>
<p begin="02:09:33.200" end="02:09:34.749" style="s2">It&#39;s dangerous, miss.</p>
<p begin="02:09:34.933" end="02:09:36.216" style="s2">Do you have family in there?</p>
<p begin="02:09:36.266" end="02:09:37.949" style="s2">We know you&#39;re anxious and scared.</p>
<p begin="02:09:38.000" end="02:09:38.649" style="s2">We&#39;re even more anxious.</p>
<p begin="02:09:39.466" end="02:09:40.516" style="s2">Please trust our people.</p>
<p begin="02:09:40.666" end="02:09:42.749" style="s2">We will definitely bring everyone inside out, not a single one left behind.</p>
<p begin="02:09:45.866" end="02:09:46.616" style="s2">You can&#39;t stop it.</p>
<p begin="02:09:49.333" end="02:09:51.450" style="s2">When did that girl take my gun?</p>
<p begin="02:09:52.133" end="02:09:52.866" style="s2">You too.</p>
<p begin="02:09:53.033" end="02:09:54.216" style="s2">A formally trained person,</p>
<p begin="02:09:54.399" end="02:09:55.666" style="s2">and you don&#39;t even know when a little girl</p>
<p begin="02:09:55.833" end="02:09:57.150" style="s2">took the gun from your pocket.</p>
<p begin="02:09:57.866" end="02:09:58.483" style="s2">Captain Lin.</p>
<p begin="02:09:59.333" end="02:10:01.450" style="s2">That girl went into the school with a gun.</p>
<p begin="02:10:02.000" end="02:10:02.749" style="s2">Should we chase her?</p>
<p begin="02:10:04.533" end="02:10:04.883" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="02:10:05.466" end="02:10:07.183" style="s2">Return to your posts and strengthen the defense.</p>
<p begin="02:10:07.599" end="02:10:10.383" style="s2">Remember, you must stop those parents who want to rush into the school,</p>
<p begin="02:10:10.933" end="02:10:13.000" style="s2">so that when our people exchange for the hostages,</p>
<p begin="02:10:13.166" end="02:10:15.316" style="s2">nothing unexpected happens. I&#39;m going to contact the people inside now,</p>
<p begin="02:10:15.466" end="02:10:16.783" style="s2">and have them bring that girl out.</p>
<p begin="02:10:17.599" end="02:10:17.949" style="s2">Yes.</p>
<p begin="02:10:18.933" end="02:10:21.716" style="s2">Emergency report: at the east school gate, a girl</p>
<p begin="02:10:21.733" end="02:10:22.883" style="s2">entered the restricted area with a gun.</p>
<p begin="02:10:22.933" end="02:10:25.316" style="s2">She&#39;s heading toward the laboratory building where the criminals are.</p>
<p begin="02:10:25.333" end="02:10:26.350" style="s2">Please intercept her.</p>
<p begin="02:10:26.666" end="02:10:27.666" style="s2">Acknowledge, please reply.</p>
<p begin="02:10:27.666" end="02:10:28.383" style="s2">Acknowledge, please reply.</p>
<p begin="02:10:30.800" end="02:10:32.749" style="s2">Why is someone else coming? Get out.</p>
<p begin="02:10:34.933" end="02:10:36.216" style="s2">Chief Lu.</p>
<p begin="02:10:37.333" end="02:10:38.649" style="s2">My fiancée just went in.</p>
<p begin="02:10:39.333" end="02:10:40.116" style="s2">I&#39;m going to save her.</p>
<p begin="02:10:40.933" end="02:10:41.583" style="s2">Which way did she go?</p>
<p begin="02:10:42.133" end="02:10:42.483" style="s2">That way.</p>
<p begin="02:10:48.266" end="02:10:50.916" style="s2">Humei, can you find out what&#39;s going on inside the academy?</p>
<p begin="02:10:51.466" end="02:10:54.883" style="s2">I&#39;m a top hacker. What could stop me?</p>
<p begin="02:10:57.200" end="02:11:00.649" style="s2">Pavilion Master, the enemy has set up a three-dimensional kill zone in the laboratory building.</p>
<p begin="02:11:01.200" end="02:11:03.683" style="s2">They&#39;ve planted timed bombs from the first floor to the rooftop.</p>
<p begin="02:11:04.399" end="02:11:06.649" style="s2">They want to wipe the entire building off the map.</p>
<p begin="02:11:07.599" end="02:11:09.716" style="s2">I&#39;m sending you the bomb locations now.</p>
<p begin="02:11:10.399" end="02:11:11.683" style="s2">I got it. Thanks.</p>
<p begin="02:11:16.533" end="02:11:18.616" style="s2">Going through the front door of the lab building will get us spotted.</p>
<p begin="02:11:18.933" end="02:11:20.383" style="s2">The math building is next to the lab building.</p>
<p begin="02:11:21.866" end="02:11:24.783" style="s2">If we climb from outside the wall to the lab building, they won&#39;t spot me.</p>
<p begin="02:11:29.599" end="02:11:31.816" style="s2">Little princess, did you forget?</p>
<p begin="02:11:32.366" end="02:11:33.266" style="s2">When going to dangerous places,</p>
<p begin="02:11:34.499" end="02:11:34.866" style="s2">we hold hands.</p>
<p begin="02:11:36.000" end="02:11:37.150" style="s2">Even when climbing walls?</p>
<p begin="02:11:37.333" end="02:11:38.649" style="s2">You tell me.</p>
<p begin="02:11:57.466" end="02:11:58.116" style="s2">Pair of nines.</p>
<p begin="02:11:58.800" end="02:11:59.949" style="s2">Come on, go.</p>
<p begin="02:12:00.666" end="02:12:01.016" style="s2">Three.</p>
<p begin="02:12:04.533" end="02:12:06.749" style="s2">No one, it&#39;s just the wind blowing the window open.</p>
<p begin="02:12:07.466" end="02:12:10.250" style="s2">Those guys are such cowards, they don&#39;t dare come up at all.</p>
<p begin="02:12:10.933" end="02:12:12.616" style="s2">Come on, come on, let&#39;s continue.</p>
<p begin="02:12:23.599" end="02:12:25.316" style="s2">Your actions just now were seen by someone.</p>
<p begin="02:12:25.733" end="02:12:26.883" style="s2">It could make the front page of social news.</p>
<p begin="02:12:27.599" end="02:12:31.050" style="s2">I&#39;ve even thought of the headline: Urban Soldier King Appears.</p>
<p begin="02:12:31.200" end="02:12:33.450" style="s2">Mysterious woman kills three people in a row with ease.</p>
<p begin="02:12:33.599" end="02:12:35.849" style="s2">Her moves were clean and sharp, textbook perfect.</p>
<p begin="02:12:57.200" end="02:12:57.816" style="s2">Split up and move.</p>
<p begin="02:13:17.466" end="02:13:18.466" style="s2">It&#39;s Luo Ying.</p>
<p begin="02:13:19.166" end="02:13:20.616" style="s2">It&#39;s Luo Ying, she&#39;s come to save us.</p>
<p begin="02:13:21.066" end="02:13:21.450" style="s2">Xiao Ying.</p>
<p begin="02:13:21.999" end="02:13:22.516" style="s2">They...</p>
<p begin="02:13:23.066" end="02:13:25.150" style="s2">They&#39;re all dead. Stay in the classroom and don&#39;t go out.</p>
<p begin="02:13:25.599" end="02:13:27.316" style="s2">People are dead, why can&#39;t we go out?</p>
<p begin="02:13:27.333" end="02:13:28.516" style="s2">We want to go out.</p>
<p begin="02:13:28.800" end="02:13:30.116" style="s2">The people guarding you are dead.</p>
<p begin="02:13:30.266" end="02:13:31.716" style="s2">But they planted bombs in the school.</p>
<p begin="02:13:32.400" end="02:13:33.983" style="s2">And there are still quite a few guarding the entrance.</p>
<p begin="02:13:34.533" end="02:13:37.050" style="s2">Once they notice anything unusual and detonate the bombs...</p>
<p begin="02:13:37.333" end="02:13:37.983" style="s2">You&#39;ll all die.</p>
<p begin="02:13:39.200" end="02:13:40.650" style="s2">Xiao Ying came here to save us...</p>
<p begin="02:13:40.933" end="02:13:43.316" style="s2">...tying her own life and death to ours.</p>
<p begin="02:13:43.866" end="02:13:46.383" style="s2">We can only get out alive if we follow her orders.</p>
<p begin="02:13:47.200" end="02:13:48.883" style="s2">Do you know where the organization&#39;s leader is?</p>
<p begin="02:13:49.466" end="02:13:51.716" style="s2">Just now, just now there was a Captain Deng...</p>
<p begin="02:13:51.733" end="02:13:53.799" style="s2">...who came to save us, but while fighting the killer leader...</p>
<p begin="02:13:53.966" end="02:13:55.583" style="s2">...he got injured and was forcibly taken away by them.</p>
<p begin="02:13:55.999" end="02:13:58.650" style="s2">We heard them talking earlier, they probably went to the rooftop.</p>
<p begin="02:13:59.333" end="02:13:59.849" style="s2">Deng Zhiguo.</p>
<p begin="02:14:00.533" end="02:14:01.450" style="s2">Yes, that&#39;s him.</p>
<p begin="02:14:01.599" end="02:14:02.249" style="s2">You know him?</p>
<p begin="02:14:03.066" end="02:14:05.316" style="s2">I&#39;ll go defuse the bombs and save people. Don&#39;t leave here.</p>
<p begin="02:14:06.133" end="02:14:07.416" style="s2">Xiao Ying, go with peace of mind.</p>
<p begin="02:14:07.599" end="02:14:08.733" style="s2">If anyone sneaks out...</p>
<p begin="02:14:08.900" end="02:14:10.383" style="s2">...I&#39;ll note it all down and settle it with you when you get back.</p>
<p begin="02:14:11.333" end="02:14:12.783" style="s2">Still the type who looks honest on the surface but keeps track in her head.</p>
<p begin="02:14:41.733" end="02:14:43.550" style="s2">Tyrannosaurus was captured by Rakshasa.</p>
<p begin="02:14:44.133" end="02:14:46.750" style="s2">Is this Rakshasa really that terrifying?</p>
<p begin="02:14:48.400" end="02:14:50.883" style="s2">I heard Rakshasa is just a slender woman.</p>
<p begin="02:14:51.200" end="02:14:53.183" style="s2">Tyrannosaurus is such a waste, can&#39;t even beat a woman.</p>
<p begin="02:14:53.466" end="02:14:56.116" style="s2">And he got captured at Di&#39;an Xinghe. If Rakshasa dares...</p>
<p begin="02:14:56.133" end="02:14:57.983" style="s2">...show up in front of me, three moves...</p>
<p begin="02:14:58.266" end="02:15:00.349" style="s2">...and I&#39;ll take her life. Then...</p>
<p begin="02:15:00.533" end="02:15:02.383" style="s2">...I&#39;ll become the new King of Killers.</p>
<p begin="02:15:03.599" end="02:15:03.949" style="s2">Yin.</p>
<p begin="02:15:05.066" end="02:15:05.716" style="s2">Behind you.</p>
<p begin="02:15:07.333" end="02:15:08.216" style="s2">In the next life...</p>
<p begin="02:15:08.933" end="02:15:10.249" style="s2">...I&#39;ll be your King of Killers again.</p>
<p begin="02:15:13.999" end="02:15:14.616" style="s2">Wait.</p>
<p begin="02:15:15.200" end="02:15:17.949" style="s2">Lord Rakshasa, I&#39;m your fan.</p>
<p begin="02:15:18.400" end="02:15:20.750" style="s2">To come to the Great Xia Kingdom to catch you,</p>
<p begin="02:15:21.200" end="02:15:23.416" style="s2">I bribed a lot of people just to get this spot.</p>
<p begin="02:15:24.133" end="02:15:24.483" style="s2">My lord,</p>
<p begin="02:15:25.200" end="02:15:26.650" style="s2">could you sign this for me?</p>
<p begin="02:15:27.066" end="02:15:28.616" style="s2">Then kill me, okay?</p>
<p begin="02:15:36.933" end="02:15:39.050" style="s2">Don&#39;t think I can&#39;t tell—you&#39;re the real Silver.</p>
<p begin="02:15:39.599" end="02:15:41.450" style="s2">Your disguise and acting are both terrible.</p>
<p begin="02:15:42.133" end="02:15:42.750" style="s2">Rakshasa.</p>
<p begin="02:15:43.466" end="02:15:44.616" style="s2">You dare kill me?</p>
<p begin="02:15:52.666" end="02:15:55.050" style="s2">Deng Zhiguo, surrender.</p>
<p begin="02:15:55.866" end="02:15:58.483" style="s2">Betray your country and join us,</p>
<p begin="02:15:59.066" end="02:16:00.383" style="s2">and you can still live.</p>
<p begin="02:16:02.533" end="02:16:04.116" style="s2">I won&#39;t surrender to you.</p>
<p begin="02:16:07.466" end="02:16:11.050" style="s2">I know you&#39;ve been searching for your daughter all these years.</p>
<p begin="02:16:12.266" end="02:16:15.316" style="s2">As long as you join us,</p>
<p begin="02:16:15.599" end="02:16:18.116" style="s2">we&#39;ll help you find your daughter.</p>
<p begin="02:16:19.333" end="02:16:20.883" style="s2">If you don&#39;t join us,</p>
<p begin="02:16:23.200" end="02:16:25.050" style="s2">I&#39;ll kill you today,</p>
<p begin="02:16:26.133" end="02:16:29.716" style="s2">and you&#39;ll never see your daughter again.</p>
<p begin="02:16:30.800" end="02:16:32.116" style="s2">You know where she is?</p>
<p begin="02:16:36.666" end="02:16:38.083" style="s2">Of course I know.</p>
<p begin="02:16:39.300" end="02:16:42.783" style="s2">I had her taken from you back then.</p>
<p begin="02:16:44.533" end="02:16:45.849" style="s2">I&#39;ll give you three seconds.</p>
<p begin="02:16:46.533" end="02:16:48.883" style="s2">Tell me your choice.</p>
<p begin="02:16:50.400" end="02:16:51.050" style="s2">Three.</p>
<p begin="02:16:51.999" end="02:16:52.616" style="s2">Two.</p>
<p begin="02:16:53.799" end="02:16:54.916" style="s2">One.</p>
<p begin="02:16:55.999" end="02:16:56.916" style="s2">Captain Deng,</p>
<p begin="02:16:57.733" end="02:16:59.316" style="s2">have you made up your mind?</p>
<p begin="02:17:01.999" end="02:17:02.916" style="s2">Where&#39;s my daughter?</p>
<p begin="02:17:03.599" end="02:17:06.116" style="s2">Tell me, please, tell me!</p>
<p begin="02:17:06.133" end="02:17:06.883" style="s2">Where&#39;s my daughter?</p>
<p begin="02:17:08.400" end="02:17:11.050" style="s2">I&#39;m the one who killed your brother. I&#39;m your enemy.</p>
<p begin="02:17:11.733" end="02:17:14.116" style="s2">I&#39;ll pay with my life—just let my daughter go.</p>
<p begin="02:17:18.266" end="02:17:21.983" style="s2">I sent your daughter to the Blood Fiend assassin camp.</p>
<p begin="02:17:22.400" end="02:17:24.883" style="s2">She endures endless killing every day.</p>
<p begin="02:17:25.599" end="02:17:28.383" style="s2">She&#39;s never had a day of peace.</p>
<p begin="02:17:30.666" end="02:17:33.550" style="s2">Kill me, but let my daughter go!</p>
<p begin="02:17:36.800" end="02:17:38.349" style="s2">Kill you?</p>
<p begin="02:17:39.066" end="02:17:40.650" style="s2">That&#39;s too easy.</p>
<p begin="02:17:42.133" end="02:17:43.050" style="s2">If you want to save her,</p>
<p begin="02:17:43.599" end="02:17:45.583" style="s2">you have only one way.</p>
<p begin="02:17:47.200" end="02:17:51.716" style="s2">I want you to submit to me and work for me from now on.</p>
<p begin="02:17:53.866" end="02:17:58.216" style="s2">You&#39;ll live every day in the agony of your faith being destroyed.</p>
<p begin="02:18:00.800" end="02:18:04.750" style="s2">Only then will my brother be avenged.</p>
<p begin="02:18:07.466" end="02:18:07.983" style="s2">Uncle Deng,</p>
<p begin="02:18:08.533" end="02:18:10.483" style="s2">your daughter isn&#39;t as miserable as he says.</p>
<p begin="02:18:11.066" end="02:18:13.316" style="s2">She became the King of Assassins at thirteen.</p>
<p begin="02:18:13.599" end="02:18:18.216" style="s2">Since then, even the Nine-Colored leaders can&#39;t interfere with her freedom.</p>
<p begin="02:18:21.999" end="02:18:23.016" style="s2">Thirteen years old</p>
<p begin="02:18:23.733" end="02:18:24.883" style="s2">King of Killers</p>
<p begin="02:18:25.333" end="02:18:26.883" style="s2">How come I only see it now</p>
<p begin="02:18:27.200" end="02:18:27.816" style="s2">That face</p>
<p begin="02:18:28.533" end="02:18:29.716" style="s2">You are my daughter</p>
<p begin="02:18:30.533" end="02:18:31.583" style="s2">My poor child</p>
<p begin="02:18:32.133" end="02:18:33.816" style="s2">Someone, kill Rakshasa</p>
<p begin="02:18:36.666" end="02:18:38.083" style="s2">A bunch of trash</p>
<p begin="02:18:40.933" end="02:18:43.716" style="s2">But with an opponent like you</p>
<p begin="02:18:44.266" end="02:18:46.383" style="s2">I can finally show my true strength</p>
<p begin="02:18:48.333" end="02:18:49.183" style="s2">You Yu</p>
<p begin="02:18:50.133" end="02:18:51.683" style="s2">How do you want to die?</p>
<p begin="02:18:52.533" end="02:18:54.616" style="s2">How did you guess my identity?</p>
<p begin="02:18:55.200" end="02:18:56.483" style="s2">A man worth billions</p>
<p begin="02:18:57.066" end="02:18:58.783" style="s2">Suddenly engaged to Luo Mengdie</p>
<p begin="02:18:59.999" end="02:19:01.716" style="s2">You used her as a cover to get close to me</p>
<p begin="02:19:01.999" end="02:19:03.683" style="s2">Through her, you tracked my movements</p>
<p begin="02:19:04.266" end="02:19:06.083" style="s2">Then paved the way for your later plans</p>
<p begin="02:19:13.999" end="02:19:15.716" style="s2">I admit you&#39;re outstanding</p>
<p begin="02:19:16.400" end="02:19:20.383" style="s2">But unfortunately, you&#39;re the daughter of Luo Man and Deng Zhiguo</p>
<p begin="02:19:21.333" end="02:19:25.550" style="s2">Because of that alone, you and I are destined to be mortal enemies</p>
<p begin="02:19:26.533" end="02:19:30.116" style="s2">Otherwise, I really could have let you live</p>
<p begin="02:19:30.933" end="02:19:31.816" style="s2">Enough talk</p>
<p begin="02:19:35.466" end="02:19:38.650" style="s2">Your understanding is still stuck at brute force</p>
<p begin="02:19:39.333" end="02:19:40.783" style="s2">In terms of life form</p>
<p begin="02:19:41.333" end="02:19:44.383" style="s2">You and I are already in different dimensions</p>
<p begin="02:19:48.533" end="02:19:49.416" style="s2">Daughter, watch out</p>
<p begin="02:19:58.933" end="02:19:59.550" style="s2">Daughter</p>
<p begin="02:20:02.266" end="02:20:03.450" style="s2">Luo Man&#39;s daughter</p>
<p begin="02:20:04.133" end="02:20:06.083" style="s2">Now it&#39;s my turn to ask you</p>
<p begin="02:20:06.933" end="02:20:08.883" style="s2">Have you figured out how to die?</p>
<p begin="02:20:15.866" end="02:20:17.283" style="s2">Careful, he won&#39;t get hurt</p>
<p begin="02:20:18.800" end="02:20:19.983" style="s2">His body isn&#39;t indestructible</p>
<p begin="02:20:20.533" end="02:20:21.849" style="s2">It&#39;s been through biochemical modification</p>
<p begin="02:20:22.800" end="02:20:24.349" style="s2">Making his nearly fifty-year-old body</p>
<p begin="02:20:24.400" end="02:20:26.083" style="s2">Stay at the peak state of a twenty-year-old</p>
<p begin="02:20:26.666" end="02:20:28.349" style="s2">Ordinary physical attacks are useless against him</p>
<p begin="02:20:29.866" end="02:20:31.016" style="s2">Is the Blood Jade on you?</p>
<p begin="02:20:33.466" end="02:20:34.116" style="s2">Yes</p>
<p begin="02:20:41.999" end="02:20:44.616" style="s2">Blood Jade, my Blood Jade</p>
<p begin="02:20:45.599" end="02:20:48.516" style="s2">I could have used the Blood Jade to achieve immortality</p>
<p begin="02:20:49.200" end="02:20:52.750" style="s2">You deserve to die, you broke my Blood Jade</p>
<p begin="02:20:53.300" end="02:20:53.983" style="s2">After the Blood Jade is smashed</p>
<p begin="02:20:54.266" end="02:20:55.949" style="s2">It can protect its owner from external attacks</p>
<p begin="02:20:56.400" end="02:20:57.933" style="s2">From now on, your body</p>
<p begin="02:20:58.099" end="02:21:00.216" style="s2">Is like You Yu&#39;s, immune to physical attacks</p>
<p begin="02:21:01.333" end="02:21:04.216" style="s2">The Blood Jade is your family heirloom, how could it merge into my body?</p>
<p begin="02:21:05.066" end="02:21:06.483" style="s2">The Blood Jade is the Luo family heirloom</p>
<p begin="02:21:06.800" end="02:21:08.883" style="s2">Before the family trouble, Xiao Man sensed</p>
<p begin="02:21:09.200" end="02:21:11.016" style="s2">The Luo family couldn&#39;t protect the Blood Jade</p>
<p begin="02:21:11.999" end="02:21:14.483" style="s2">The Lu family tomb has a Skynet-level defense system.</p>
<p begin="02:21:14.800" end="02:21:17.316" style="s2">Xiaoman gave the Blood Jade to the Lu family for free.</p>
<p begin="02:21:17.733" end="02:21:20.249" style="s2">The Blood Jade only recognizes the Luo family, so it&#39;s compatible with you.</p>
<p begin="02:21:21.599" end="02:21:21.949" style="s2">Youyu.</p>
<p begin="02:21:23.333" end="02:21:24.483" style="s2">You&#39;re dead.</p>
<p begin="02:21:37.200" end="02:21:39.316" style="s2">Although Yingying has the same constitution as Youyu,</p>
<p begin="02:21:39.999" end="02:21:41.283" style="s2">she can&#39;t kill him.</p>
<p begin="02:21:42.266" end="02:21:43.050" style="s2">There&#39;s something</p>
<p begin="02:21:43.733" end="02:21:45.016" style="s2">that might kill him.</p>
<p begin="02:21:48.666" end="02:21:49.183" style="s2">What&#39;s this?</p>
<p begin="02:21:49.733" end="02:21:50.783" style="s2">This is the Luo family heirloom.</p>
<p begin="02:21:51.466" end="02:21:52.083" style="s2">The Luo Shen Bow.</p>
<p begin="02:21:52.800" end="02:21:53.416" style="s2">Unfortunately,</p>
<p begin="02:21:53.999" end="02:21:55.050" style="s2">I don&#39;t know how to disassemble or assemble it.</p>
<p begin="02:21:56.800" end="02:21:57.416" style="s2">Let me see.</p>
<p begin="02:22:03.866" end="02:22:05.583" style="s2">Chief Lu, you&#39;re amazing.</p>
<p begin="02:22:15.333" end="02:22:16.349" style="s2">Little princess, catch!</p>
<p begin="02:22:19.200" end="02:22:22.483" style="s2">It&#39;s useless. The scrap metal in your hands</p>
<p begin="02:22:22.533" end="02:22:24.750" style="s2">can&#39;t even scratch my skin.</p>
<p begin="02:22:25.866" end="02:22:28.249" style="s2">Xiaoman said that even someone with a peak physical body</p>
<p begin="02:22:28.533" end="02:22:29.316" style="s2">has a weakness.</p>
<p begin="02:22:29.999" end="02:22:32.116" style="s2">It&#39;s his forehead, daughter.</p>
<p begin="02:22:32.266" end="02:22:33.150" style="s2">Attack his forehead.</p>
<p begin="02:22:38.666" end="02:22:39.550" style="s2">This light...</p>
<p begin="02:22:40.266" end="02:22:44.116" style="s2">This is the Luo Shen Bow.</p>
<p begin="02:22:44.400" end="02:22:46.083" style="s2">It&#39;s the heirloom of the Luo Shen family.</p>
<p begin="02:22:46.400" end="02:22:47.816" style="s2">How is it in your hands?</p>
<p begin="02:22:48.400" end="02:22:52.349" style="s2">Luo Man is the heir of the Luo Shen family.</p>
<p begin="02:22:52.933" end="02:22:55.183" style="s2">You only realize it now? Too late.</p>
<p begin="02:22:55.599" end="02:22:56.750" style="s2">Daughter, kill him.</p>
<p begin="02:22:59.866" end="02:23:00.483" style="s2">Do it.</p>
<p begin="02:23:01.866" end="02:23:04.349" style="s2">Luo Ying, I beg you, don&#39;t kill me.</p>
<p begin="02:23:04.666" end="02:23:07.716" style="s2">I can give you all my overseas assets.</p>
<p begin="02:23:18.666" end="02:23:19.283" style="s2">You&#39;re so noisy.</p>
<p begin="02:23:22.266" end="02:23:22.883" style="s2">Mom.</p>
<p begin="02:23:23.599" end="02:23:24.783" style="s2">Thank you for your final gift.</p>
<p begin="02:23:28.533" end="02:23:29.416" style="s2">You&#39;re okay.</p>
<p begin="02:23:31.599" end="02:23:32.216" style="s2">I&#39;m fine.</p>
<p begin="02:23:33.866" end="02:23:35.416" style="s2">How did you become Luo Guodong&#39;s daughter?</p>
<p begin="02:23:38.266" end="02:23:39.150" style="s2">It was the Blood Jade.</p>
<p begin="02:23:40.133" end="02:23:41.016" style="s2">It brought my soul</p>
<p begin="02:23:41.599" end="02:23:42.883" style="s2">back to life in this body.</p>
<p begin="02:23:45.333" end="02:23:47.683" style="s2">It&#39;s my fault, Dad, for not protecting you.</p>
<p begin="02:23:48.533" end="02:23:51.283" style="s2">But at least you have a complete family now.</p>
<p begin="02:23:54.800" end="02:23:55.150" style="s2">I...</p>
<p begin="02:24:09.999" end="02:24:11.683" style="s2">Sorry, Madam, Chief.</p>
<p begin="02:24:12.266" end="02:24:12.883" style="s2">We&#39;re late.</p>
<p begin="02:24:13.466" end="02:24:14.733" style="s2">When we received the notice,</p>
<p begin="02:24:14.900" end="02:24:16.783" style="s2">the students had already been successfully rescued and evacuated.</p>
<p begin="02:24:17.066" end="02:24:19.716" style="s2">These students are the backbone of Huaguo&#39;s economy.</p>
<p begin="02:24:20.266" end="02:24:20.783" style="s2">If anything happens to anyone today,</p>
<p begin="02:24:20.800" end="02:24:24.083" style="s2">it will cause a nationwide shock.</p>
<p begin="02:24:24.400" end="02:24:26.916" style="s2">On behalf of the higher-ups, I thank you for your</p>
<p begin="02:24:27.200" end="02:24:29.050" style="s2">outstanding contribution in this crisis.</p>
<p begin="02:24:29.466" end="02:24:31.949" style="s2">This will be a major merit.</p>
<p begin="02:24:32.666" end="02:24:35.716" style="s2">Thanks to Luo Ying and Chief Lu for the successful evacuation.</p>
<p begin="02:24:36.133" end="02:24:37.450" style="s2">Yingying took care of the killers.</p>
<p begin="02:24:38.133" end="02:24:39.050" style="s2">Yingying defused the bombs.</p>
<p begin="02:24:39.733" end="02:24:41.583" style="s2">Yingying also killed the head of the Nine Colors organization.</p>
<p begin="02:24:42.266" end="02:24:43.183" style="s2">Today&#39;s top credit</p>
<p begin="02:24:43.866" end="02:24:44.249" style="s2">goes to her.</p>
<p begin="02:24:46.266" end="02:24:47.849" style="s2">So she&#39;s from the special operations team.</p>
<p begin="02:24:48.266" end="02:24:49.983" style="s2">No wonder she could climb over the wall.</p>
<p begin="02:24:50.266" end="02:24:51.050" style="s2">Amazing.</p>
<p begin="02:24:51.599" end="02:24:57.416" style="s2">Luo Ying,</p>
<p begin="02:25:04.933" end="02:25:08.116" style="s2">your grandparents would be overjoyed to have you back.</p>
<p begin="02:25:09.333" end="02:25:11.283" style="s2">We should also thank your current parents.</p>
<p begin="02:25:11.999" end="02:25:14.783" style="s2">Even after learning the truth, they still support</p>
<p begin="02:25:14.933" end="02:25:17.050" style="s2">you reclaiming your roots with your current body.</p>
<p begin="02:25:20.933" end="02:25:22.616" style="s2">They&#39;ve always been so good to me.</p>
<p begin="02:25:23.066" end="02:25:25.283" style="s2">I&#39;m happy and I cherish it.</p>
<p begin="02:25:27.333" end="02:25:27.716" style="s2">Come on.</p>
<p begin="02:25:31.733" end="02:25:33.050" style="s2">Dad, Mom,</p>
<p begin="02:25:35.866" end="02:25:37.583" style="s2">this is the Luo family&#39;s long-lost daughter.</p>
<p begin="02:25:38.533" end="02:25:39.949" style="s2">She looks so much like Miss Luo Man.</p>
<p begin="02:25:40.800" end="02:25:41.949" style="s2">I announce</p>
<p begin="02:25:43.066" end="02:25:44.650" style="s2">that all shares under my name</p>
<p begin="02:25:45.599" end="02:25:47.183" style="s2">are transferred to Luo Ying.</p>
<p begin="02:25:48.266" end="02:25:49.416" style="s2">From now on,</p>
<p begin="02:25:49.999" end="02:25:55.050" style="s2">Luo Ying is the true head of our Luo family.</p>
<p begin="02:25:55.866" end="02:25:59.550" style="s2">Congratulations, congratulations to the Luo elders</p>
<p begin="02:25:59.599" end="02:26:01.016" style="s2">on having an heir.</p>
<p begin="02:26:02.533" end="02:26:03.416" style="s2">Dad, Mom,</p>
<p begin="02:26:03.999" end="02:26:05.016" style="s2">let&#39;s have a word over here.</p>
<p begin="02:26:09.333" end="02:26:13.683" style="s2">By seniority, I should call you cousin.</p>
<p begin="02:26:14.133" end="02:26:17.416" style="s2">I heard you were only recently brought home by Uncle.</p>
<p begin="02:26:18.133" end="02:26:20.600" style="s2">After you went missing, when were you</p>
<p begin="02:26:20.766" end="02:26:22.083" style="s2">adopted by the Luo Guodong couple?</p>
<p begin="02:26:25.200" end="02:26:25.933" style="s2">I heard</p>
<p begin="02:26:26.099" end="02:26:29.716" style="s2">that before a kind couple took you in, you had a rough time.</p>
<p begin="02:26:30.800" end="02:26:35.550" style="s2">Cousin, I didn&#39;t mean anything by it, just a bit curious.</p>
<p begin="02:26:35.999" end="02:26:38.216" style="s2">I heard lots of kidnapped rich girls</p>
<p begin="02:26:38.533" end="02:26:39.683" style="s2">were insulted by people.</p>
<p begin="02:26:40.533" end="02:26:43.550" style="s2">Like growing up in a brothel, forced to serve clients.</p>
<p begin="02:26:45.066" end="02:26:47.016" style="s2">I really didn&#39;t mean to target you, cousin.</p>
<p begin="02:26:47.999" end="02:26:49.983" style="s2">Just wanted to ask on everyone&#39;s behalf.</p>
<p begin="02:26:50.400" end="02:26:52.883" style="s2">After you disappeared, what did you go through?</p>
<p begin="02:26:53.733" end="02:26:56.883" style="s2">Did you experience anything unforgettable?</p>
<p begin="02:26:57.866" end="02:27:00.216" style="s2">Cousin, why are you ignoring me?</p>
<p begin="02:27:02.533" end="02:27:03.416" style="s2">I really want to know.</p>
<p begin="02:27:04.133" end="02:27:05.283" style="s2">Of course</p>
<p begin="02:27:11.866" end="02:27:14.883" style="s2">Unforgettable things are probably like this</p>
<p begin="02:27:15.599" end="02:27:16.483" style="s2">Killing someone</p>
<p begin="02:27:17.733" end="02:27:20.483" style="s2">What did I just see? The Luo family&#39;s newly returned heiress</p>
<p begin="02:27:20.666" end="02:27:22.616" style="s2">Openly demonstrating murder without hesitation</p>
<p begin="02:27:23.333" end="02:27:26.216" style="s2">Rude, but her skills are impressive</p>
<p begin="02:27:29.066" end="02:27:30.883" style="s2">Yafu, what&#39;s wrong</p>
<p begin="02:27:31.066" end="02:27:31.416" style="s2">Yafu</p>
<p begin="02:27:35.066" end="02:27:37.949" style="s2">You should be grateful I just wanted good luck</p>
<p begin="02:27:39.066" end="02:27:42.483" style="s2">I didn&#39;t plan to kill anyone at the welcome banquet my grandfather threw for me</p>
<p begin="02:27:42.800" end="02:27:43.416" style="s2">Otherwise</p>
<p begin="02:27:44.133" end="02:27:45.683" style="s2">You&#39;d have been strangled just now</p>
<p begin="02:27:56.533" end="02:27:58.116" style="s2">What&#39;s going on, what happened</p>
<p begin="02:28:01.333" end="02:28:03.016" style="s2">She killed someone</p>
<p begin="02:28:03.599" end="02:28:05.150" style="s2">She wants to kill my daughter</p>
<p begin="02:28:06.533" end="02:28:07.150" style="s2">Uncle</p>
<p begin="02:28:07.733" end="02:28:10.349" style="s2">My daughter kindly asked her, and this is how your Luo family</p>
<p begin="02:28:10.933" end="02:28:14.750" style="s2">Treats the heiress you&#39;ve been separated from for years?</p>
<p begin="02:28:15.333" end="02:28:18.216" style="s2">Grandpa Luo, my throat hurts so much</p>
<p begin="02:28:18.533" end="02:28:19.150" style="s2">It&#39;s unbearable</p>
<p begin="02:28:19.999" end="02:28:22.883" style="s2">You must stand up for me and punish Luo Ying severely</p>
<p begin="02:28:28.533" end="02:28:30.650" style="s2">This is too much</p>
<p begin="02:28:31.599" end="02:28:35.283" style="s2">A country girl just doesn&#39;t have the manners of a proper lady</p>
<p begin="02:28:36.500" end="02:28:37.050" style="s2">Old Master Luo</p>
<p begin="02:28:37.733" end="02:28:41.316" style="s2">Is this how the Luo family heiress behaves</p>
<p begin="02:28:41.999" end="02:28:45.016" style="s2">Shouting about killing people</p>
<p begin="02:28:45.599" end="02:28:47.983" style="s2">Your Luo family is a prestigious clan</p>
<p begin="02:28:48.533" end="02:28:51.683" style="s2">Yet the younger generation is this arrogant</p>
<p begin="02:28:51.733" end="02:28:53.150" style="s2">Not knowing their place</p>
<p begin="02:28:53.599" end="02:28:56.650" style="s2">Does she even deserve to be the Luo family heir</p>
<p begin="02:28:58.266" end="02:28:59.683" style="s2">I feel so awful</p>
<p begin="02:29:00.266" end="02:29:01.416" style="s2">My throat hurts so much</p>
<p begin="02:29:02.266" end="02:29:04.883" style="s2">I feel like I can&#39;t breathe</p>
<p begin="02:29:05.066" end="02:29:07.583" style="s2">Luo Ying, this is a wealthy prestigious family</p>
<p begin="02:29:08.533" end="02:29:11.316" style="s2">Even though you&#39;re the granddaughter Old Master Luo was separated from for years</p>
<p begin="02:29:11.733" end="02:29:12.083" style="s2">But</p>
<p begin="02:29:12.666" end="02:29:15.450" style="s2">The law applies equally to everyone</p>
<p begin="02:29:16.533" end="02:29:18.883" style="s2">Even the ancients said so</p>
<p begin="02:29:19.066" end="02:29:20.750" style="s2">You should apologize to Luo Yafu right now</p>
<p begin="02:29:20.933" end="02:29:24.650" style="s2">Yes, apologize now, apologize</p>
<p begin="02:29:24.800" end="02:29:26.883" style="s2">Apologize, hurry up and apologize</p>
<p begin="02:29:27.200" end="02:29:29.949" style="s2">A young girl should learn something better</p>
<p begin="02:29:30.533" end="02:29:33.816" style="s2">Just as expected from the countryside, no manners no class</p>
<p begin="02:29:34.666" end="02:29:38.083" style="s2">A girl like this, how could she inherit the Luo family</p>
<p begin="02:29:38.133" end="02:29:39.150" style="s2">Exactly</p>
<p begin="02:29:41.066" end="02:29:42.349" style="s2">Mom, Mom</p>
<p begin="02:29:46.266" end="02:29:46.616" style="s2">This</p>
<p begin="02:29:53.733" end="02:29:55.316" style="s2">I don&#39;t know who was really in power</p>
<p begin="02:29:55.866" end="02:29:57.283" style="s2">In the Luo family before, openly or secretly</p>
<p begin="02:29:58.266" end="02:29:59.816" style="s2">And I, Luo Ying, don&#39;t want to know</p>
<p begin="02:30:00.533" end="02:30:01.150" style="s2">But</p>
<p begin="02:30:02.266" end="02:30:03.416" style="s2">From today on</p>
<p begin="02:30:04.133" end="02:30:06.483" style="s2">control of the Luo family returns to me</p>
<p begin="02:30:07.466" end="02:30:08.083" style="s2">Whoever objects</p>
<p begin="02:30:10.266" end="02:30:11.583" style="s2">can go to hell</p>
<p begin="02:30:11.999" end="02:30:12.783" style="s2">Dad</p>
<p begin="02:30:13.066" end="02:30:13.683" style="s2">You</p>
<p begin="02:30:24.533" end="02:30:25.150" style="s2">are too arrogant</p>
<p begin="02:30:26.133" end="02:30:28.883" style="s2">The Luo Group isn&#39;t something you can take over just by being ruthless</p>
<p begin="02:30:29.599" end="02:30:32.349" style="s2">I hold thirty-five percent of the group&#39;s shares</p>
<p begin="02:30:32.666" end="02:30:35.533" style="s2">I&#39;m the largest shareholder. Even if you inherit</p>
<p begin="02:30:35.699" end="02:30:38.883" style="s2">Grandpa&#39;s shares, you&#39;d only have thirty percent</p>
<p begin="02:30:40.133" end="02:30:43.416" style="s2">The remaining shares are scattered among the uncles</p>
<p begin="02:30:44.933" end="02:30:47.150" style="s2">According to shareholding ratio and the group&#39;s charter</p>
<p begin="02:30:47.866" end="02:30:49.949" style="s2">I, Luo Yunpeng</p>
<p begin="02:30:50.666" end="02:30:53.683" style="s2">am the legal person in charge</p>
<p begin="02:30:55.333" end="02:30:56.383" style="s2">Yunpeng is right</p>
<p begin="02:30:59.866" end="02:31:00.883" style="s2">I don&#39;t have enough shares</p>
<p begin="02:31:01.466" end="02:31:03.316" style="s2">Then just buy back all the rest</p>
<p begin="02:31:03.733" end="02:31:06.783" style="s2">Do you know how much it would cost</p>
<p begin="02:31:06.800" end="02:31:07.583" style="s2">to buy back the remaining shares from us</p>
<p begin="02:31:08.666" end="02:31:10.783" style="s2">It&#39;s nearly three billion US dollars</p>
<p begin="02:31:11.733" end="02:31:12.783" style="s2">An astronomical figure</p>
<p begin="02:31:13.466" end="02:31:15.683" style="s2">Three, three billion US dollars</p>
<p begin="02:31:15.999" end="02:31:18.349" style="s2">In RMB, that&#39;s over twenty billion yuan</p>
<p begin="02:31:18.800" end="02:31:19.949" style="s2">Dream on</p>
<p begin="02:31:20.133" end="02:31:22.349" style="s2">Even if you sold everything under your name</p>
<p begin="02:31:22.933" end="02:31:24.383" style="s2">you probably couldn&#39;t even cover a fraction</p>
<p begin="02:31:25.066" end="02:31:28.349" style="s2">Wanting to swallow the entire Luo Group whole is just a pipe dream</p>
<p begin="02:31:30.666" end="02:31:31.016" style="s2">Xiao Ying</p>
<p begin="02:31:32.400" end="02:31:33.816" style="s2">This isn&#39;t a small sum</p>
<p begin="02:31:34.533" end="02:31:36.883" style="s2">Don&#39;t put yourself in a tough spot. We&#39;ll think of another way</p>
<p begin="02:31:37.200" end="02:31:38.116" style="s2">Who says she doesn&#39;t have it</p>
<p begin="02:31:48.533" end="02:31:51.150" style="s2">Who is this? He looks imposing</p>
<p begin="02:31:51.599" end="02:31:52.483" style="s2">Commander Lu</p>
<p begin="02:31:53.733" end="02:31:57.016" style="s2">Only the leader of the Chiyan Legion is called Commander</p>
<p begin="02:31:57.333" end="02:31:59.416" style="s2">Could he be Lu Heng</p>
<p begin="02:32:04.800" end="02:32:07.016" style="s2">Doesn&#39;t the Chiyan Commander have severe OCD</p>
<p begin="02:32:07.466" end="02:32:09.983" style="s2">I heard last time a foreign royal princess tried to touch him</p>
<p begin="02:32:10.266" end="02:32:11.683" style="s2">and was thrown straight into a lion pit</p>
<p begin="02:32:12.533" end="02:32:14.383" style="s2">And now he&#39;s publicly holding Luo Ying</p>
<p begin="02:32:14.800" end="02:32:15.983" style="s2">What exactly is their relationship</p>
<p begin="02:32:17.599" end="02:32:19.016" style="s2">Luo Ying doesn&#39;t just have three billion</p>
<p begin="02:32:21.733" end="02:32:22.383" style="s2">She also has</p>
<p begin="02:32:34.400" end="02:32:35.183" style="s2">all of my assets</p>
<p begin="02:32:37.866" end="02:32:39.416" style="s2">Finally, your exam is over</p>
<p begin="02:32:40.133" end="02:32:41.283" style="s2">You&#39;re of marriageable age</p>
<p begin="02:32:42.400" end="02:32:43.050" style="s2">Little princess</p>
<p begin="02:32:43.999" end="02:32:44.916" style="s2">Will you marry me</p>
<p begin="02:32:47.999" end="02:32:49.183" style="s2">Do I have the right to refuse</p>
<p begin="02:32:51.999" end="02:32:52.650" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="02:33:02.133" end="02:33:03.050" style="s2">My little princess.</p>
<p begin="02:33:03.999" end="02:33:05.150" style="s2">From today on,</p>
<p begin="02:33:06.266" end="02:33:07.416" style="s2">I&#39;m willing to do anything for you.</p>
<p begin="02:33:08.133" end="02:33:10.516" style="s2">I thought the name Luo Ying sounded familiar earlier.</p>
<p begin="02:33:10.800" end="02:33:11.983" style="s2">Now I remember.</p>
<p begin="02:33:12.266" end="02:33:15.150" style="s2">Luo Ying is the top scorer in the college entrance exam in our Heilin City.</p>
<p begin="02:33:17.066" end="02:33:17.949" style="s2">Now,</p>
<p begin="02:33:18.666" end="02:33:20.249" style="s2">does anyone want to sell their shares to Luo Ying?</p>
<p begin="02:33:21.066" end="02:33:21.816" style="s2">Me!</p>
<p begin="02:33:22.400" end="02:33:23.900" style="s2">Miss Luo Ying, buy mine!</p>
<p begin="02:33:23.900" end="02:33:24.733" style="s2">Buy mine!</p>
<p begin="02:33:24.900" end="02:33:25.949" style="s2">I raised my hand first!</p>
<p begin="02:33:28.800" end="02:33:29.949" style="s2">From now on,</p>
<p begin="02:33:30.533" end="02:33:33.550" style="s2">I am the head of the Luo family. Does anyone</p>
<p begin="02:33:34.133" end="02:33:35.050" style="s2">have any objections?</p>
<p begin="02:33:35.866" end="02:33:37.866" style="s2">Greetings, President Luo. Greetings, President Luo.</p>
<p begin="02:33:37.966" end="02:33:39.150" style="s2">Greetings, President Luo.</p>
<p begin="02:33:43.333" end="02:33:45.983" style="s2">Yingying, meeting a good man like Lu Heng</p>
<p begin="02:33:47.066" end="02:33:48.249" style="s2">Xiaoman in heaven</p>
<p begin="02:33:49.466" end="02:33:50.249" style="s2">can rest in peace.</p>
<p begin="02:33:50.800" end="02:33:51.416" style="s2">Indeed.</p>
<p begin="02:33:52.400" end="02:33:54.750" style="s2">Our granddaughter is so outstanding,</p>
<p begin="02:33:55.333" end="02:33:59.416" style="s2">I can finally retire in peace.</p>
<p begin="02:34:00.933" end="02:34:01.550" style="s2">Zhiguo,</p>
<p begin="02:34:02.933" end="02:34:05.683" style="s2">remember to urge them to have kids soon.</p>
<p begin="02:34:06.533" end="02:34:09.283" style="s2">I&#39;m still waiting to hold my great-grandchild.</p>
<p begin="02:34:19.066" end="02:34:19.849" style="s2">There&#39;s one hour left.</p>
<p begin="02:34:21.066" end="02:34:21.683" style="s2">Come with me somewhere.</p>
<p begin="02:34:24.266" end="02:34:25.016" style="s2">Where are you going?</p>
<p begin="02:34:25.066" end="02:34:25.683" style="s2">I don&#39;t know.</p>
<p begin="02:34:30.800" end="02:34:32.916" style="s2">We could get the certificate tomorrow too, why must you</p>
<p begin="02:34:32.933" end="02:34:35.816" style="s2">rush this one hour? You even used a helicopter.</p>
<p begin="02:34:37.066" end="02:34:39.150" style="s2">I can&#39;t wait to make you mine,</p>
<p begin="02:34:40.266" end="02:34:41.683" style="s2">legitimately, with legal validity.</p>
<p begin="02:34:55.599" end="02:34:57.983" style="s2">This is too sudden.</p>
<p begin="02:35:01.599" end="02:35:03.016" style="s2">Lu Heng treats me very well.</p>
<p begin="02:35:03.200" end="02:35:05.183" style="s2">I&#39;m willing to entrust the rest of my life to him.</p>
<p begin="02:35:08.400" end="02:35:11.450" style="s2">As long as my daughter is happy, anything goes.</p>
<p begin="02:35:12.666" end="02:35:15.683" style="s2">Sister, you&#39;re way too impatient.</p>
<p begin="02:35:16.266" end="02:35:19.416" style="s2">What&#39;s the rush? Chief Lu treats our sister so well.</p>
<p begin="02:35:19.999" end="02:35:23.816" style="s2">The sooner you marry, the sooner I can be Chief Lu&#39;s second brother-in-law.</p>
<p begin="02:35:24.266" end="02:35:25.016" style="s2">Right, brother-in-law?</p>
<p begin="02:35:25.599" end="02:35:27.150" style="s2">Exactly, second brother-in-law.</p>
<p begin="02:35:29.200" end="02:35:31.983" style="s2">Chief Lu called me second brother-in-law. I&#39;m not dreaming.</p>
<p begin="02:35:33.200" end="02:35:34.783" style="s2">Um, Yingying,</p>
<p begin="02:35:35.599" end="02:35:37.849" style="s2">I&#39;m at ease entrusting you to him.</p>
<p begin="02:35:39.200" end="02:35:41.583" style="s2">After marriage, you&#39;ll be an adult.</p>
<p begin="02:35:42.400" end="02:35:45.183" style="s2">In the days ahead, don&#39;t take risks.</p>
<p begin="02:35:45.200" end="02:35:46.516" style="s2">Don&#39;t do dangerous things.</p>
<p begin="02:35:47.333" end="02:35:49.583" style="s2">If you have to do something dangerous,</p>
<p begin="02:35:50.266" end="02:35:53.016" style="s2">even if you don&#39;t tell Dad, at least tell Xiao Heng.</p>
<p begin="02:35:53.466" end="02:35:54.249" style="s2">Let Xiao Heng help you.</p>
<p begin="02:35:56.266" end="02:35:58.116" style="s2">You&#39;re right. If anything comes up,</p>
<p begin="02:35:58.266" end="02:35:59.150" style="s2">just tell Lu Heng.</p>
<p begin="02:35:59.999" end="02:36:01.283" style="s2">Don&#39;t go doing things on your own.</p>
<p begin="02:36:04.400" end="02:36:06.116" style="s2">One more thing.</p>
<p begin="02:36:08.933" end="02:36:10.383" style="s2">Then I&#39;ll just say it straight.</p>
<p begin="02:36:11.200" end="02:36:13.450" style="s2">You two, especially Yingying,</p>
<p begin="02:36:14.533" end="02:36:16.516" style="s2">don&#39;t just focus on your careers.</p>
<p begin="02:36:17.466" end="02:36:18.516" style="s2">I think</p>
<p begin="02:36:18.800" end="02:36:22.383" style="s2">what Xiaoman wants most is for you two to have a child.</p>
<p begin="02:36:23.866" end="02:36:25.416" style="s2">Hurry up.</p>
<p begin="02:36:25.466" end="02:36:28.783" style="s2">Skip the contraception.</p>
<p begin="02:36:29.866" end="02:36:32.516" style="s2">Having a child, I&#39;m sure Xiaoman</p>
<p begin="02:36:32.533" end="02:36:34.916" style="s2">would be so happy up in heaven.</p>
<p begin="02:36:40.400" end="02:36:43.183" style="s2">The way you talk, it&#39;s like he&#39;s the head of this household.</p>
<p begin="02:36:45.066" end="02:36:45.416" style="s2">Okay.</p>
<p begin="02:36:47.333" end="02:36:48.083" style="s2">Alright.</p>
<p begin="02:36:48.800" end="02:36:51.000" style="s2">I&#39;ll go cook a few dishes, and we&#39;ll have a drink together.</p>
<p begin="02:36:51.166" end="02:36:53.316" style="s2">Stay the night here tonight.</p>
<p begin="02:36:54.400" end="02:36:55.016" style="s2">Sure.</p>
<p begin="02:37:05.866" end="02:37:06.516" style="s2">My princess,</p>
<p begin="02:37:07.866" end="02:37:09.183" style="s2">may I exercise my rights as a husband?</p>
<p begin="02:37:10.400" end="02:37:12.916" style="s2">How come I never noticed you talk so much before?</p>
<p begin="02:37:20.533" end="02:37:21.150" style="s2">Wait.</p>
<p begin="02:37:24.933" end="02:37:26.249" style="s2">There&#39;s something under the blanket.</p>
<p begin="02:37:27.866" end="02:37:29.550" style="s2">You even prepared peanuts and red dates.</p>
<p begin="02:37:35.599" end="02:37:36.483" style="s2">Are you trying to assassinate me?</p>
<p begin="02:37:40.800" end="02:37:41.416" style="s2">No fun.</p>
<p begin="02:37:42.666" end="02:37:43.983" style="s2">This is the gift I prepared for you.</p>
<p begin="02:37:47.466" end="02:37:49.000" style="s2">Who on earth, on their marriage registration day,</p>
<p begin="02:37:49.166" end="02:37:52.083" style="s2">gives the bride guns, ammo, and knives?</p>
<p begin="02:37:54.133" end="02:37:55.583" style="s2">They&#39;re all your favorite things.</p>
<p begin="02:37:56.533" end="02:37:57.816" style="s2">What matters in a gift is the thought.</p>
<p begin="02:38:12.533" end="02:38:14.216" style="s2">Are you ready to serve me?</p>
<p begin="02:38:17.599" end="02:38:18.516" style="s2">Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="02:38:20.133" end="02:38:20.650" style="s2">seduce me.</p>
<p begin="02:38:22.400" end="02:38:24.483" style="s2">Don&#39;t underestimate the combat power of the number one assassin.</p>
<p begin="02:38:25.066" end="02:38:27.816" style="s2">Otherwise, the one who can&#39;t get out of bed tomorrow</p>
<p begin="02:38:28.133" end="02:38:28.783" style="s2">will be you.</p>
<p begin="02:38:36.400" end="02:38:37.050" style="s2">I&#39;ll be waiting to see.</p>
<p begin="02:38:39.866" end="02:38:40.650" style="s2">My girl,</p>
<p begin="02:38:41.466" end="02:38:42.650" style="s2">you finally</p>
<p begin="02:38:43.733" end="02:38:44.650" style="s2">belong completely to me.</p>
<p begin="02:38:51.200" end="02:38:54.199" style="s2">Chief, there&#39;s a very urgent matter within the legion.</p>
<p begin="02:38:54.366" end="02:38:55.683" style="s2">You need to handle it immediately.</p>
<p begin="02:38:56.400" end="02:38:56.750" style="s2">Get lost.</p>
<p begin="02:38:57.466" end="02:38:58.750" style="s2">Go spend a month in the Antarctic Circle.</p>
<p begin="02:39:02.400" end="02:39:03.183" style="s2">Yes.</p>
<p begin="02:39:19.733" end="02:39:22.516" style="s2">My waist and legs hurt so much.</p>
<p begin="02:39:22.533" end="02:39:25.450" style="s2">Worse than the brutal training at Hunter School back then.</p>
<p begin="02:39:26.800" end="02:39:29.450" style="s2">This bed is the deadliest weapon—can&#39;t stay long.</p>
<p begin="02:39:34.266" end="02:39:34.783" style="s2">Again.</p>
<p begin="02:39:36.400" end="02:39:37.316" style="s2">Still coming?</p>
<p begin="02:39:38.400" end="02:39:40.650" style="s2">Lu Heng, I was wrong. Can you let me go?</p>
<p begin="02:39:42.133" end="02:39:43.316" style="s2">You have no right to refuse.</p>
<p begin="02:39:48.133" end="02:39:51.416" style="s2">Leader of the Crimson Flame Legion, the world&#39;s number one ace assassin, Rakshasa.</p>
<p begin="02:39:51.999" end="02:39:54.383" style="s2">Guess which of these two is stronger.</p>
<p begin="02:39:54.533" end="02:39:57.183" style="s2">Leader of the Crimson Flame Legion, real name unknown.</p>
<p begin="02:39:57.466" end="02:39:59.983" style="s2">Nationality unknown, age unknown.</p>
<p begin="02:39:59.999" end="02:40:02.650" style="s2">Male, the world&#39;s number one ace assassin, Rakshasa.</p>
<p begin="02:40:03.066" end="02:40:04.916" style="s2">Real name unknown, nationality unknown.</p>
<p begin="02:40:05.200" end="02:40:07.050" style="s2">Age unknown, gender unknown.</p>
<p begin="02:40:08.133" end="02:40:10.750" style="s2">From this view, still Rakshasa.</p>
<p begin="02:40:10.800" end="02:40:12.750" style="s2">More mysterious and more powerful.</p>
<p begin="02:40:12.800" end="02:40:14.650" style="s2">If we go by the world&#39;s number one ace assassin</p>
<p begin="02:40:14.666" end="02:40:17.583" style="s2">Rakshasa&#39;s past record, I personally still lean toward</p>
<p begin="02:40:18.133" end="02:40:20.650" style="s2">the claim that the Crimson Flame Legion leader is stronger.</p>
<p begin="02:40:21.466" end="02:40:22.116" style="s2">Why?</p>
<p begin="02:40:23.599" end="02:40:25.583" style="s2">Because Rakshasa is just one person.</p>
<p begin="02:40:26.666" end="02:40:29.849" style="s2">She&#39;s just an assassin in an international assassin organization.</p>
<p begin="02:40:30.400" end="02:40:32.483" style="s2">They say ordinary people can&#39;t beat capitalists.</p>
<p begin="02:40:32.800" end="02:40:34.249" style="s2">And the Crimson Flame Legion leader—</p>
<p begin="02:40:34.400" end="02:40:37.583" style="s2">he&#39;s not alone; he has a whole legion behind him.</p>
<p begin="02:40:38.133" end="02:40:40.783" style="s2">If you insist on comparing the two,</p>
<p begin="02:40:41.066" end="02:40:43.316" style="s2">setting aside their personal combat ability,</p>
<p begin="02:40:43.599" end="02:40:46.383" style="s2">Rakshasa is merely an employee in the Blood Shadow organization,</p>
<p begin="02:40:47.066" end="02:40:50.349" style="s2">while the Crimson Flame Legion leader is already a capitalist.</p>
<p begin="02:40:51.733" end="02:40:55.183" style="s2">Do you think it&#39;s possible that Rakshasa is a woman?</p>
<p begin="02:40:55.466" end="02:40:58.750" style="s2">And the Crimson Flame Legion leader happens to like Rakshasa?</p>
<p begin="02:40:58.933" end="02:41:01.583" style="s2">In that case, who would be stronger?</p>
<p begin="02:41:03.200" end="02:41:05.183" style="s2">Your imagination is way too wild.</p>
<p begin="02:41:05.333" end="02:41:06.650" style="s2">No, I&#39;m just curious.</p>
<p begin="02:41:07.200" end="02:41:08.516" style="s2">You&#39;re really curious.</p>
<p begin="02:41:09.599" end="02:41:12.750" style="s2">Isn&#39;t there an old saying—beautiful women cause trouble?</p>
<p begin="02:41:13.066" end="02:41:16.883" style="s2">If you ask me, if Rakshasa really is a woman,</p>
<p begin="02:41:17.066" end="02:41:20.083" style="s2">and the Crimson Flame Legion leader really likes her,</p>
<p begin="02:41:21.999" end="02:41:23.849" style="s2">if Rakshasa really were a bad woman,</p>
<p begin="02:41:24.133" end="02:41:26.516" style="s2">the Crimson Flame Legion leader would&#39;ve been done for long ago.</p>
<p begin="02:41:27.333" end="02:41:30.116" style="s2">Taking advantage of his feelings, she could stir things up again.</p>
<p begin="02:41:30.133" end="02:41:32.383" style="s2">The Crimson Flame Legion would&#39;ve long been Rakshasa&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="02:41:33.066" end="02:41:33.949" style="s2">I think</p>
<p begin="02:41:34.666" end="02:41:35.949" style="s2">what you said makes some sense.</p>
<p begin="02:41:36.666" end="02:41:38.249" style="s2">Maybe that&#39;s how it is in reality.</p>
<p begin="02:41:39.066" end="02:41:39.716" style="s2">Who are you?</p>
<p begin="02:41:55.599" end="02:41:58.349" style="s2">We&#39;re the instructors specially invited by Captain Deng Zhiguo.</p>
<p begin="02:41:58.800" end="02:42:01.283" style="s2">From now on, I&#39;m in charge of your training.</p>
<p begin="02:42:01.466" end="02:42:02.083" style="s2">Fall in!</p>
<p begin="02:42:05.599" end="02:42:06.650" style="s2">Hello, Instructor.</p>
<p begin="02:42:07.066" end="02:42:08.483" style="s2">My surname is Luo, my name is Luo Ying.</p>
<p begin="02:42:09.200" end="02:42:10.083" style="s2">He</p>
<p begin="02:42:11.599" end="02:42:12.333" style="s2">The name doesn&#39;t matter.</p>
<p begin="02:42:12.500" end="02:42:13.716" style="s2">Hello, Instructor Luo.</p>
<p begin="02:42:14.400" end="02:42:17.016" style="s2">From now on, everyone carries twenty kilograms.</p>
<p begin="02:42:17.200" end="02:42:18.616" style="s2">Climb to the top of the mountain within one hour.</p>
<p begin="02:42:19.066" end="02:42:19.849" style="s2">Those who can&#39;t do it</p>
<p begin="02:42:20.133" end="02:42:22.083" style="s2">will go back and do an extra five-kilometer cross-country training.</p>
<p begin="02:42:22.266" end="02:42:24.066" style="s2">Twenty kilograms is too much.</p>
<p begin="02:42:24.233" end="02:42:25.316" style="s2">No one can do it.</p>
<p begin="02:42:25.333" end="02:42:26.616" style="s2">Reach the top within one hour.</p>
<p begin="02:42:27.200" end="02:42:29.450" style="s2">Instructor, reduce the load for us.</p>
<p begin="02:42:29.466" end="02:42:30.516" style="s2">Please.</p>
<p begin="02:42:30.666" end="02:42:31.716" style="s2">No more nonsense.</p>
<p begin="02:42:32.266" end="02:42:34.650" style="s2">Execute immediately, or else</p>
<p begin="02:42:35.599" end="02:42:37.050" style="s2">My queen is angry.</p>
<p begin="02:42:37.999" end="02:42:39.050" style="s2">The consequences are severe.</p>
<p begin="02:42:39.599" end="02:42:40.516" style="s2">Turn right.</p>
<p begin="02:42:41.733" end="02:42:42.249" style="s2">Target: warehouse.</p>
<p begin="02:42:42.666" end="02:42:43.416" style="s2">Run.</p>
<p begin="02:42:43.466" end="02:42:43.849" style="s2">Go.</p>
<p begin="02:42:47.733" end="02:42:48.750" style="s2">My little princess</p>
<p begin="02:42:49.333" end="02:42:50.216" style="s2">is always the best.</p>
<p begin="02:42:51.200" end="02:42:52.349" style="s2">You just know how to say nice things.</p>
<p begin="02:43:00.133" end="02:43:00.516" style="s2">Luo Ying.</p>
<p begin="02:43:01.066" end="02:43:03.816" style="s2">The Kowloon Chamber of Commerce will hold a summit meeting at the harbor.</p>
<p begin="02:43:03.999" end="02:43:06.483" style="s2">Intelligence shows dangerous targets have infiltrated.</p>
<p begin="02:43:06.533" end="02:43:07.949" style="s2">This is a top-level mission.</p>
<p begin="02:43:08.400" end="02:43:10.349" style="s2">You are ordered to stop your current activities immediately.</p>
<p begin="02:43:10.666" end="02:43:11.583" style="s2">Return to the team at once.</p>
<p begin="02:43:11.866" end="02:43:13.166" style="s2">Understood, I&#39;ll return to the team immediately.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
